/* 高中便携版的例句（第六十次优化），按词条编号 i 存，并进 IELTS_RICH（rich() 先查它，编号和单词都对得上才用）。
   大部分沿用新版高中词汇 / 四级两本书里同一个词的例句，其余是整理时新写的，见 src/gzb/Lxx.tsv。 */
window.IELTS_RICH=window.IELTS_RICH||{};Object.assign(window.IELTS_RICH,{
49001:{"w":"similar","e":"My sister and I have very similar tastes in music, food and clothes.","t":"我和姐姐在音乐、食物和衣服上的品味非常**相似**。"},
49002:{"w":"familiar","e":"The song sounded familiar, but I could not remember its name.","t":"这首歌听起来很**熟悉**，但我想不起它的名字了。"},
49003:{"w":"particular","e":"Is there any particular reason why you chose to study French?","t":"你选择学法语有什么**特殊**原因吗？"},
49004:{"w":"regular","e":"Regular exercise keeps you healthy and helps you sleep better.","t":"**经常**锻炼能让你保持健康，睡得更好。"},
49005:{"w":"frequent","e":"Frequent failures did not affect his morale.","t":"**屡屡**失败并未让他泄气。"},
49006:{"w":"merely","e":"It is not a big problem; it is merely a small mistake in the date.","t":"这不是大问题，**只不过**是日期上的一个小错误。"},
49007:{"w":"final","e":"This is the final bus of the day, so we must hurry.","t":"这是今天的**最后**一班公共汽车，我们得快点。"},
49008:{"w":"eventually","e":"After many failed tries, she eventually passed the driving test.","t":"失败了好几次之后，她**最终**通过了驾驶考试。"},
49009:{"w":"event","e":"Your graduation from college is an important event.","t":"你大学毕业了，这是件**大事**。"},
49010:{"w":"frighten","e":"Don't frighten the baby with that loud toy.","t":"别用那个吵闹的玩具**吓唬**宝宝。"},
49011:{"w":"fair","e":"It isn't fair that some students get more time than others.","t":"有些学生比别的学生时间多，这不**公平**。"},
49012:{"w":"concern","e":"What most concerns me is I'm still not doing very well on my homework.","t":"最让我**担心**的是我现在还不能很好地完成家庭作业。"},
49013:{"w":"reason","e":"Please tell me the reason why you were late for class.","t":"请告诉我你上课迟到的**原因**。"},
49014:{"w":"reasonable","e":"I think you'll find the methods very reasonable.","t":"我认为你会觉得这些方法很**合理**。"},
49015:{"w":"proper","e":"It is important to use the proper tools when you repair a bicycle.","t":"修自行车时，用**合适的**工具很重要。"},
49016:{"w":"equal","e":"Boys and girls should have equal chances to learn and to play sports.","t":"男孩和女孩应该有**平等**的机会学习和做运动。"},
49017:{"w":"equality","e":"Many people have fought for equality between men and women at work.","t":"许多人一直在为职场上的男女**平等**而奋斗。"},
49018:{"w":"act","e":"The doctor had to act fast to save the boy's life.","t":"医生必须迅速**行动**，才能挽救这个男孩的生命。"},
49019:{"w":"react","e":"How did your parents react when you told them you wanted to study abroad?","t":"你告诉父母想出国留学时，他们有什么**反应**？"},
49020:{"w":"action","e":"We must take action now to protect our rivers and lakes from pollution.","t":"我们必须现在就采取**行动**，保护河流和湖泊免受污染。"},
49021:{"w":"active","e":"My grandfather is still very active and goes swimming three times a week.","t":"我爷爷仍然很**活跃**，每周游泳三次。"},
49022:{"w":"activity","e":"The school offers many after-class activities, such as music, painting and basketball.","t":"学校提供许多课外**活动**，比如音乐、绘画和篮球。"},
49023:{"w":"alive","e":"The doctors were glad that the little boy was still alive after the accident.","t":"医生们很高兴那个小男孩在事故之后还**活着**。"},
49024:{"w":"wake","e":"Please wake me up at six tomorrow morning.","t":"请明天早上六点**叫醒**我。"},
49025:{"w":"awake","e":"The baby was awake all night and cried a lot.","t":"宝宝整夜都**醒着**，哭得很厉害。"},
49026:{"w":"aware","e":"Are you aware that the shop closes at five on Sundays?","t":"你**知道**星期天这家店五点关门吗？"},
49027:{"w":"asleep","e":"The baby was fast asleep in her mother's arms.","t":"婴儿在妈妈怀里**熟睡**着。"},
49028:{"w":"able","e":"My sister is able to play both the piano and the violin.","t":"我姐姐**能**弹钢琴，也能拉小提琴。"},
49029:{"w":"ability","e":"Classes are organised according to ability level.","t":"根据**能力**水平进行分班。"},
49030:{"w":"disabled","e":"He got disabled during the war.","t":"他在战争中落下了**残疾**。"},
49031:{"w":"available","e":"We hope that ostrich meat will be available soon and before long will be as cheap as beef.","t":"我们希望不久就可以**买到**鸵鸟肉，而且希望它的价格不久就会变得和牛肉一样便宜。"},
49032:{"w":"appoint","e":"The company appointed a young woman as its new manager.","t":"公司**任命**了一位年轻女士担任新经理。"},
49033:{"w":"appointment","e":"I have an appointment with the dentist at three o'clock tomorrow afternoon.","t":"我明天下午三点和牙医有个**预约**。"},
49034:{"w":"disappoint","e":"I don't want to disappoint my parents, so I will study harder.","t":"我不想让父母**失望**，所以我会更努力地学习。"},
49035:{"w":"disappointed","e":"She was disappointed that her best friend could not come to the party.","t":"她最好的朋友不能来参加聚会，她感到很**失望**。"},
49036:{"w":"vital","e":"The Department has a vital role to play in providing information to visitors and scholars.","t":"该部门在为来访者及学者提供信息方面发挥着**极其重要**的作用。"},
49037:{"w":"special","e":"My grandmother made a special cake for my birthday last week.","t":"上周，奶奶为我的生日做了一个**特别的**蛋糕。"},
49038:{"w":"especially","e":"I love fruit, especially oranges and strawberries.","t":"我喜欢水果，**尤其**是橙子和草莓。"},
49039:{"w":"specific","e":"Please give me a specific time and place for the meeting.","t":"请告诉我会议**明确的**时间和地点。"},
49040:{"w":"actual","e":"The actual cost was much higher than the price on the sign.","t":"**实际**费用比标牌上的价格高得多。"},
49041:{"w":"actually","e":"He looks calm, but actually he is very nervous about the match.","t":"他看起来很平静，但**实际上**他对这场比赛非常紧张。"},
49042:{"w":"strange","e":"It is strange that he did not answer his phone all day.","t":"他一整天都没接电话，真**奇怪**。"},
49043:{"w":"partly","e":"The match was cancelled partly because of the rain.","t":"比赛被取消，**部分原因**是下雨。"},
49044:{"w":"least","e":"Our team has the least experience, but we are learning fast.","t":"我们队的经验**最少**，但学得很快。"},
49045:{"w":"simple","e":"The rules of this game are simple, so even children can play it.","t":"这个游戏的规则很**简单**，连孩子都会玩。"},
49046:{"w":"simplify","e":"These self-help books are designed for people who want to simplify their lives.","t":"这些自助书籍是为那些想**简化**生活的人设计的。"},
49047:{"w":"true","e":"Is it true that your cousin can speak four different languages?","t":"你表弟会说四种不同的语言，这是**真的**吗？"},
49048:{"w":"false","e":"The news turned out to be false, and everyone felt relieved.","t":"这个消息最后证明是**假的**，大家都松了一口气。"},
49049:{"w":"instead","e":"Tom was ill, so his sister went to the meeting instead.","t":"汤姆生病了，所以他姐姐**代替**他去开了会。"},
49050:{"w":"nature","e":"We spent the weekend in the countryside, enjoying the beauty of nature.","t":"我们在乡下过周末，欣赏**大自然**的美。"},
49051:{"w":"natural","e":"It's natural for an old man of his age to be so calm.","t":"处于他这般年纪的老人如此镇静是很**自然**的。"},
49052:{"w":"weather","e":"The weather was so bad that we had to stay at home all weekend.","t":"**天气**太糟糕了，我们整个周末只好待在家里。"},
49053:{"w":"climate","e":"The climate here is mild, with warm summers and cool, wet winters.","t":"这里的**气候**温和，夏季温暖，冬季凉爽多雨。"},
49054:{"w":"normal","e":"It is normal to feel nervous before an important exam.","t":"重要考试前感到紧张是**正常**的。"},
49055:{"w":"highly","e":"This doctor is highly respected by her patients because she always listens carefully to them.","t":"这位医生**非常**受病人尊敬，因为她总是认真倾听他们的话。"},
49056:{"w":"serious","e":"The doctor looked serious when he read the test results.","t":"医生看检查结果时神情**严肃**。"},
49057:{"w":"pollute","e":"Waste water from the factory has polluted the river, and most of the fish have died.","t":"工厂排出的废水**污染**了这条河，大部分鱼都死了。"},
49058:{"w":"pollution","e":"Air pollution is increasingly becoming the focus of government and citizen concern around the globe.","t":"大气**污染**正逐渐成为全球范围内政府和市民所关注的焦点。"},
49059:{"w":"official","e":"English and French are both official languages of Canada, a large country in North America.","t":"英语和法语都是加拿大的**官方**语言，加拿大是北美的一个大国。"},
49060:{"w":"government","e":"The government plans to build more schools in the countryside.","t":"**政府**计划在农村多建一些学校。"},
49061:{"w":"govern","e":"A small group of elders governs this village and settles any arguments.","t":"一小群长者**管理**着这个村子，并调解各种争端。"},
49062:{"w":"altogether","e":"There are fifty students altogether in our class this year.","t":"今年我们班**总共**有五十名学生。"},
49063:{"w":"protect","e":"Wearing sunglasses can protect your eyes from the harmful ultraviolet rays of the sun.","t":"戴太阳镜可以**保护**你的眼睛免受太阳有害紫外线的伤害。"},
49064:{"w":"protection","e":"Wearing a helmet gives riders good protection against serious head injuries in an accident.","t":"戴头盔能为骑车人提供很好的**保护**，防止他们在事故中头部受重伤。"},
49065:{"w":"rare","e":"The giant panda is a rare animal that lives mainly in the mountains of China.","t":"大熊猫是一种**稀有**动物，主要生活在中国的山区。"},
49066:{"w":"pretty","e":"The garden is full of pretty flowers in spring.","t":"春天花园里开满了**漂亮的**花。"},
49067:{"w":"earn","e":"He earns some extra money by delivering newspapers at weekends.","t":"他周末送报纸，**赚**些额外的钱。"},
49068:{"w":"gain","e":"You can gain a lot of experience by working as a volunteer.","t":"做志愿者可以**获得**很多经验。"},
49069:{"w":"win","e":"Our team won the football match by three goals.","t":"我们队以三个球的优势**赢得**了足球比赛。"},
49070:{"w":"obtain","e":"He worked hard to obtain a place at a good university.","t":"他努力学习，**获得**了一所好大学的入学资格。"},
49071:{"w":"found","e":"The school was founded in 1950 by a group of teachers.","t":"这所学校是1950年由一群教师**创办**的。"},
49072:{"w":"consider","e":"We should consider all the facts before we make a decision.","t":"做决定之前，我们应该**考虑**所有的事实。"},
49073:{"w":"confirm","e":"Please call the hotel to confirm your booking before you leave.","t":"出发前请给酒店打电话**确认**你的预订。"},
49074:{"w":"clear","e":"The teacher's instructions were clear, so everyone knew what to do.","t":"老师的指示很**清楚**，所以每个人都知道该做什么。"},
49075:{"w":"plan","e":"We plan to visit the science museum next Tuesday with our class.","t":"我们**打算**下周二和全班同学一起去参观科学馆。"},
49076:{"w":"predict","e":"The United Nations predicts that the global population may stabilise between 8 and 14 billion in the twenty-first century.","t":"联合国**预言**，在21世纪全球人口将稳定在80亿到140亿之间。"},
49077:{"w":"contribute","e":"Industrial emissions and automobile exhausts contribute to heavy pollution.","t":"工业排放物和汽车尾气共同**造成**了重度污染。"},
49078:{"w":"submit","e":"Please submit your homework to the teacher before Friday.","t":"请在星期五之前把作业**交**给老师。"},
49079:{"w":"promise","e":"The dark clouds promise rain.","t":"乌云密布**预示**有雨。"},
49080:{"w":"pretend","e":"Many people pretend that they understand modern art.","t":"很多人都**假装**自己懂得现代艺术。"},
49081:{"w":"fade","e":"His smile faded as he heard the answer.","t":"听到这个答案，他脸上的笑容**渐渐消失**了。"},
49082:{"w":"attempt","e":"She made an attempt to climb the wall, but it was too high.","t":"她**试图**爬过那堵墙，但墙太高了。"},
49083:{"w":"doubt","e":"I have no doubt that our team will win the match tomorrow.","t":"我毫不**怀疑**我们队明天会赢得比赛。"},
49084:{"w":"double","e":"The price of the ticket has doubled since last year.","t":"票价比去年**翻了一倍**。"},
49085:{"w":"suspect","e":"Scientists suspected it to be a comet.","t":"科学家**怀疑**它是一颗彗星。"},
49086:{"w":"respect","e":"I respect you for your honesty.","t":"因为你为人诚实，所以我**尊敬**你。"},
49087:{"w":"inspect","e":"Workers inspect every car before it leaves the factory.","t":"工人在汽车出厂前会**检查**每一辆车。"},
49088:{"w":"expect","e":"We expect the new library to open to students next September.","t":"我们**预计**新图书馆明年九月向学生开放。"},
49089:{"w":"fond","e":"My grandmother is very fond of growing flowers in her garden.","t":"我奶奶非常**喜爱**在花园里种花。"},
49090:{"w":"invite","e":"She invited all her classmates to her birthday party.","t":"她**邀请**了所有同学来参加她的生日聚会。"},
49091:{"w":"persuade","e":"I had tried my best to persuade Bob to join the club.","t":"我竭尽全力**说服**鲍勃加入俱乐部。"},
49092:{"w":"support","e":"My parents have always supported my dream of becoming a doctor, even when it seemed hard.","t":"我父母一直**支持**我当医生的梦想，即使在看起来很难的时候。"},
49093:{"w":"request","e":"I'd like to make a request for leave.","t":"我想**请求**离开一下。"},
49094:{"w":"search","e":"The police began to search the forest for the missing boy.","t":"警方开始在森林里**搜寻**那个失踪的男孩。"},
49095:{"w":"research","e":"Scientists are doing research on how bees find flowers.","t":"科学家们正在**研究**蜜蜂是怎样找到花的。"},
49096:{"w":"excuse","e":"He gave a poor excuse for being late, and the teacher was not happy.","t":"他为迟到找了个蹩脚的**借口**，老师不太高兴。"},
49097:{"w":"apology","e":"He made an apology to his teacher for being rude in class the day before.","t":"他为前一天在课上的无礼向老师**道歉**。"},
49098:{"w":"apologise","e":"Tom apologised to his teacher for being late for class again this morning.","t":"汤姆因为今天早上上课又迟到，向老师**道歉**了。"},
49099:{"w":"regret","e":"I regret not studying harder when I was in middle school.","t":"我**后悔**初中时没有更努力地学习。"},
49100:{"w":"anger","e":"His face turned red with anger when he heard the news.","t":"听到这个消息，他的脸因**愤怒**而涨红了。"},
49101:{"w":"rude","e":"It is rude to talk loudly on your phone while others are reading in the library.","t":"别人在图书馆看书时大声打电话是很**不礼貌**的。"},
49102:{"w":"panic","e":"Please don't panic; the fire alarm is only a test.","t":"请别**惊慌**，这只是火警警报的测试。"},
49103:{"w":"pain","e":"He felt a sharp pain in his leg after the football match.","t":"足球赛后，他感到腿上一阵剧烈的**疼痛**。"},
49104:{"w":"painful","e":"My knee was so painful after the race that I could hardly walk home.","t":"跑完比赛后我的膝盖非常**疼痛**，几乎走不回家。"},
49105:{"w":"desperate","e":"The lost hikers were desperate when their food and water ran out.","t":"食物和水都用完时，迷路的徒步者们感到**绝望**。"},
49106:{"w":"laughter","e":"The room was filled with laughter when the little boy began to dance.","t":"小男孩开始跳舞时，房间里充满了**笑声**。"},
49107:{"w":"silent","e":"She stayed silent when the teacher asked her why she was late.","t":"老师问她为什么迟到，她一直**沉默**。"},
49108:{"w":"lively","e":"The street was lively on Saturday night, full of music and people.","t":"星期六晚上，街上很**热闹**，到处是音乐和人群。"},
49109:{"w":"vivid","e":"She gave such a vivid description of the city that I felt I had been there.","t":"她把那座城市描述得非常**生动**，我感觉自己好像去过那里。"},
49110:{"w":"friendship","e":"Their friendship began when they sat next to each other in primary school.","t":"他们的**友谊**始于小学时坐在彼此旁边。"},
49111:{"w":"character","e":"The interview does give you a bit of information about an applicant's character.","t":"面试确实能给你提供一些和应聘者**性格**有关的信息。"},
49112:{"w":"characteristic","e":"Many characteristics, such as height and intelligence, result not from the action of genes alone.","t":"诸如身高、智力等这些**特征**并不完全是基因作用的结果。"},
49113:{"w":"instruct","e":"PE teachers instruct students how to exercise, play sports, and do other recreational activities correctly and safely.","t":"体育老师**指导**学生们如何安全正确地锻炼、做运动以及进行其他娱乐活动。"},
49114:{"w":"instruction","e":"The students must follow all instructions exactly.","t":"学生必须准确遵守所有的**指示**。"},
49115:{"w":"reputation","e":"The college has already established a national reputation for its excellence.","t":"该校凭借着自己的卓越表现已经**享誉**全国。"},
49116:{"w":"preference","e":"Many people expressed a strong preference for the original plan.","t":"许多人强烈表示**喜欢**原先的计划。"},
49117:{"w":"nowadays","e":"Nowadays many students use tablets instead of paper books in class.","t":"**如今**，许多学生在课堂上用平板电脑代替纸质书。"},
49118:{"w":"decade","e":"In Tokyo builders are planning a massive underground city to be begun in the next decade.","t":"在东京，建筑师们正计划在今后的**十年**里大规模兴建地下城。"},
49119:{"w":"urban","e":"The concentration of vehicles makes air quality in urban areas unpleasant.","t":"汽车大量集中在**市**区，使得这里的空气污浊不堪。"},
49120:{"w":"safety","e":"Wearing a seat belt is important for your safety in a car.","t":"系安全带对你在车里的**安全**很重要。"},
49121:{"w":"vehicle","e":"No vehicles are allowed to enter the city center on weekends, so people walk or cycle.","t":"周末所有**车辆**都不许进入市中心，所以人们步行或骑车。"},
49122:{"w":"wheel","e":"One wheel came off the cart, so we had to stop.","t":"一个**车轮**从小车上掉了下来，所以我们只好停下。"},
49123:{"w":"civil","e":"Everyone has the civil right to speak freely and to vote in an election.","t":"每个人都有言论自由和在选举中投票的**公民**权利。"},
49124:{"w":"civilian","e":"Many civilians lost their homes during the war, though they had nothing to do with the fighting.","t":"战争期间，许多**平民**失去了家园，尽管他们与战斗毫无关系。"},
49125:{"w":"civilisation","e":"Ancient Egypt was one of the earliest civilisations, famous for its pyramids and temples.","t":"古埃及是最早的**文明**之一，以金字塔和神庙闻名。"},
49126:{"w":"disaster","e":"The flood was a disaster for the village, destroying hundreds of homes and farms.","t":"这场洪水对村子来说是一场**灾难**，毁掉了数百座房屋和农田。"},
49127:{"w":"preparation","e":"The team has been training hard in preparation for the big game.","t":"为了**准备**这场重要比赛，球队一直在刻苦训练。"},
49128:{"w":"arise","e":"Problems may arise if you don't read the instructions carefully before you start.","t":"如果开始之前不仔细阅读说明，就可能**出现**问题。"},
49129:{"w":"raise","e":"Please raise your hand if you know the answer to this question.","t":"如果你知道这个问题的答案，请**举**手。"},
49130:{"w":"rise","e":"The price of vegetables has risen sharply this winter.","t":"今年冬天蔬菜的价格**上涨**得很厉害。"},
49131:{"w":"encourage","e":"Her teacher always encourages her to try new things.","t":"老师总是**鼓励**她尝试新事物。"},
49132:{"w":"discourage","e":"Heavy rain discouraged many people from going to the football match on Saturday.","t":"周六的大雨**阻止**了很多人去看足球赛。"},
49133:{"w":"courage","e":"It takes great courage to speak in front of the whole school.","t":"在全校师生面前讲话需要很大的**勇气**。"},
49134:{"w":"increase","e":"The number of students choosing to study abroad has increased sharply over the past ten years.","t":"过去十年里，选择出国留学的学生人数大幅**增长**。"},
49135:{"w":"decrease","e":"Do you think the cinema has increased or decreased in popularity in recent years?","t":"你认为近年来电影受欢迎的程度是提高了还是**降低**了？"},
49136:{"w":"improve","e":"Reading English books every day will help you improve your vocabulary.","t":"每天读英文书会帮你**提高**词汇量。"},
49137:{"w":"promote","e":"The band has gone on tour to promote their new album.","t":"这个乐队已开始巡回**宣传**他们的新唱片。"},
49138:{"w":"accelerate","e":"The leader lost ground as the rest of the runners accelerated.","t":"领先者在其余赛跑者**加速**时逐渐失去了优势。"},
49139:{"w":"develop","e":"When a country develops its technology, the traditional skills and ways of life die out.","t":"一个国家在**发展**技术的同时，会造成传统手工艺和原有生活方式的消亡。"},
49140:{"w":"development","e":"The development of new technology has changed the way we live.","t":"新技术的**发展**改变了我们的生活方式。"},
49141:{"w":"growth","e":"Children need enough sleep and healthy food every day for their normal growth.","t":"孩子们每天需要充足的睡眠和健康的食物来保证正常**生长**。"},
49142:{"w":"perform","e":"The school band will perform at the city theatre next Saturday.","t":"学校乐队下周六将在市剧院**演出**。"},
49143:{"w":"performance","e":"Profits continue to grow, with strong performance in Asia and South America.","t":"利润持续增长，其中亚洲及南美市场**表现**尤为强劲。"},
49144:{"w":"excellent","e":"Her English is excellent, so she often wins speech contests.","t":"她的英语**好极了**，所以经常在演讲比赛中获奖。"},
49145:{"w":"surface","e":"It seems like a difficult problem on the surface, but in fact it is easy to solve.","t":"这个问题**表面**上看起来很难，但实际上很容易解决。"},
49146:{"w":"voice","e":"She has a beautiful voice and often sings in the school choir.","t":"她有一副动听的**嗓音**，常在学校合唱团里唱歌。"},
49147:{"w":"language","e":"Learning a new language takes a lot of time and patience.","t":"学一门新**语言**需要大量的时间和耐心。"},
49148:{"w":"oral","e":"We will have an oral English test next week, so I practice speaking every day.","t":"我们下周有英语**口试**，所以我每天都练习说英语。"},
49149:{"w":"accent","e":"He speaks English with a strong French accent, so I can tell where he is from.","t":"他说英语带着浓重的法国**口音**，所以我能听出他是哪里人。"},
49150:{"w":"spelling","e":"Please check your spelling carefully before you hand in your English homework.","t":"交英语作业之前，请仔细检查一下**拼写**。"},
49151:{"w":"abroad","e":"More and more Chinese students choose to study abroad after they finish high school.","t":"越来越多的中国学生高中毕业后选择**出国**留学。"},
49152:{"w":"interview","e":"We will talk about how applicants are put through a short interview.","t":"我们将讨论求职者如何进行简短的**面试**。"},
49153:{"w":"opinion","e":"In my opinion, this film is better than the book.","t":"在我**看来**，这部电影比那本书好。"},
49154:{"w":"thought","e":"After some thought, she decided to join the music club.","t":"经过一番**思考**，她决定加入音乐社团。"},
49155:{"w":"author","e":"The author of this book spent five years living in a small village in Africa.","t":"这本书的**作者**在非洲的一个小村庄里住了五年。"},
49156:{"w":"authority","e":"Only the local authorities have the power to close the school during bad weather.","t":"只有当地**当局**有权在恶劣天气时关闭学校。"},
49157:{"w":"host","e":"The host of the TV show asked the young singer a few funny questions.","t":"电视节目的**主持人**问了这位年轻歌手几个有趣的问题。"},
49158:{"w":"guest","e":"Every guest at the wedding received a small gift.","t":"婚礼上的每位**客人**都收到了一份小礼物。"},
49159:{"w":"gifted","e":"She is a gifted pianist who started performing at the age of seven.","t":"她是一位**有天赋**的钢琴家，七岁就开始演出了。"},
49160:{"w":"present","e":"Everyone was present at the meeting yesterday.","t":"昨天的会议上，每个人都**出席**了。"},
49161:{"w":"presentation","e":"Her class presentation on pandas was clear and full of beautiful photos.","t":"她关于熊猫的课堂**演示**条理清楚，还配有许多漂亮的照片。"},
49162:{"w":"represent","e":"In this famous painting, the white bird represents peace and hope for the future.","t":"在这幅名画中，白鸟**象征**着和平和对未来的希望。"},
49163:{"w":"representative","e":"Your examiner is a Student Union representative.","t":"你的主考官是学生会**代表**。"},
49164:{"w":"thankful","e":"I am thankful to my teachers for all their help this year.","t":"我很**感激**老师们这一年来给我的所有帮助。"},
49165:{"w":"treat","e":"Our teacher treats all the students fairly.","t":"我们的老师**对待**所有学生都很公平。"},
49166:{"w":"treatment","e":"People were dissatisfied with the treatment of animals at the zoo.","t":"动物园**对待**动物的方式令人不满。"},
49167:{"w":"hardship","e":"The family faced great hardship after the father lost his job last winter.","t":"去年冬天父亲失业后，这家人陷入了极大的**困苦**。"},
49168:{"w":"sweat","e":"He wiped the sweat from his face after running around the playground.","t":"绕着操场跑完后，他擦掉脸上的**汗水**。"},
49169:{"w":"sadness","e":"She could not hide her sadness when her best friend moved away.","t":"好朋友搬走时，她掩饰不住自己的**悲伤**。"},
49170:{"w":"merry","e":"The children sang merry songs around the Christmas tree on Christmas Eve.","t":"平安夜，孩子们围着圣诞树唱着**欢乐的**歌。"},
49171:{"w":"possess","e":"She possesses a great talent for music and can play four instruments.","t":"她**拥有**很高的音乐天赋，会演奏四种乐器。"},
49172:{"w":"possession","e":"It would be a good idea to get some insurance for the furniture and other personal possessions.","t":"给家具和其他一些个人**财产**上保险是一个不错的主意。"},
49173:{"w":"observe","e":"Scientists spent months in the forest observing how the young birds learned to fly.","t":"科学家们在森林里花了几个月**观察**幼鸟是怎样学会飞的。"},
49174:{"w":"analyse","e":"Scientists analyse the water from the river to see if it is safe to drink.","t":"科学家**分析**河水，看看它是否可以安全饮用。"},
49175:{"w":"handle","e":"Friction management means handling conflicts in a positive and constructive manner.","t":"摩擦管理是指以积极的、建设性的态度来**处理**各种冲突。"},
49176:{"w":"height","e":"Many characteristics, such as height and intelligence, result from subtle interactions between genes and the environment.","t":"许多特征，如**身高**和智力，都是基因和环境间相互微妙作用的结果。"},
49177:{"w":"significance","e":"Teachers should help students understand the significance of this historic event.","t":"老师应该帮助学生理解这一历史事件的**意义**。"},
49178:{"w":"precious","e":"Time with my family is precious to me, so I turn off my phone at dinner.","t":"和家人在一起的时间对我来说很**宝贵**，所以吃晚饭时我会关掉手机。"},
49179:{"w":"convenient","e":"Cars easily surpass trains or buses as a flexible and convenient mode of personal transport.","t":"小汽车轻而易举地就胜过火车及公共汽车，成为一种灵活**便捷**的个人交通工具。"},
49180:{"w":"convenience","e":"The newly-built apartment building provides gas, electricity and other modern conveniences.","t":"这幢新盖的公寓大楼提供煤气、电以及其他一些现代化**便利设施**。"},
49181:{"w":"plenty","e":"There is plenty of time, so don't rush to finish your breakfast.","t":"时间很**充足**，所以别急着吃完早饭。"},
49182:{"w":"spare","e":"Thank you very much for sparing so much of your time to talk with me.","t":"非常感谢您**抽出**这么长的时间与我谈话。"},
49183:{"w":"public","e":"Smoking is not allowed in public places.","t":"**公共**场所禁止吸烟。"},
49184:{"w":"prevent","e":"Washing your hands regularly is one of the simplest ways to prevent the spread of infectious diseases.","t":"经常洗手是**阻止**传染病传播最简单的方法之一。"},
49185:{"w":"lose","e":"Be careful not to lose your keys on the way home.","t":"回家的路上小心别**丢**了钥匙。"},
49186:{"w":"loss","e":"The loss of his job made life very difficult for the whole family.","t":"**失去**工作让全家人的生活变得很艰难。"},
49187:{"w":"miss","e":"I will miss my friends a lot when I move to a new city.","t":"搬到新城市后，我会非常**想念**我的朋友们。"},
49188:{"w":"shut","e":"Please shut the window because it is getting cold.","t":"天越来越冷了，请**关**上窗户。"},
49189:{"w":"depth","e":"The depth of the lake is about ten metres.","t":"这个湖的**深度**大约是十米。"},
49190:{"w":"freedom","e":"Everyone should have the freedom to say what they think.","t":"每个人都应该有说出自己想法的**自由**。"},
49191:{"w":"aside","e":"She put her book aside and went to answer the door when someone knocked.","t":"有人敲门时，她把书放到**一边**，去开门了。"},
49192:{"w":"beauty","e":"The beauty of the mountain lake made everyone stop and take photos.","t":"山中湖泊的**美丽**让每个人都停下来拍照。"},
49193:{"w":"tiny","e":"A tiny insect was crawling across the page of my notebook.","t":"一只**极小的**昆虫正爬过我笔记本的那一页。"},
49194:{"w":"danger","e":"The sign warns people about the danger of swimming in the river.","t":"这块牌子提醒人们在河里游泳的**危险**。"},
49195:{"w":"cost","e":"The new phone cost me nearly two months of pocket money.","t":"这部新手机**花**了我将近两个月的零花钱。"},
49196:{"w":"spend","e":"We spent the whole afternoon at the beach and went home tired but happy.","t":"我们在海滩上**度过**了整个下午，回家时又累又开心。"},
49197:{"w":"pay","e":"I will pay for the tickets, and you can buy the drinks.","t":"我来**付**票钱，你去买饮料。"},
49198:{"w":"expense","e":"Travel expenses are paid by the company.","t":"差旅**费用**由公司支付。"},
49199:{"w":"purchase","e":"If you'd like to purchase any of George's books or other souvenirs, leave the house by the side entrance.","t":"如果你想**购买**乔治的书或其他纪念品，请从房子的侧门离开。"},
49200:{"w":"percent","e":"About sixty percent of the students in our class walk to school.","t":"我们班大约**百分之六十**的学生步行上学。"},
49201:{"w":"percentage","e":"A high percentage of the students in our class wear glasses.","t":"我们班戴眼镜的学生所占的**比例**很高。"},
49202:{"w":"discount","e":"The shop gives students a ten percent discount on all books.","t":"这家商店对所有书籍给学生百分之十的**折扣**。"},
49203:{"w":"cash","e":"I don't have any cash with me, so I'll pay by card.","t":"我身上没带**现金**，所以刷卡付款。"},
49204:{"w":"charge","e":"Drivers will be charged according to the roads they use.","t":"根据司机行驶的道路对其**收费**。"},
49205:{"w":"accuse","e":"She accused her brother of eating all the cake while she was out.","t":"她**指责**弟弟趁她出门时把蛋糕全吃光了。"},
49206:{"w":"accept","e":"He gladly accepted our invitation to the party.","t":"他欣然**接受**了我们的聚会邀请。"},
49207:{"w":"afford","e":"They would not be able to afford cars or homes.","t":"他们**负担**不起汽车和房子。"},
49208:{"w":"supply","e":"Underground water sources in Australia supply about 18% of the total water consumption.","t":"澳大利亚用水**供给**的18%来自地下水。"},
49209:{"w":"pack","e":"I need to pack my suitcase tonight, because we leave early tomorrow.","t":"我今晚得**整理**行李箱，因为明天要早走。"},
49210:{"w":"package","e":"The packages were delivered to the wrong place.","t":"这些**包裹**被送错地方了。"},
49211:{"w":"packet","e":"He bought a packet of biscuits and a bottle of water at the station.","t":"他在车站买了**一小包**饼干和一瓶水。"},
49212:{"w":"parcel","e":"I went to the post office to send a parcel of books to my cousin.","t":"我去邮局给表弟寄了一个装着书的**包裹**。"},
49213:{"w":"worth","e":"This old book is worth a lot of money.","t":"这本旧书**值**很多钱。"},
49214:{"w":"worthy","e":"She is worthy of the prize because she worked so hard.","t":"她那么努力，所以**值得**获这个奖。"},
49215:{"w":"worthwhile","e":"Visiting the old town is worthwhile, even though it takes three hours to get there.","t":"虽然要花三个小时才能到，但那个古镇还是**值得**一去。"},
49216:{"w":"deserve","e":"These poor people deserve our help.","t":"这些可怜的人**值得**我们帮助。"},
49217:{"w":"value","e":"This old painting has great value, so it is kept in a safe.","t":"这幅古画很有**价值**，所以被锁在保险柜里。"},
49218:{"w":"valuable","e":"The province is abundant in valuable minerals.","t":"该省盛产**贵重**的矿物质。"},
49219:{"w":"useless","e":"This old phone is useless now because it will not turn on.","t":"这部旧手机现在**没用**了，因为它打不开机。"},
49220:{"w":"educate","e":"Parents should educate their children to be honest and kind to others.","t":"父母应该**教育**孩子诚实、善待他人。"},
49221:{"w":"education","e":"My parents believe that a good education is the best gift for children.","t":"我父母认为良好的**教育**是给孩子最好的礼物。"},
49222:{"w":"lecture","e":"I am giving you the lectures on environmental noise this term.","t":"这个学期由我来给你们上环境噪声**课**。"},
49223:{"w":"coach","e":"They play just as important a role as the coach in our team.","t":"在我们队里，他们扮演着和**教练**同等重要的角色。"},
49224:{"w":"hopeful","e":"The first results of the new medicine look hopeful, and doctors plan to test it on more patients.","t":"这种新药的初步结果看起来很**有希望**，医生们计划在更多病人身上进行试验。"},
49225:{"w":"grateful","e":"I'd be grateful if you could tell me a little about your time since you've been here in Cambridge.","t":"如果你能够说说来剑桥以后的一些情况，我将不胜**感激**。"},
49226:{"w":"confident","e":"She felt confident about the interview because she had practised a lot.","t":"她对面试很有**自信**，因为已经练习了很多次。"},
49227:{"w":"create","e":"The economic recovery created more jobs.","t":"经济复苏**带来**了更多的工作机会。"},
49228:{"w":"creative","e":"Our art teacher always encourages us to be creative and try new ways of painting.","t":"美术老师总是鼓励我们要有**创造性**，尝试新的画法。"},
49229:{"w":"attract","e":"We kept the price low to attract more visitors here.","t":"我们保持低价以**吸引**更多的游客前来。"},
49230:{"w":"attractive","e":"The city is attractive to tourists because of its old streets and beautiful beaches.","t":"这座城市因古老的街道和美丽的海滩而对游客很有**吸引力**。"},
49231:{"w":"attraction","e":"The beautiful beaches are the main attraction of the island for visitors.","t":"美丽的海滩是这座岛对游客最大的**吸引力**。"},
49232:{"w":"superior","e":"Researchers found that a word without a picture is superior to a word plus a picture in terms of reading efficiency.","t":"研究人员发现，就阅读效率而言，不配图画的文字比配有图画的文字的阅读效率**更高**。"},
49233:{"w":"superb","e":"The mountains of the central island provide superb ski facilities in winter.","t":"岛屿中部的山脉为冬天滑雪提供了**绝佳的**场地。"},
49234:{"w":"volunteer","e":"My brother is a volunteer at the city library on weekends.","t":"我哥哥周末在市图书馆当**志愿者**。"},
49235:{"w":"voluntary","e":"I decided to join a voluntary organization and was sent to Ecuador to carry out land surveys.","t":"我决定加入一个**志愿**者组织，并且被派往厄瓜多尔执行土地测量任务。"},
49236:{"w":"satisfy","e":"A bowl of hot noodles will satisfy your hunger after the long walk.","t":"长途步行之后，一碗热面就能**满足**你的食欲。"},
49237:{"w":"satisfaction","e":"She smiled with satisfaction when she saw her test result.","t":"看到考试成绩，她**满意**地笑了。"},
49238:{"w":"pleasant","e":"We spent a pleasant afternoon last Sunday walking by the river.","t":"上周日我们在河边散步，度过了一个**愉快**的下午。"},
49239:{"w":"attend","e":"More than two hundred people attended the school concert last night.","t":"昨晚有两百多人**参加**了学校音乐会。"},
49240:{"w":"attain","e":"With hard work, she finally attained her dream of becoming a doctor.","t":"通过努力，她终于**实现**了成为医生的梦想。"},
49241:{"w":"attach","e":"They attached the coupon to the front of the letter.","t":"他们把优惠券**附**在信的正面。"},
49242:{"w":"foreign","e":"She speaks three foreign languages and works as a translator.","t":"她会说三种**外国**语言，是一名翻译。"},
49243:{"w":"population","e":"There is still a large portion of the world population living in poverty.","t":"世界**人口**中还有一大部分生活在贫困之中。"},
49244:{"w":"intend","e":"I intend to visit my grandparents in the countryside during the winter holiday.","t":"寒假期间我**打算**去乡下看望爷爷奶奶。"},
49245:{"w":"intention","e":"We all listened carefully as the director outlined his intentions.","t":"我们都认真聆听了导演对他的**意图**的概述。"},
49246:{"w":"purpose","e":"The main purpose of this meeting is to plan the school trip.","t":"这次会议的主要**目的**是规划学校旅行。"},
49247:{"w":"desire","e":"Many old folks desire to learn English in China.","t":"在中国，很多老年人都**想**学英语。"},
49248:{"w":"list","e":"Please make a list of the things we need to buy for the party.","t":"请把我们为聚会需要买的东西列一张**清单**。"},
49249:{"w":"storage","e":"We use the small room under the stairs for storage of old books and clothes.","t":"我们把楼梯下面的小房间用来**存放**旧书和旧衣服。"},
49250:{"w":"rush","e":"Students rushed out of the classroom as soon as the bell rang.","t":"铃声一响，学生们就**冲**出了教室。"},
49251:{"w":"draw","e":"She likes to draw pictures of animals in her free time.","t":"她空闲时喜欢**画**动物的画。"},
49252:{"w":"strike","e":"The strike quickly spread to other states.","t":"**罢工**很快波及了其他州。"},
49253:{"w":"drag","e":"The box was too heavy to carry, so we had to drag it across the floor.","t":"箱子太重搬不动，我们只好把它从地板上**拖**过去。"},
49254:{"w":"recent","e":"The school has changed a lot in recent years, with a new library and sports hall.","t":"这所学校**近年来**变化很大，新建了图书馆和体育馆。"},
49255:{"w":"ancient","e":"The ancient Greeks used lenses to concentrate the sun's rays on dry leaves to light fire.","t":"**古**希腊人用透镜将太阳光聚集在干树叶上生火。"},
49256:{"w":"last","e":"The concert will last about two hours, with a short break.","t":"音乐会将**持续**大约两个小时，中间有短暂的休息。"},
49257:{"w":"essential","e":"Water is essential for all living things, so we must not waste it.","t":"水对所有生物来说都是**必不可少的**，所以我们不能浪费它。"},
49258:{"w":"favour","e":"Many young people favour online shopping because it is quick and easy.","t":"许多年轻人**喜爱**网购，因为它又快又方便。"},
49259:{"w":"favourite","e":"My favourite subject at school is history, because I love stories about the past.","t":"我在学校**最喜欢的**科目是历史，因为我喜欢关于过去的故事。"},
49260:{"w":"pleased","e":"My parents were pleased with my results this term.","t":"父母对我这学期的成绩很**满意**。"},
49261:{"w":"pleasure","e":"It gives me great pleasure to welcome you to our school.","t":"欢迎你来到我们学校，我感到非常**高兴**。"},
49262:{"w":"base","e":"This film is based on a true story about a young girl in wartime.","t":"这部电影**基于**一个战时少女的真实故事。"},
49263:{"w":"basis","e":"Trust is the basis of any good friendship, and it takes time to build.","t":"信任是任何美好友谊的**基础**，而且需要时间来建立。"},
49264:{"w":"basic","e":"Learning basic first aid can help you save lives.","t":"学习**基本的**急救知识能帮你挽救生命。"},
49265:{"w":"fundamental","e":"Respect for others is a fundamental part of good manners.","t":"尊重他人是礼貌的**基本**组成部分。"},
49266:{"w":"fill","e":"Please fill the bottle with water before the trip.","t":"出发之前请把瓶子**装满**水。"},
49267:{"w":"offer","e":"The shop offers free delivery to customers who live nearby.","t":"这家商店为住在附近的顾客**提供**免费送货。"},
49268:{"w":"provide","e":"The hotel provides free breakfast for all guests who stay more than two nights.","t":"这家酒店为所有住两晚以上的客人**提供**免费早餐。"},
49269:{"w":"cover","e":"Snow covered the whole town by morning.","t":"到早上，大雪已经**覆盖**了整个小镇。"},
49270:{"w":"discover","e":"Scientists are working to discover the links between the weather and people's moods and performance.","t":"科学家正致力于通过研究来**发现**天气和人的情绪、行为之间的联系。"},
49271:{"w":"discovery","e":"The discovery of a new planet surprised many scientists around the world.","t":"一颗新行星的**发现**让世界各地的许多科学家感到惊讶。"},
49272:{"w":"recover","e":"After a few days of cough, my roommate began to recover.","t":"咳嗽了几天后，我的室友开始**康复**了。"},
49273:{"w":"cure","e":"Doctors are still looking for a cure for this serious disease.","t":"医生们仍在寻找这种严重疾病的**治疗**方法。"},
49274:{"w":"bleed","e":"My nose began to bleed after I was hit by the ball during the game.","t":"比赛中我被球砸到后，鼻子开始**流血**。"},
49275:{"w":"medicine","e":"The doctor gave me some medicine for my cold and told me to rest.","t":"医生给我开了一些治感冒的**药**，让我多休息。"},
49276:{"w":"medical","e":"Free medical care is offered to all the students.","t":"所有学生都能享受免费的**医疗**服务。"},
49277:{"w":"pill","e":"Take one pill three times a day after meals, and drink plenty of water.","t":"每天三次，每次饭后吃一颗**药丸**，并多喝水。"},
49278:{"w":"tablet","e":"The doctor told me to take two tablets after each meal for a week.","t":"医生让我一周内每餐饭后服两粒**药片**。"},
49279:{"w":"aid","e":"After the earthquake, many countries sent aid to the people who had lost their homes.","t":"地震后，许多国家向失去家园的人们送去了**帮助**。"},
49280:{"w":"assist","e":"The Student Union is intended to assist in teachers' work.","t":"学生会旨在**协助**老师的工作。"},
49281:{"w":"account","e":"I opened a bank account so that I could save my pocket money.","t":"我开了一个银行**账户**，好把零花钱存起来。"},
49282:{"w":"attack","e":"The enemy planned to attack the city early in the morning.","t":"敌军计划在清晨**攻击**这座城市。"},
49283:{"w":"compete","e":"Many students compete for a place in the school basketball team.","t":"许多学生**竞争**学校篮球队的一个名额。"},
49284:{"w":"competition","e":"The workers opened small businesses in direct competition with their former employer.","t":"工人们开办了小型公司，直接和他们以前的雇主**竞争**。"},
49285:{"w":"invent","e":"Do you know who invented the telephone more than one hundred years ago?","t":"你知道一百多年前是谁**发明**了电话吗？"},
49286:{"w":"invention","e":"The invention of the printing press changed the way people shared knowledge.","t":"印刷机的**发明**改变了人们传播知识的方式。"},
49287:{"w":"view","e":"From my window, I have a beautiful view of the lake.","t":"从我的窗户可以看到湖的美丽**景色**。"},
49288:{"w":"preview","e":"We watched the preview of the film and decided to buy tickets.","t":"我们看了这部电影的**预告片**，决定买票。"},
49289:{"w":"review","e":"Before going to bed, please review the day's classes.","t":"睡觉前，请**复习**一下白天的课程内容。"},
49290:{"w":"require","e":"This job requires good English and a lot of patience.","t":"这份工作**要求**有良好的英语和很大的耐心。"},
49291:{"w":"requirement","e":"The Director of Studies will talk to you about the courses and different requirements for each.","t":"教务主管将和你谈论课程问题以及每门课程的不同**要求**。"},
49292:{"w":"scene","e":"The police arrived at the scene of the accident within five minutes.","t":"警察五分钟内就赶到了事故**现场**。"},
49293:{"w":"scenery","e":"The scenery is as beautiful as a painting.","t":"这里**风景**美丽如画。"},
49294:{"w":"sight","e":"My grandfather's sight is getting worse, so he needs new glasses.","t":"我爷爷的**视力**越来越差，需要配一副新眼镜了。"},
49295:{"w":"top","e":"We climbed to the top of the hill and enjoyed the view.","t":"我们爬到山**顶**，欣赏了风景。"},
49296:{"w":"warn","e":"The sign warns drivers to slow down near the school.","t":"标牌**提醒**司机在学校附近减速。"},
49297:{"w":"advise","e":"My teacher advised me to read English newspapers every day.","t":"老师**建议**我每天读英文报纸。"},
49298:{"w":"advice","e":"I was told to come here for advice about math courses.","t":"有人告诉我到这里来咨询一些关于数学课程的**建议**。"},
49299:{"w":"recommend","e":"As treatment for back pain the clinic mainly recommends relaxation therapy.","t":"至于背部疼痛的治疗，诊所主要**推荐**采用放松疗法。"},
49300:{"w":"suggest","e":"There is nothing in the rules of grammar to suggest that ending a sentence with a preposition is wrong.","t":"没有任何语法规则**表明**以介词结束一个句子是错误的。"},
49301:{"w":"suggestion","e":"Thank you for your suggestion; we will try a different way next time.","t":"谢谢你的**建议**，下次我们会换个方法试试。"},
49302:{"w":"saying","e":"There is an old saying that a friend in need is a friend indeed.","t":"有句古老的**谚语**说，患难之交才是真朋友。"},
49303:{"w":"remind","e":"The notice reminds students that if they park a motor vehicle on university premises without a valid permit, they will be fined.","t":"这个通知**提醒**学生们：未经允许就在校园里停放机动车会被罚款。"},
49304:{"w":"respond","e":"Companies should respond to this kind of situation in an honest and open way.","t":"公司应该采取开诚布公的方式来**应对**这类情况。"},
49305:{"w":"response","e":"The news provoked an angry response.","t":"这条消息引起了人们的愤怒**反应**。"},
49306:{"w":"responsible","e":"She is a responsible student who always finishes her homework on time.","t":"她是个**有责任感的**学生，总是按时完成作业。"},
49307:{"w":"responsibility","e":"Taking care of the class pet is my responsibility this week.","t":"这周照顾班级宠物是我的**责任**。"},
49308:{"w":"shoulder","e":"She carried a heavy bag on her shoulder all the way home.","t":"她把一个沉重的包扛在**肩**上，一路走回家。"},
49309:{"w":"enter","e":"Please knock before you enter the room.","t":"请在**进入**房间前先敲门。"},
49310:{"w":"entrance","e":"We agreed to meet at the main entrance of the museum at nine.","t":"我们约好九点在博物馆的主**入口**见面。"},
49311:{"w":"entry","e":"Entry to the city museum is free for all students on Monday afternoons.","t":"每周一下午，所有学生都可以免费**进入**市博物馆参观。"},
49312:{"w":"exit","e":"The emergency exit is at the end of the hall on your left.","t":"紧急**出口**在走廊尽头的左边。"},
49313:{"w":"order","e":"Please put the cards in order, from the smallest number to the largest.","t":"请把这些卡片按**顺序**排好，从最小的数字到最大的。"},
49314:{"w":"vacation","e":"She's going to Florida for vacation.","t":"她要去佛罗里达**度假**。"},
49315:{"w":"lie","e":"I like to lie on the grass and watch the clouds.","t":"我喜欢**躺**在草地上看云。"},
49316:{"w":"due","e":"The train is due at six, so we have time for a cup of tea.","t":"火车**预定**六点到，所以我们有时间喝杯茶。"},
49317:{"w":"consist","e":"Our class consists of twenty boys and twenty-two girls.","t":"我们班由二十名男生和二十二名女生**组成**。"},
49318:{"w":"consistent","e":"The survey results are entirely consistent with our earlier research.","t":"调查的结果与我们早期的研究结果完全**一致**。"},
49319:{"w":"regard","e":"Many people regard this old bridge as the symbol of our town.","t":"许多人把这座老桥**视为**我们小镇的象征。"},
49320:{"w":"regardless","e":"Regardless of the weather, the students must go to the playground for morning exercise.","t":"**不管**天气如何，学生们都必须去操场做早操。"},
49321:{"w":"thick","e":"The walls of the old castle are so thick that it stays cool inside in summer.","t":"古堡的墙**厚实**得很，夏天里面依然凉快。"},
49322:{"w":"thin","e":"The paper is so thin that you can see the words on the other side.","t":"这张纸那么**薄**，你能看到另一面的字。"},
49323:{"w":"cause","e":"Heavy rain can cause floods in low areas near the river.","t":"大雨会在河边的低洼地区**引起**洪水。"},
49324:{"w":"result","e":"She was very happy with the result of her final exam this term.","t":"她对这学期期末考试的**结果**很满意。"},
49325:{"w":"reflect","e":"The lake was so still that it reflected the mountains like a mirror.","t":"湖面平静得像镜子一样，**反射**出群山的倒影。"},
49326:{"w":"reflection","e":"She smiled at her reflection in the shop window and fixed her hair.","t":"她对着商店橱窗里自己的**倒影**笑了笑，整理了一下头发。"},
49327:{"w":"affect","e":"No activity affects more of the earth's surface than farming.","t":"耕种是对地表**影响**最大的人类活动。"},
49328:{"w":"affection","e":"The old couple still show great affection for each other after fifty years of marriage.","t":"这对老夫妻结婚五十年了，仍然对彼此怀有深厚的**感情**。"},
49329:{"w":"outcome","e":"Some environmentalists worry about this outcome.","t":"一些环境保护主义者对这个**结果**表示担心。"},
49330:{"w":"consequence","e":"If you don't study hard now, you will have to face the consequences later.","t":"如果你现在不努力学习，以后就得承担**后果**。"},
49331:{"w":"conclude","e":"After looking at all the evidence, the police concluded that the fire was an accident.","t":"看过所有证据后，警方**推断出**这场火灾是一场意外。"},
49332:{"w":"conclusion","e":"After a long discussion, we came to the conclusion that the plan would cost too much.","t":"经过长时间讨论，我们得出**结论**：这个计划花费太大。"},
49333:{"w":"globe","e":"The teacher pointed to China on the globe and asked us to find our city.","t":"老师指着**地球仪**上的中国，让我们找出自己的城市。"},
49334:{"w":"pole","e":"The flag was raised to the top of the pole as the students sang the national anthem.","t":"学生们唱国歌时，国旗升到了**旗杆**顶端。"},
49335:{"w":"lead","e":"The road will lead you into the college grounds.","t":"这条路**通向**学院校区。"},
49336:{"w":"chief","e":"The chief reason for the delay was the heavy snow on the highway.","t":"延误的**主要**原因是公路上的大雪。"},
49337:{"w":"professional","e":"Sports psychologists spend time with professional athletes helping them approach competition with a positive mental attitude.","t":"运动心理学家花时间帮助**职业**运动员以一种积极的心态去迎接挑战。"},
49338:{"w":"expert","e":"The museum invited an expert to tell visitors about the history of the old paintings.","t":"博物馆请了一位**专家**给参观者讲解这些古画的历史。"},
49339:{"w":"guide","e":"Our guide led us through the forest and showed us the way back.","t":"我们的**向导**带领我们穿过森林，并给我们指明了回去的路。"},
49340:{"w":"guidance","e":"Under the guidance of their teacher, the students finished the science project in two weeks.","t":"在老师的**指导**下，学生们用两周完成了这个科学项目。"},
49341:{"w":"avoid","e":"We left early to avoid the heavy traffic on the way to the airport.","t":"我们早早出发，以**避开**去机场路上的交通高峰。"},
49342:{"w":"depend","e":"Young children depend on their parents for food and care.","t":"年幼的孩子**依靠**父母获得食物和照顾。"},
49343:{"w":"independent","e":"Mary was an independent-minded student.","t":"玛丽是个有**独立**见解的学生。"},
49344:{"w":"rely","e":"Most inland farmers rely on underground water for irrigation.","t":"大部分内陆农民都**依靠**地下水灌溉土地。"},
49345:{"w":"smart","e":"Most computer criminals are smart enough to cover their crimes.","t":"大多数计算机犯罪分子都很**聪明**，能掩盖自己的罪行。"},
49346:{"w":"clever","e":"The clever little dog quickly learned how to open the kitchen door by itself.","t":"这只**聪明的**小狗很快就学会了自己打开厨房的门。"},
49347:{"w":"bright","e":"The classroom is bright and warm because the sun shines through the big windows.","t":"阳光透过大窗户照进来，教室里**明亮**又温暖。"},
49348:{"w":"fool","e":"Only a fool would swim in the sea during such a big storm.","t":"只有**傻瓜**才会在这么大的风暴中去海里游泳。"},
49349:{"w":"stupid","e":"It was stupid of me to leave my phone on the bus.","t":"我把手机落在公共汽车上，真是太**愚蠢**了。"},
49350:{"w":"silly","e":"My little brother made a silly face and made everyone laugh.","t":"我弟弟做了个**傻乎乎的**鬼脸，把大家都逗笑了。"},
49351:{"w":"competence","e":"The company hired him because of his competence in solving technical problems.","t":"公司雇用他是因为他解决技术问题的**能力**。"},
49352:{"w":"intelligent","e":"The most intelligent students do additional reading to supplement the material in the textbook.","t":"最**聪明**的学生通过课外阅读来补充课本的内容。"},
49353:{"w":"intelligence","e":"Reading widely can improve a child's intelligence and imagination.","t":"广泛阅读可以提高孩子的**智力**和想象力。"},
49354:{"w":"update","e":"Please update the software on your phone before you travel abroad.","t":"出国旅行前请**更新**手机上的软件。"},
49355:{"w":"figure","e":"Please check the figures in this report again before you hand it in.","t":"交上去之前，请再核对一下这份报告里的**数字**。"},
49356:{"w":"statistic","e":"The writer pointed out that the employment statistic was deceptive.","t":"作者指出这个就业**统计数据**不可信。"},
49357:{"w":"digital","e":"She took a lot of photos with her new digital camera.","t":"她用新买的**数码**相机拍了很多照片。"},
49358:{"w":"reliable","e":"My old bike is not fast, but it is very reliable.","t":"我的旧自行车不快，但非常**可靠**。"},
49359:{"w":"flexible","e":"I like this job because the working hours are flexible.","t":"我喜欢这份工作，因为工作时间很**灵活**。"},
49360:{"w":"fix","e":"My father fixed the broken bike in less than an hour.","t":"爸爸不到一小时就把坏掉的自行车**修好**了。"},
49361:{"w":"convince","e":"That man tries to convince the employer that any shortcomings he has will not prevent him from doing a good job.","t":"那个男人努力让雇主**相信**，他身上的任何缺点都不会妨碍他做好工作。"},
49362:{"w":"consult","e":"You do not need to consult your doctor immediately if the tablets give you a side-effect.","t":"如果药片对你产生副作用，不必立即**咨询**医生。"},
49363:{"w":"quarrel","e":"The two sisters had a quarrel about who should wash the dishes.","t":"两姐妹为谁该洗碗发生了**争吵**。"},
49364:{"w":"argue","e":"My brother and I often argue about which TV programme to watch.","t":"我和哥哥常常为看哪个电视节目而**争吵**。"},
49365:{"w":"argument","e":"Support your argument with examples and relevant evidence, please.","t":"请用实例和相关证据来支持你的**论点**。"},
49366:{"w":"debate","e":"There's a debate in the meeting room about next year's budget.","t":"会议室里（大家）就来年的预算产生了**争论**。"},
49367:{"w":"associate","e":"People always associate noise with headaches, and for most of us excessive noise creates the conditions for a headache.","t":"人们总是把噪音和头痛**联系**在一起，对于我们大多数人来说，过多的噪音是引起头痛的原因。"},
49368:{"w":"association","e":"He is a member of the Chinese Writers' Association.","t":"他是中国作家**协会**的会员。"},
49369:{"w":"negotiate","e":"The workers will negotiate with the company about their pay next week.","t":"工人们下周将就薪水问题与公司**谈判**。"},
49370:{"w":"register","e":"You must remember to bring the ID card with you when you come to register.","t":"你来**登记**的时候一定要记得带上身份证。"},
49371:{"w":"sheet","e":"Please take out a clean sheet of paper and write your name at the top.","t":"请拿出一**张**干净的纸，把名字写在最上面。"},
49372:{"w":"birthplace","e":"This small town is the birthplace of the famous writer, and many tourists visit it.","t":"这个小镇是那位著名作家的**出生地**，许多游客来参观。"},
49373:{"w":"sex","e":"Please write your name, age and sex clearly on the form before you hand it in.","t":"交表之前，请在表格上清楚地写明你的姓名、年龄和**性别**。"},
49374:{"w":"male","e":"Only about thirty percent of the nurses in this hospital are male.","t":"这家医院的护士中只有约百分之三十是**男性**。"},
49375:{"w":"female","e":"The female lion usually does the hunting while the male guards the family.","t":"通常是**雌**狮负责捕猎，雄狮则守护家族。"},
49376:{"w":"within","e":"The bus will arrive within ten minutes, so please wait here.","t":"公共汽车十分钟**之内**就会到，请在这里等一下。"},
49377:{"w":"arrival","e":"The arrival of the new English teacher made all the students very excited.","t":"新英语老师的**到来**让所有学生都很兴奋。"},
49378:{"w":"kingdom","e":"The king ruled his small kingdom wisely, and his people lived in peace for many years.","t":"国王把他的小**王国**治理得很好，百姓们多年来安居乐业。"},
49379:{"w":"minister","e":"The minister of education visited our school and talked with the students.","t":"教育**部长**访问了我们学校，并和学生们交谈。"},
49380:{"w":"ministry","e":"People can call the Ministry of Justice for free legal advice.","t":"人们可以打电话到司法**部**进行免费的法律咨询。"},
49381:{"w":"president","e":"A lecture will be given by the president of the Union.","t":"该协会**主席**将发表演讲。"},
49382:{"w":"court","e":"The two neighbors finally took their argument about the fence to court.","t":"两个邻居最终把关于篱笆的争执闹上了**法庭**。"},
49383:{"w":"crime","e":"Without the death penalty our lives are less secure and violent crime will increase.","t":"如果没有死刑，我们的生命会更不安全，暴力**犯罪**活动也将增加。"},
49384:{"w":"criminal","e":"The police caught the criminal two days after the bank robbery.","t":"银行抢劫案发生两天后，警方抓获了那名**罪犯**。"},
49385:{"w":"murder","e":"The murder seemed planned.","t":"这场**谋杀**显然是蓄意策划的。"},
49386:{"w":"arrest","e":"The police arrested the man who had stolen bikes from the school car park.","t":"警察**逮捕**了那个从学校停车场偷自行车的男子。"},
49387:{"w":"prison","e":"The thief was sent to prison for three years after he stole the car.","t":"小偷偷了那辆车后，被送进**监狱**关了三年。"},
49388:{"w":"anyhow","e":"It was raining hard, but we decided to go to the park anyhow.","t":"雨下得很大，但我们决定**无论如何**都要去公园。"},
49389:{"w":"somehow","e":"I lost my keys this morning, but somehow I managed to get into the house.","t":"今天早上我把钥匙弄丢了，但**不知怎么地**还是进了家门。"},
49390:{"w":"nowhere","e":"I looked for my keys everywhere, but they were nowhere to be found.","t":"我到处找钥匙，可**哪儿都**找不到。"},
49391:{"w":"path","e":"We followed a narrow path through the woods to the lake.","t":"我们沿着一条**小路**穿过树林走到湖边。"},
49392:{"w":"traffic","e":"There was so much traffic this morning that I was late for school.","t":"今天早上**交通**太拥挤，我上学迟到了。"},
49393:{"w":"form","e":"You have to fill in a form, but it doesn't take long.","t":"你得填写一张**表格**，但不会耽误太久。"},
49394:{"w":"inform","e":"Fancy Foods wishes to inform the public that pieces of metal have been found in some jars of Fancy Foods Chicken Curry (Spicy).","t":"美食公司希望**告知**大众，在他们生产的一些咖喱（辣）鸡块罐头中发现有金属碎片。"},
49395:{"w":"information","e":"You can find more information about the school clubs on our website.","t":"你可以在我们的网站上找到更多关于学校社团的**信息**。"},
49396:{"w":"guarantee","e":"The box is made of stainless steel which is guaranteed for 20 years.","t":"这个盒子是不锈钢的，品质**保证**期限为20年。"},
49397:{"w":"refuse","e":"She refused to give up even after she failed the exam twice.","t":"即使考试失败了两次，她也**不愿**放弃。"},
49398:{"w":"reject","e":"The university rejected his application because it was sent too late.","t":"大学**拒绝**了他的申请，因为寄得太晚了。"},
49399:{"w":"decline","e":"Sales of paper books have declined in recent years.","t":"近年来纸质书的销量不断**下降**。"},
49400:{"w":"believe","e":"I believe that hard work will lead to success in the end.","t":"我**相信**努力最终会带来成功。"},
49401:{"w":"belief","e":"Many people share the belief that hard work leads to success.","t":"许多人都有这样的**信念**：努力工作会带来成功。"},
49402:{"w":"unbelievable","e":"It is unbelievable that she finished the whole book in one night.","t":"她一晚上就读完了整本书，真让人**难以置信**。"},
49403:{"w":"fail","e":"He failed the driving test twice before he passed.","t":"他在通过之前，驾驶考试**不及格**了两次。"},
49404:{"w":"failure","e":"The plan ended in failure because nobody was willing to pay for it.","t":"这项计划以**失败**告终，因为没有人愿意为它出钱。"},
49405:{"w":"differ","e":"French differs from English in this respect.","t":"法语在这方面**不同于**英语。"},
49406:{"w":"difference","e":"I can't see any difference between these two photos.","t":"我看不出这两张照片有什么**不同**。"},
49407:{"w":"science","e":"Science is my favourite subject because we do many interesting experiments.","t":"**科学**是我最喜欢的科目，因为我们做很多有趣的实验。"},
49408:{"w":"scientific","e":"This morning I want to tell you about a recent scientific discovery dealing with the relation between plants and animals.","t":"今天上午我想告诉你们关于动植物关系的一项新近的**科学**发现。"},
49409:{"w":"appear","e":"It appears that there is a grammar mistake in the composition.","t":"这篇作文**好像**有一处语法错误。"},
49410:{"w":"appearance","e":"His sudden appearance surprised me greatly.","t":"他的突然**出现**让我大吃一惊。"},
49411:{"w":"disappear","e":"The sun disappeared behind the clouds, and it suddenly became cold and dark.","t":"太阳**消失**在云层后面，天突然变得又冷又暗。"},
49412:{"w":"damage","e":"The storm did great damage to the farmers' crops.","t":"暴风雨给农民的庄稼造成了严重的**损害**。"},
49413:{"w":"escape","e":"Two prisoners escaped from the jail last night, and the police are looking for them.","t":"两名囚犯昨晚从监狱里**逃跑**了，警方正在搜寻。"},
49414:{"w":"absent","e":"Why were you absent from my birthday party yesterday?","t":"你昨天怎么**没来**参加我的生日派对呢？"},
49415:{"w":"absence","e":"Tom was criticized for his absence from class without a good reason.","t":"汤姆因为无故**缺席**课堂而受到了批评。"},
49416:{"w":"wild","e":"Wild flowers cover the hills in spring, and many tourists come to see them.","t":"春天，**野**花开满山丘，许多游客前来观赏。"},
49417:{"w":"wildlife","e":"The park is home to many kinds of wildlife, including deer and rabbits.","t":"这个公园里有许多种**野生动物**，包括鹿和兔子。"},
49418:{"w":"vast","e":"The desert covers a vast area, and you can drive for hours without seeing another car.","t":"这片沙漠面积**巨大**，你开车几个小时都可能看不到另一辆车。"},
49419:{"w":"environment","e":"We should all do something to protect the environment, such as using less plastic.","t":"我们都应该为保护**环境**做点事，比如少用塑料。"},
49420:{"w":"surround","e":"The small lake is surrounded on all sides by tall trees and green hills.","t":"这个小湖四面被高大的树木和青山**围绕**。"},
49421:{"w":"surroundings","e":"Those who could afford to live in more pleasant surroundings moved out.","t":"那些支付得起更舒适的**环境**的人都搬了出去。"},
49422:{"w":"plastic","e":"Many supermarkets no longer give free plastic bags to customers who buy food.","t":"许多超市不再给买食品的顾客免费提供**塑料**袋。"},
49423:{"w":"poison","e":"Keep the rat poison on a high shelf where small children cannot reach it.","t":"把灭鼠**毒药**放在小孩够不着的高架子上。"},
49424:{"w":"poisonous","e":"They ate a species of poisonous mushroom.","t":"他们吃了一种**有毒**的蘑菇。"},
49425:{"w":"harm","e":"Too much sugar can harm your teeth, so try to eat fewer sweets.","t":"吃太多糖会**损害**牙齿，所以尽量少吃甜食。"},
49426:{"w":"harmful","e":"Too much sugar is harmful to your teeth.","t":"糖吃得太多对牙齿**有害**。"},
49427:{"w":"injure","e":"Three people were injured in the car accident, but luckily nobody was killed.","t":"有三人在这起车祸中**受伤**，幸好没有人死亡。"},
49428:{"w":"injury","e":"The football player missed the final match because of a serious knee injury.","t":"那名足球运动员因为严重的膝盖**损伤**错过了决赛。"},
49429:{"w":"hurt","e":"Be careful with that knife, or you will hurt yourself.","t":"小心那把刀，否则你会**伤**到自己。"},
49430:{"w":"wound","e":"The soldier had a deep wound in his arm, so he was taken to hospital.","t":"那名士兵手臂上有一处很深的**伤口**，被送进了医院。"},
49431:{"w":"ruin","e":"The heavy rain ruined our picnic, so we had to eat lunch in the car.","t":"大雨**毁掉**了我们的野餐，我们只好在车里吃午饭。"},
49432:{"w":"hit","e":"The ball hit the window and the glass broke.","t":"球**撞到**了窗户，玻璃碎了。"},
49433:{"w":"beat","e":"Our team beat the strongest team in the city yesterday.","t":"我们队昨天**击败**了全市最强的球队。"},
49434:{"w":"impress","e":"The young singer's beautiful voice impressed everyone in the hall.","t":"这位年轻歌手美妙的歌声给大厅里的每个人都**留下深刻印象**。"},
49435:{"w":"impressive","e":"I think this figure is especially impressive.","t":"我认为这个数字尤其**令人印象深刻**。"},
49436:{"w":"impression","e":"Could you tell us something about your first impression of the town when you arrived?","t":"你能不能告诉我当你初到这个小镇时，你的第一**印象**是什么？"},
49437:{"w":"sightseeing","e":"We spent the whole day sightseeing in the old part of the city.","t":"我们花了一整天在老城区**观光**。"},
49438:{"w":"eyesight","e":"Reading in bed with poor light can be bad for your eyesight.","t":"光线昏暗时躺在床上看书，会损害你的**视力**。"},
49439:{"w":"express","e":"She found it hard to express her feelings in a foreign language.","t":"她觉得用外语很难**表达**自己的感受。"},
49440:{"w":"expression","e":"From the expression on his face, I could tell that he had failed the exam.","t":"从他脸上的**表情**，我看得出他考试没及格。"},
49441:{"w":"alarm","e":"Every time when you leave your house, make sure the windows and doors are shut, and set the burglar alarm.","t":"每次出门时都应确定门窗已关好，并打开防盗**警铃**。"},
49442:{"w":"chat","e":"My sister likes to chat with her friends after school.","t":"我姐姐放学后喜欢和朋友**聊天**。"},
49443:{"w":"greet","e":"The teacher stood at the door to greet every student with a smile.","t":"老师站在门口，微笑着**迎接**每一位学生。"},
49444:{"w":"attention","e":"One problem that deserves attention now is the severe climate.","t":"现在，恶劣的气候是需要引起人们**关注**的一个问题。"},
49445:{"w":"unique","e":"Every snowflake is unique, and no two are exactly the same.","t":"每片雪花都是**独特**的，没有两片完全一样。"},
49446:{"w":"slim","e":"I like her slim and pretty hands so much.","t":"我非常喜欢她那双**纤细**美丽的手。"},
49447:{"w":"awful","e":"We heard an awful noise from the kitchen and ran to see what had happened.","t":"我们听到厨房里传来一声**可怕的**巨响，就跑去看发生了什么。"},
49448:{"w":"obvious","e":"It was obvious from her red eyes that she had been crying.","t":"从她红红的眼睛看得出来，很**明显**她刚哭过。"},
49449:{"w":"victory","e":"Our team celebrated its first victory of the season with a big dinner.","t":"我们队用一顿丰盛的晚餐庆祝本赛季的第一场**胜利**。"},
49450:{"w":"champion","e":"She trained hard for years and finally became the national swimming champion.","t":"她刻苦训练多年，终于成了全国游泳**冠军**。"},
49451:{"w":"private","e":"May I ask you a private question?","t":"我能问你一个**私人**问题吗？"},
49452:{"w":"personal","e":"The woman who lost her briefcase gave the policeman some personal details.","t":"丢失公文包的那个妇女向警察提供了一些**个人**信息。"},
49453:{"w":"personally","e":"Personally, I think the first plan is better than the second one.","t":"**就我个人而言**，我认为第一个方案比第二个好。"},
49454:{"w":"personnel","e":"All personnel were asked to participate in the meeting.","t":"此次会议要求全体**员工**参加。"},
49455:{"w":"serve","e":"The waiter served us tea and cakes as soon as we sat down.","t":"我们一坐下，服务员就**端上**了茶和蛋糕。"},
49456:{"w":"service","e":"The airline companies want to improve the service.","t":"航空公司想提升**服务**质量。"},
49457:{"w":"reserve","e":"We reserved the room a week ago.","t":"我们一星期前就**预订**了这个房间。"},
49458:{"w":"reservation","e":"I was advised to make a reservation in advance for the seats.","t":"别人建议我提前**预订**座位。"},
49459:{"w":"prefer","e":"Most of my classmates prefer playing basketball to watching TV at the weekend.","t":"我的大多数同学周末更**喜欢**打篮球而不是看电视。"},
49460:{"w":"influence","e":"What factors do you think influence these decisions?","t":"你认为**影响**这些决定的因素有哪些？"},
49461:{"w":"knowledge","e":"Reading books is a good way to gain knowledge.","t":"读书是获取**知识**的好方法。"},
49462:{"w":"acknowledge","e":"He finally acknowledged that he had made a mistake and said sorry to his team.","t":"他终于**承认**自己犯了错，并向团队道了歉。"},
49463:{"w":"challenge","e":"The greatest challenge in this respect is time.","t":"这一方面面临的最大**挑战**是时间问题。"},
49464:{"w":"relevant","e":"You should support your arguments with examples and relevant evidence.","t":"你应该用实例和**相关**证据来支持你的论点。"},
49465:{"w":"relative","e":"They now live in relative comfort.","t":"他们现在过得**比较**舒适。"},
49466:{"w":"contrary","e":"Contrary to what we expected, the match started on time despite the rain.","t":"与我们预料的**相反**，尽管下雨，比赛仍准时开始。"},
49467:{"w":"controversial","e":"The appearance of individual buildings is often controversial.","t":"私人建筑的外观常常会引起**争议**。"},
49468:{"w":"contradict","e":"The statement contradicts the writer's views.","t":"这一陈述与作者的观点**不符**。"},
49469:{"w":"contradictory","e":"The two newspaper reports gave contradictory information about the accident last night.","t":"这两份报纸对昨晚的事故所报道的信息**相互矛盾**。"},
49470:{"w":"resist","e":"Bugs and weeds will begin to resist poisons.","t":"害虫和野草会开始产生**抗**药性。"},
49471:{"w":"confidential","e":"The file is confidential, so only the manager can read it.","t":"这份文件是**秘密**的，只有经理能看。"},
49472:{"w":"conventional","e":"Most people prefer conventional housing now.","t":"现在很多人偏爱**传统**式的住宅。"},
49473:{"w":"defeat","e":"Our school team defeated the visiting team by three goals.","t":"我们校队以三个球的优势**击败**了客队。"},
49474:{"w":"overcome","e":"With the help of her friends, she overcame her fear of speaking in public.","t":"在朋友们的帮助下，她**克服**了当众讲话的恐惧。"},
49475:{"w":"revise","e":"I need to revise my essay before I hand it in to the teacher on Friday.","t":"周五交给老师之前，我得把作文**修改**一下。"},
49476:{"w":"revision","e":"I spent the weekend on revision for the final exams.","t":"我周末都在为期末考试做**复习**。"},
49477:{"w":"obey","e":"The young soldiers were trained to obey orders from their officers without asking any questions.","t":"这些年轻士兵受过训练，会毫不质疑地**服从**长官的命令。"},
49478:{"w":"violate","e":"Drivers who violate traffic rules will have to pay a fine or even lose their license.","t":"**违反**交通规则的司机要交罚款，甚至会被吊销驾照。"},
49479:{"w":"violent","e":"The violent storm last night blew down several trees along our street.","t":"昨晚**猛烈**的暴风雨刮倒了我们街上的好几棵树。"},
49480:{"w":"violence","e":"Many parents worry about the amount of violence shown on television.","t":"许多父母担心电视上播放的**暴力**内容太多。"},
49481:{"w":"cruel","e":"It is cruel to keep a bird in such a small cage.","t":"把鸟关在这么小的笼子里是很**残忍**的。"},
49482:{"w":"symptom","e":"This disease has some symptoms similar to a cold.","t":"这种病的某些**症状**与感冒的相似。"},
49483:{"w":"example","e":"Can you give me an example of how to use this word?","t":"你能给我举一个这个词的用法**例子**吗？"},
49484:{"w":"shadow","e":"The tall tree cast a long shadow across the playground.","t":"那棵高大的树在操场上投下了长长的**影子**。"},
49485:{"w":"trick","e":"The magician showed us a clever card trick.","t":"魔术师给我们表演了一个巧妙的纸牌**把戏**。"},
49486:{"w":"secret","e":"It is a secret, so please do not tell anyone about our plan.","t":"这是个**秘密**，所以请不要把我们的计划告诉任何人。"},
49487:{"w":"cheat","e":"Tour operators try to cheat tourists.","t":"旅行社的工作人员试图**欺骗**游客。"},
49488:{"w":"trap","e":"The hunter set a trap near the river to catch the fox.","t":"猎人在河边设了一个**陷阱**来抓狐狸。"},
49489:{"w":"hook","e":"Paul hooked his tractor to the car and pulled it to safety.","t":"保罗把他的拖拉机**挂**在那辆小汽车上，然后把它拖到安全的地方。"},
49490:{"w":"end","e":"The school year ends in June, and then we have two months of holiday.","t":"学年在六月**结束**，然后我们有两个月的假期。"},
49491:{"w":"ending","e":"I didn't like the ending of the film because the hero died in the last scene.","t":"我不喜欢这部电影的**结局**，因为主角在最后一幕死了。"},
49492:{"w":"endless","e":"The long meeting seemed endless, and many people began to look at their watches.","t":"这场长会似乎**无休止**地开下去，很多人开始看表。"},
49493:{"w":"drop","e":"Be careful not to drop the glass on the floor.","t":"小心别让玻璃杯**掉**到地上。"},
49494:{"w":"deadline","e":"If you can't meet a deadline for an essay, you should go and see your lecturers.","t":"如果你不能在**截止日期**前交论文，就应该去找你的老师（说明情况）。"},
49495:{"w":"routine","e":"Walking the dog in the park before breakfast has become part of my daily routine.","t":"早饭前去公园遛狗已经成了我每天的**惯例**。"},
49496:{"w":"include","e":"Sports administrators' duties include booking playing fields with local councils.","t":"体育管理员的职责**包括**向地方委员会预订比赛场馆。"},
49497:{"w":"regulation","e":"Anyone who violates the regulations must be punished.","t":"任何违反**规定**的人都要受到惩罚。"},
49498:{"w":"agenda","e":"The first item on the agenda for today's meeting is the plan for the school sports day.","t":"今天会议**议程**上的第一项是学校运动会的计划。"},
49499:{"w":"timetable","e":"I checked the bus timetable and found that the next bus leaves at ten.","t":"我查了公共汽车**时间表**，发现下一班车十点开。"},
49500:{"w":"method","e":"Drawing pictures is a good method for remembering new words.","t":"画图是记忆新单词的一个好**方法**。"},
49501:{"w":"approach","e":"As autumn approaches, the beekeepers pack up their hives and go south.","t":"秋天**来临**，养蜂人收好蜂房前往南方。"},
49502:{"w":"access","e":"Students have free access to the library until nine at night.","t":"学生晚上九点之前都**可以使用**图书馆，不收费。"},
49503:{"w":"manner","e":"The teacher spoke to the nervous new student in a kind and gentle manner.","t":"老师用亲切温和的**方式**跟紧张的新同学说话。"},
49504:{"w":"communicate","e":"Good teachers communicate clearly with their students and encourage them to ask questions in class.","t":"好老师会和学生清楚地**沟通**，并鼓励他们在课堂上提问。"},
49505:{"w":"communication","e":"Good communication between parents and children can solve many problems.","t":"父母和孩子之间良好的**沟通**可以解决很多问题。"},
49506:{"w":"conversation","e":"The conversation between the new students touched on many new subjects.","t":"新同学之间的**对话**涉及很多新话题。"},
49507:{"w":"speech","e":"The principal gave a short speech at the opening of the new library.","t":"校长在新图书馆的开馆仪式上发表了简短的**演讲**。"},
49508:{"w":"celebrate","e":"We celebrate the Spring Festival with a big family dinner every year.","t":"我们每年都用一顿丰盛的家宴来**庆祝**春节。"},
49509:{"w":"compromise","e":"Neither side wanted to compromise, so the talks failed.","t":"双方都不肯**妥协**，所以谈判失败了。"},
49510:{"w":"pass","e":"Could you pass me the salt, please?","t":"请把盐**递**给我好吗？"},
49511:{"w":"passage","e":"Read the passage carefully and answer the questions below.","t":"仔细阅读这段**文章**，回答下面的问题。"},
49512:{"w":"damp","e":"The ground is very damp in the rainforest.","t":"热带雨林的地面非常**潮湿**。"},
49513:{"w":"warmth","e":"We sat by the fire and enjoyed its warmth after a long walk in the snow.","t":"在雪地里走了很久之后，我们坐在火炉边享受它的**温暖**。"},
49514:{"w":"wind","e":"A cold wind blew across the playground, so we all put on our coats.","t":"一阵冷**风**吹过操场，所以我们都穿上了外套。"},
49515:{"w":"spoken","e":"Her spoken English is much better than her written English.","t":"她的英语**口语**比书面英语好得多。"},
49516:{"w":"decision","e":"It was a hard decision, but she chose to stay with her family.","t":"这是个艰难的**决定**，但她选择留在家人身边。"},
49517:{"w":"skill","e":"Learning to swim is a useful skill that can save your life.","t":"学游泳是一项能救命的有用**技能**。"},
49518:{"w":"skilful","e":"She is a skilful player who always finds a way to score.","t":"她是个**技艺精湛**的球员，总能找到得分的办法。"},
49519:{"w":"technique","e":"A new style of architecture was made possible by new materials and construction techniques.","t":"新的建筑材料和建筑**技术**使新的建筑风格得以实现。"},
49520:{"w":"technical","e":"This job requires someone with specialized technical knowledge.","t":"该工作要求从业者具备专门的**技术**知识。"},
49521:{"w":"technology","e":"Modern technology has made it much easier for people to keep in touch with friends.","t":"现代**技术**让人们与朋友保持联系变得容易多了。"},
49522:{"w":"talent","e":"She showed a great talent for music when she was only five years old.","t":"她年仅五岁时就显示出了非凡的音乐**才能**。"},
49523:{"w":"strength","e":"He lifted the heavy box with all his strength.","t":"他用尽全身的**力气**搬起了那个重箱子。"},
49524:{"w":"strengthen","e":"Regular exercise can strengthen your muscles and your heart.","t":"经常锻炼可以**增强**你的肌肉和心脏。"},
49525:{"w":"weak","e":"After the long illness, she was still too weak to walk far.","t":"久病之后，她还是太**虚弱**，走不了远路。"},
49526:{"w":"weakness","e":"Fear of failure is her biggest weakness, so she always works extra hard.","t":"害怕失败是她最大的**弱点**，所以她总是格外努力。"},
49527:{"w":"trouble","e":"I had some trouble finding the way to the station, but a kind man helped me.","t":"我找去车站的路时遇到了些**麻烦**，不过一位好心人帮了我。"},
49528:{"w":"forgive","e":"Please forgive me for being late, because the bus broke down on the way.","t":"请**原谅**我迟到了，因为公共汽车半路坏了。"},
49529:{"w":"sympathy","e":"I have a lot of sympathy for people who lost their homes in the flood.","t":"我非常**同情**在洪水中失去家园的人。"},
49530:{"w":"attitude","e":"Her positive attitude helps her stay calm even when things go wrong.","t":"她积极的**态度**让她即使事情出了问题也能保持冷静。"},
49531:{"w":"object","e":"The teacher asked us to name the objects on the table in English.","t":"老师让我们用英语说出桌上**物品**的名称。"},
49532:{"w":"objection","e":"If nobody has any objection, we will start the project next week.","t":"如果没人有**异议**，我们下周就开始这个项目。"},
49533:{"w":"treasure","e":"The children found an old box full of treasure on the beach.","t":"孩子们在海滩上发现了一个装满**财宝**的旧箱子。"},
49534:{"w":"benefit","e":"Everyone in the town will benefit from the new library.","t":"镇上的每个人都将从新图书馆中**受益**。"},
49535:{"w":"beneficial","e":"Regular exercise is beneficial to your health.","t":"经常锻炼对你的健康**有益**。"},
49536:{"w":"welfare","e":"The office deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"该办公室专门处理与学生**福利**相关的各种事务。"},
49537:{"w":"honour","e":"It is a great honour for our school to welcome the famous writer.","t":"对我们学校来说，欢迎这位著名作家是莫大的**荣誉**。"},
49538:{"w":"motivation","e":"Her main motivation for learning English is to study abroad.","t":"她学英语的主要**动机**是出国留学。"},
49539:{"w":"qualify","e":"After four years of hard study, she finally qualified as a doctor last summer.","t":"经过四年的刻苦学习，她去年夏天终于**有资格**当医生了。"},
49540:{"w":"qualification","e":"She has all the qualifications needed for this job, including a university degree.","t":"她具备这份工作所需的全部**资格**，包括大学学位。"},
49541:{"w":"identity","e":"You must show your student card to prove your identity before entering the exam room.","t":"进考场前，你必须出示学生证来证明自己的**身份**。"},
49542:{"w":"identification","e":"You must show some identification, such as a passport, to get into the building.","t":"进这栋楼你必须出示**身份证明**，比如护照。"},
49543:{"w":"symbol","e":"The sounds of boat whistles and the moving tides are symbols of a port city.","t":"汽笛声和海浪声是港口城市的**象征**。"},
49544:{"w":"sign","e":"Please sign your name at the bottom of the page before you hand it in.","t":"交上来之前，请在页面底部**签上**你的名字。"},
49545:{"w":"signal","e":"The driver gave a signal before turning left at the crossing.","t":"司机在路口左转之前给出了**信号**。"},
49546:{"w":"gesture","e":"She made a gesture with her hand to tell us to be quiet.","t":"她做了一个**手势**，示意我们安静。"},
49547:{"w":"theme","e":"The main theme of the film is the friendship between a boy and his dog.","t":"这部电影的**主题**是一个男孩和他的狗之间的友谊。"},
49548:{"w":"licence","e":"You have to be at least eighteen to get a driving licence in China.","t":"在中国，你必须年满十八岁才能考取驾驶**执照**。"},
49549:{"w":"level","e":"The noise levels at the site can reach 45 decibels.","t":"在这种场所，噪声**水平**可达45分贝。"},
49550:{"w":"recognise","e":"I had not seen her for ten years, but I recognised her as soon as she smiled.","t":"我十年没见过她了，但她一笑我就**认出**了她。"},
49551:{"w":"feeling","e":"I had a strange feeling that someone was watching me in the dark.","t":"我在黑暗中有种奇怪的**感觉**，好像有人在看着我。"},
49552:{"w":"hide","e":"The children hid behind the door and waited for their father to come in.","t":"孩子们**躲**在门后，等着爸爸进来。"},
49553:{"w":"statue","e":"There is a bronze statue of the famous poet in the middle of the park.","t":"公园中央有一座这位著名诗人的青铜**雕像**。"},
49554:{"w":"portrait","e":"A large portrait of the school's first headmaster hangs on the wall of the main hall.","t":"礼堂的墙上挂着一幅学校第一任校长的大**画像**。"},
49555:{"w":"chance","e":"There is a good chance that it will rain tomorrow.","t":"明天下雨的**可能性**很大。"},
49556:{"w":"mark","e":"There is a dirty mark on your white shirt.","t":"你的白衬衫上有一处**污渍**。"},
49557:{"w":"remark","e":"Several visitors remarked that the city was much cleaner than they had expected.","t":"好几位游客**评论**说，这座城市比他们想象的干净得多。"},
49558:{"w":"complain","e":"John complains that the resource centre has limited opening hours.","t":"约翰**抱怨**说信息中心的开放时间有限。"},
49559:{"w":"declare","e":"The mayor declared that the new bridge would open next year.","t":"市长**宣布**新桥将于明年通车。"},
49560:{"w":"whisper","e":"I saw Peter whisper something to Michael.","t":"我看见彼得跟迈克尔**小声说**了些什么。"},
49561:{"w":"explain","e":"Can you explain why the sky is blue?","t":"你能**解释**一下天空为什么是蓝色的吗？"},
49562:{"w":"explanation","e":"The teacher gave a clear explanation of how plants make food.","t":"老师对植物如何制造养分作了清楚的**解释**。"},
49563:{"w":"shout","e":"Don't shout in the library, because other people are trying to study.","t":"别在图书馆里**大喊大叫**，其他人正在努力学习。"},
49564:{"w":"reply","e":"He asked me a question, but I didn't know how to reply.","t":"他问了我一个问题，可我不知道怎么**回答**。"},
49565:{"w":"slip","e":"Tom slipped on the ice and broke his leg.","t":"汤姆在冰上**滑了一跤**，摔断了腿。"},
49566:{"w":"sink","e":"The heavy stone sank to the bottom of the pond.","t":"那块沉重的石头**沉**到了池塘底部。"},
49567:{"w":"slide","e":"For frequent usage, the drawers slide in and out easily.","t":"由于频繁使用，抽屉很容易**滑**进滑出。"},
49568:{"w":"crowd","e":"A large crowd gathered outside the stadium, waiting for the famous singer to arrive.","t":"大批**人群**聚集在体育场外，等待那位著名歌手的到来。"},
49569:{"w":"switch","e":"Can you turn on the light? The switch is next to the door.","t":"你能把灯打开吗？**开关**就在门旁边。"},
49570:{"w":"transform","e":"The Internet has transformed the way people shop, work and talk to each other.","t":"互联网**彻底改变**了人们购物、工作和交流的方式。"},
49571:{"w":"reform","e":"The government plans to reform the school system so that students have less homework.","t":"政府计划**改革**学校制度，让学生的作业少一些。"},
49572:{"w":"replace","e":"We need to replace the old windows before the cold weather arrives.","t":"我们得在寒冷天气到来之前**更换**旧窗户。"},
49573:{"w":"sharp","e":"Be careful with that knife. It is very sharp.","t":"小心那把刀，它非常**锋利**。"},
49574:{"w":"sharpen","e":"He sharpened his pencil with a small knife before the exam.","t":"考试前，他用小刀把铅笔**削尖**了。"},
49575:{"w":"shape","e":"The cloud had the shape of a rabbit with long ears.","t":"那朵云的**形状**像一只长耳朵的兔子。"},
49576:{"w":"measure","e":"The nurse measured my height and weight before I saw the doctor.","t":"看医生之前，护士给我**测量**了身高和体重。"},
49577:{"w":"ahead","e":"Go straight ahead and you will see the bank on your left.","t":"一直**向前**走，你就会看到银行在你左边。"},
49578:{"w":"effect","e":"The new rule has had a good effect on the students' reading habits.","t":"这项新规定对学生的阅读习惯产生了良好的**影响**。"},
49579:{"w":"sense","e":"She had a strange sense that someone was watching her.","t":"她有种奇怪的**感觉**，好像有人在看着她。"},
49580:{"w":"sensible","e":"It is sensible to take an umbrella when the sky looks so dark.","t":"天色这么暗，带把伞是很**明智**的。"},
49581:{"w":"sensitive","e":"My skin is very sensitive to the sun, so I always wear a hat in summer.","t":"我的皮肤对阳光很**敏感**，所以夏天总戴着帽子。"},
49582:{"w":"mean","e":"What does this word mean, and how do you use it in a sentence?","t":"这个单词是什么**意思**，你怎么在句子里用它？"},
49583:{"w":"means","e":"Plants can defend themselves by using both physical and chemical means.","t":"植物可以通过物理以及化学的**方法**保护自己。"},
49584:{"w":"meaning","e":"If you don't know the meaning of a word, look it up in a dictionary.","t":"如果你不知道一个词的**意思**，就查查词典。"},
49585:{"w":"meanwhile","e":"Tina's due to arrive on Sunday. Meanwhile, what do we do?","t":"蒂娜定于星期天到，**这期间**我们做什么呢？"},
49586:{"w":"matter","e":"It does not matter whether you win or lose, as long as you try your best.","t":"你是赢是输都**不要紧**，只要尽了全力。"},
49587:{"w":"case","e":"In this case, we should ask the teacher for help.","t":"在这种**情况**下，我们应该向老师求助。"},
49588:{"w":"point","e":"The teacher pointed at the map and showed us where the river begins.","t":"老师**指**着地图，告诉我们这条河从哪里发源。"},
49589:{"w":"quality","e":"The quality of the food in this restaurant is excellent.","t":"这家餐厅食物的**质量**非常好。"},
49590:{"w":"relate","e":"That's the office that deals with all matters related to student welfare.","t":"那间就是负责处理所有**有关**学生福利待遇问题的办公室。"},
49591:{"w":"relation","e":"The relation between students and teachers is generally good in this university.","t":"这所大学里师生间的**关系**总体来说很好。"},
49592:{"w":"relationship","e":"Researchers have found a close relationship between the amount of sleep students get and their exam results.","t":"研究人员发现，学生的睡眠时间与考试成绩之间有着密切的**关系**。"},
49593:{"w":"link","e":"A new bridge will link the island to the mainland next year.","t":"明年一座新桥将把这个岛和大陆**连接**起来。"},
49594:{"w":"connect","e":"What special food and activities are connected with this festival?","t":"有什么特别的食物和活动与这个节日**相关**？"},
49595:{"w":"connection","e":"Scientists have found a connection between lack of sleep and poor memory.","t":"科学家发现缺少睡眠和记忆力差之间存在**联系**。"},
49596:{"w":"combine","e":"The school plans to combine the two classes into one next year.","t":"学校计划明年把这两个班**合并**成一个。"},
49597:{"w":"mix","e":"Mix the flour and the eggs together, then add a little milk.","t":"把面粉和鸡蛋**搅拌**在一起，然后加一点牛奶。"},
49598:{"w":"mixture","e":"Today, scientists continue to experiment with new glass mixtures.","t":"如今，科学家们继续对新型的玻璃**混合物**进行试验。"},
49599:{"w":"unite","e":"The people of the two villages united to build a new road through the hills.","t":"两个村庄的人**联合**起来，修了一条穿过山区的新路。"},
49600:{"w":"habit","e":"Brushing your teeth before bed is a good habit for your health.","t":"睡前刷牙是有益健康的好**习惯**。"},
49601:{"w":"hobby","e":"My father's hobby is growing vegetables in the small garden behind our house.","t":"我爸爸的**业余爱好**是在屋后的小菜园里种菜。"},
49602:{"w":"taste","e":"This soup tastes a little salty, so please add some water.","t":"这汤**吃起来**有点咸，请加点水。"},
49603:{"w":"leisure","e":"Some people believe that children's leisure activities must be educational, otherwise they are a complete waste of time.","t":"一些人认为，孩子们的**休闲**活动必须具有教育意义，否则纯粹是浪费时间。"},
49604:{"w":"tradition","e":"Individuals often find it hard to escape from the role that cultural traditions have defined for them.","t":"人们经常发现难以摆脱文化**传统**给自己限定的角色。"},
49605:{"w":"balance","e":"It is hard to balance schoolwork with sports, but good planning helps.","t":"要**平衡**学业和运动不容易，但好的规划会有帮助。"},
49606:{"w":"remote","e":"She grew up in a remote village in the mountains, far from any town.","t":"她在大山里一个**偏僻**的村子长大，离哪个镇都很远。"},
49607:{"w":"initial","e":"Interest will be charged after the initial 60-day interest-free period.","t":"过了**最初**60天的免息期后，就要开始收取利息了。"},
49608:{"w":"absorb","e":"Trees can absorb carbon dioxide.","t":"树木可以**吸收**二氧化碳。"},
49609:{"w":"culture","e":"Learning a foreign language is a good way to understand the culture of another country.","t":"学习外语是了解另一个国家**文化**的好方法。"},
49610:{"w":"apply","e":"You can apply for the summer camp online before the end of May.","t":"你可以在五月底前在网上**申请**参加夏令营。"},
49611:{"w":"applicant","e":"We have interviewed twenty-six applicants and none of them are qualified.","t":"我们已经面试了26个**申请者**，没一人符合条件。"},
49612:{"w":"application","e":"You need to fill in an application form before you can join the club.","t":"加入俱乐部之前，你得先填一份**申请**表。"},
49613:{"w":"candidate","e":"Each candidate gave a short speech before the students voted.","t":"投票前，每位**候选人**都做了简短的演讲。"},
49614:{"w":"elect","e":"Our class will elect a new monitor next Monday after the teacher's speech.","t":"下周一老师讲话后，我们班将**选举**一名新班长。"},
49615:{"w":"vote","e":"Everyone in the class will vote for a new monitor tomorrow morning.","t":"明天上午全班同学将**投票**选出新班长。"},
49616:{"w":"compare","e":"How are the expectations of today's school leavers different compared with those of the previous generation?","t":"与上一届**相比**，现在毕业生的期望有何不同？"},
49617:{"w":"barrier","e":"When she first moved to Japan, the language barrier made it hard to make friends.","t":"她刚搬到日本时，语言**障碍**让她很难交到朋友。"},
49618:{"w":"commercial","e":"The research findings report commercial rather than political trends.","t":"这些研究结果反映了**商业**趋势而非政治趋势。"},
49619:{"w":"generous","e":"Our neighbour is generous and often gives vegetables from her garden to us.","t":"我们的邻居很**大方**，常常把自家花园里的蔬菜送给我们。"},
49620:{"w":"selfish","e":"It was selfish of him to eat all the cake without saving any for his sister.","t":"他把蛋糕全吃了，一点也没给妹妹留，真是太**自私**了。"},
49621:{"w":"profit","e":"The company made a profit of ten million yuan last year.","t":"这家公司去年获得了一千万元的**利润**。"},
49622:{"w":"command","e":"The officer commanded his soldiers to stay where they were until morning.","t":"军官**命令**士兵们原地待到天亮。"},
49623:{"w":"praise","e":"The teacher praised him for his hard work and good manners.","t":"老师**表扬**了他的勤奋和礼貌。"},
49624:{"w":"congratulate","e":"I wanted to congratulate you all on having passed the exam.","t":"大家都通过了考试，我向你们**表示祝贺**。"},
49625:{"w":"congratulation","e":"Congratulations on winning the first prize in the speech contest!","t":"**祝贺**你在演讲比赛中获得一等奖！"},
49626:{"w":"patient","e":"The nurse was very patient with the old man who kept asking the same question.","t":"护士对那位一直问同一个问题的老人很**有耐心**。"},
49627:{"w":"patience","e":"Learning a new language takes a lot of patience, but it is worth it.","t":"学一门新语言需要很大的**耐心**，但这是值得的。"},
49628:{"w":"passive","e":"Instead of being passive in class, try to ask questions and share your ideas.","t":"上课时不要**被动**听讲，试着提问并分享你的想法。"},
49629:{"w":"puzzle","e":"Her strange answer puzzled everyone in the room, and nobody knew what to say.","t":"她那奇怪的回答让屋里的每个人都感到**迷惑**，没人知道该说什么。"},
49630:{"w":"concentrate","e":"I can't concentrate on my homework when the TV is on in the next room.","t":"隔壁房间开着电视时，我没法**专心**写作业。"},
49631:{"w":"considerate","e":"It was very considerate of you to bring me soup when I was ill.","t":"我生病时你给我送汤，真是太**体贴**了。"},
49632:{"w":"consideration","e":"After a few moments' consideration, they refused the invitation.","t":"他们**考虑**片刻后，拒绝了邀请。"},
49633:{"w":"optimistic","e":"Psychologists have conducted studies showing that people become more optimistic when the weather is sunny.","t":"心理学家已进行的研究表明，人们在阳光灿烂的日子里会更加**乐观**。"},
49634:{"w":"outgoing","e":"Lucy is an outgoing girl who makes new friends easily.","t":"露西是个**外向**的女孩，很容易结交新朋友。"},
49635:{"w":"embarrass","e":"My mother embarrassed me by showing my baby photos to all my friends.","t":"妈妈把我小时候的照片拿给所有朋友看，让我十分**窘迫**。"},
49636:{"w":"curious","e":"The curious child asked a lot of questions about the stars.","t":"这个**好奇的**孩子问了许多关于星星的问题。"},
49637:{"w":"excite","e":"The idea of a school trip to the seaside excites all of us.","t":"去海边学校旅行的想法让我们大家都很**兴奋**。"},
49638:{"w":"anxious","e":"She felt anxious about the test results and could not sleep.","t":"她为考试成绩感到**忧虑**，睡不着觉。"},
49639:{"w":"anxiety","e":"Many students feel a lot of anxiety in the weeks before their final exams.","t":"许多学生在期末考试前几周感到非常**焦虑**。"},
49640:{"w":"nervous","e":"I always feel nervous before I speak in front of the class.","t":"在全班同学面前发言之前，我总是感到**紧张**。"},
49641:{"w":"fear","e":"Many children have a fear of the dark and cannot sleep alone.","t":"许多孩子对黑暗心怀**恐惧**，不敢一个人睡。"},
49642:{"w":"upset","e":"The coming final exam upsets the students a lot.","t":"期末考试即将来临，学生们**心烦意乱**。"},
49643:{"w":"common","e":"Smith is one of the most common family names in Britain and the United States.","t":"史密斯是英国和美国最**普通**的姓氏之一。"},
49644:{"w":"gradual","e":"There has been a gradual rise in the number of students who walk to school.","t":"步行上学的学生人数在**逐渐**增加。"},
49645:{"w":"shame","e":"It is a shame that you can't come to my birthday party.","t":"你不能来参加我的生日聚会，真是**遗憾**。"},
49646:{"w":"ashamed","e":"I felt ashamed of myself for lying to my best friend about the broken phone.","t":"我因为手机摔坏的事对好朋友撒了谎，感到很**惭愧**。"},
49647:{"w":"bit","e":"Hot coffee is a bit hard to carry.","t":"热咖啡**有点**不好拿。"},
49648:{"w":"stable","e":"The society will remain stable over the long term.","t":"社会将保持长期**稳定**。"},
49649:{"w":"firm","e":"My uncle works for a small firm that makes toys.","t":"我叔叔在一家生产玩具的小**公司**工作。"},
49650:{"w":"peace","e":"People all over the world hope for peace.","t":"全世界的人都希望**和平**。"},
49651:{"w":"peaceful","e":"We spent a peaceful afternoon reading by the quiet lake.","t":"我们在安静的湖边读书，度过了一个**安宁的**下午。"},
49652:{"w":"neighbourhood","e":"There are several good schools and a large park in our neighbourhood.","t":"我们家**附近**有好几所好学校和一个大公园。"},
49653:{"w":"countryside","e":"We spent the summer holiday in the countryside with our grandparents.","t":"暑假我们和祖父母在**乡下**度过。"},
49654:{"w":"system","e":"Our school has a new system for students to borrow books online from the library.","t":"我们学校有了一套新**系统**，学生可以在网上向图书馆借书。"},
49655:{"w":"systematic","e":"She made a systematic study of birds, writing down everything she saw.","t":"她对鸟类做了**系统的**研究，把看到的一切都记了下来。"},
49656:{"w":"litter","e":"Please do not litter in the park; use the bins instead.","t":"请不要在公园里**乱丢杂物**，要用垃圾桶。"},
49657:{"w":"drunk","e":"He was too drunk to drive, so his friend took him home in a taxi.","t":"他**喝醉**了，不能开车，所以朋友打车送他回了家。"},
49658:{"w":"care","e":"Doctors and nurses care about every patient in this hospital.","t":"这家医院里的医生和护士**关心**每一位病人。"},
49659:{"w":"function","e":"The main function of the heart is to pump blood around the body.","t":"心脏的主要**功能**是把血液输送到全身。"},
49660:{"w":"stress","e":"Students often feel stress before important exams, so they need time to relax.","t":"学生在重要考试前常常感到**压力**，所以需要时间放松。"},
49661:{"w":"energy","e":"Children have so much energy that they can run around all day.","t":"孩子们**精力**充沛，可以整天跑来跑去。"},
49662:{"w":"energetic","e":"My grandmother is still very energetic and goes hiking every weekend.","t":"我奶奶依然**精力充沛**，每个周末都去徒步。"},
49663:{"w":"power","e":"The king had great power, and nobody dared to disagree with him.","t":"国王拥有极大的**权力**，没人敢反对他。"},
49664:{"w":"powerful","e":"The new engine is far more powerful than the old one and uses less fuel.","t":"新发动机比旧的**强大**得多，而且更省油。"},
49665:{"w":"fuel","e":"The plane had to land because it was running out of fuel.","t":"飞机快没**燃料**了，只好降落。"},
49666:{"w":"produce","e":"This factory produces about ten thousand cars every year.","t":"这家工厂每年**生产**大约一万辆汽车。"},
49667:{"w":"product","e":"This company sells its products in more than thirty countries around the world.","t":"这家公司的**产品**销往全球三十多个国家。"},
49668:{"w":"output","e":"The factory has doubled its output since it bought the new machines last year.","t":"自从去年买了新机器，这家工厂的**产量**翻了一番。"},
49669:{"w":"force","e":"She'd like to finish the studies she was forced to give up earlier in life.","t":"她想完成自己早年**被迫**放弃的研究。"},
49670:{"w":"effort","e":"Henry has put a lot of effort into communicating with new friends.","t":"亨利非常**努力**地与新朋友进行交流。"},
49671:{"w":"breath","e":"You can see your breath on a cold morning.","t":"在寒冷的早晨，你能看见自己呼出的**气息**。"},
49672:{"w":"breathe","e":"The air in the city was so dirty that it was hard to breathe.","t":"城里的空气太脏，让人很难**呼吸**。"},
49673:{"w":"possible","e":"Is it possible to finish the project by Friday?","t":"周五之前**可能**完成这个项目吗？"},
49674:{"w":"possibility","e":"Is there any possibility that the meeting will be moved to next week?","t":"会议有没有**可能**改到下周？"},
49675:{"w":"impossible","e":"This kind of research would be impossible without computers.","t":"没有计算机就**无法**进行这种研究。"},
49676:{"w":"risk","e":"Driving too fast in the rain greatly increases the risk of an accident.","t":"雨天开快车会大大增加发生事故的**风险**。"},
49677:{"w":"article","e":"I read an interesting article about pandas in the school magazine.","t":"我在校刊上读到一篇关于大熊猫的有趣**文章**。"},
49678:{"w":"goods","e":"The shop sells goods from all over the world.","t":"这家商店出售来自世界各地的**商品**。"},
49679:{"w":"process","e":"Reforming the educational system will be a difficult process.","t":"教育制度的改革将是一个艰难的**过程**。"},
49680:{"w":"procedure","e":"You must follow the correct procedure when you borrow books from the library.","t":"从图书馆借书时，你必须遵守正确的**程序**。"},
49681:{"w":"channel","e":"We're doing some market research for a new television channel starting in two years' time.","t":"我们正在为日后两年内开通一个新的电视**频道**做市场调查。"},
49682:{"w":"pattern","e":"How do you think the Internet has affected buying patterns in the past few years?","t":"你认为在过去几年内互联网如何影响了购买**模式**？"},
49683:{"w":"programme","e":"They had a meeting to set up the programme.","t":"他们开会启动了**项目**。"},
49684:{"w":"participate","e":"More and more women are participating in politics.","t":"越来越多的女性**投身**政治。"},
49685:{"w":"demand","e":"There is a growing demand for English teachers in many cities.","t":"许多城市对英语教师的**需求**越来越大。"},
49686:{"w":"quantity","e":"This medicine will reduce the quantity of blood flowing through the body.","t":"这种药会减少体内的血流**量**。"},
49687:{"w":"progress","e":"Tom has made great progress in English since he joined the speaking club.","t":"汤姆加入口语俱乐部以后，英语**进步**很大。"},
49688:{"w":"count","e":"Every vote counts in the class election.","t":"在班级选举中，每一票都**很重要**。"},
49689:{"w":"average","e":"How many hours a day on average do you watch TV?","t":"你**平均**每天看几个小时电视？"},
49690:{"w":"amount","e":"A large amount of rain fell last night, and the river rose quickly.","t":"昨晚下了**大量**的雨，河水涨得很快。"},
49691:{"w":"dozen","e":"She bought a dozen eggs at the market this morning.","t":"今天早上她在市场买了**一打**鸡蛋。"},
49692:{"w":"mass","e":"Mass use of motor vehicles has killed or injured millions of people.","t":"机动车的**大量**使用已造成数百万人伤亡。"},
49693:{"w":"total","e":"The total cost of the trip was about two thousand yuan.","t":"这次旅行的**总**费用大约是两千元。"},
49694:{"w":"graduate","e":"Nowadays, there are not many job opportunities which graduates can look forward to.","t":"现在，本科**毕业生**所能期望的就业机会并不多。"},
49695:{"w":"senior","e":"She is the most senior teacher in our school and has taught here for thirty years.","t":"她是我们学校**资格最老的**老师，已在这里教了三十年。"},
49696:{"w":"junior","e":"She started as a junior clerk and became the manager of the bank ten years later.","t":"她从一名**资历较浅的**职员做起，十年后当上了银行经理。"},
49697:{"w":"teenager","e":"Many teenagers spend more than three hours a day on their phones.","t":"许多**青少年**每天花三个多小时在手机上。"},
49698:{"w":"adult","e":"Children under twelve must be with an adult when they swim in this pool.","t":"十二岁以下的儿童在这个泳池游泳时必须有**成年人**陪同。"},
49699:{"w":"adolescent","e":"The adolescent always respects parents who admit their mistakes.","t":"**青少年**往往尊敬能承认错误的父母。"},
49700:{"w":"youth","e":"Many people spend their youth studying hard for the college entrance exam.","t":"许多人把**青春**都花在为高考努力学习上。"},
49701:{"w":"childhood","e":"She spent a happy childhood in a small village by the sea.","t":"她在海边的小村庄里度过了幸福的**童年**。"},
49702:{"w":"mankind","e":"The invention of the computer was one of the greatest steps forward for mankind.","t":"计算机的发明是**人类**最伟大的进步之一。"},
49703:{"w":"beast","e":"In the old story, a brave young man saved the village from a terrible beast.","t":"在那个古老的故事里，一个勇敢的年轻人从一头可怕的**野兽**手中救下了村庄。"},
49704:{"w":"creature","e":"The ocean is home to many strange creatures that people have never seen before.","t":"海洋里生活着许多人们从未见过的奇怪**生物**。"},
49705:{"w":"homeland","e":"Many years later, he returned to his homeland to see his family again.","t":"许多年后，他回到**祖国**，再次见到了家人。"},
49706:{"w":"agent","e":"We booked our holiday through a travel agent, who found us a cheap hotel near the beach.","t":"我们通过旅游**代理**订了假期，他帮我们在海边找了家便宜的酒店。"},
49707:{"w":"agency","e":"The agency helps young people find jobs.","t":"这家**机构**帮助年轻人找工作。"},
49708:{"w":"citizen","e":"Every citizen has the right to vote when he or she is eighteen.","t":"每个**公民**年满十八岁就有投票权。"},
49709:{"w":"previous","e":"Coffee became cheaper than it had been for the previous years.","t":"咖啡的价格比**前**些年低。"},
49710:{"w":"usual","e":"He arrived at school earlier than usual this morning.","t":"今天早上他比**平常**早到学校。"},
49711:{"w":"unusual","e":"It is unusual for snow to fall in this part of the country in April.","t":"在这个国家的这一地区，四月下雪是**不寻常**的。"},
49712:{"w":"practice","e":"You need a lot of practice before you can play the piano well.","t":"要想把钢琴弹好，你需要大量**练习**。"},
49713:{"w":"practical","e":"The new invention was very practical.","t":"这项新发明很**实用**。"},
49714:{"w":"involve","e":"Two other students were involved in the fight and had to see the headmaster.","t":"另外两名学生也**卷入**了这场打架，不得不去见校长。"},
49715:{"w":"indicate","e":"Dark clouds in the sky indicate that it is going to rain soon.","t":"天上的乌云**表明**很快就要下雨了。"},
49716:{"w":"envy","e":"Many of my classmates envy me because my father often takes me abroad on holiday.","t":"班上很多同学都**羡慕**我，因为爸爸常带我出国度假。"},
49717:{"w":"interrupt","e":"Please don't interrupt me when I am talking on the phone with my boss.","t":"我和老板打电话时请不要**打断**我。"},
49718:{"w":"destroy","e":"The big fire destroyed more than fifty houses in the small mountain village.","t":"这场大火**毁掉**了这个小山村里的五十多所房子。"},
49719:{"w":"upper","e":"Helen lived on the upper floor.","t":"海伦住在楼**上**。"},
49720:{"w":"beneath","e":"Shall we have a rest in the shade beneath these trees?","t":"我们在树阴**下**休息一下好吗？"},
49721:{"w":"prove","e":"Scientists have proved that regular exercise can help people sleep better at night.","t":"科学家已经**证明**，经常锻炼能帮助人们晚上睡得更好。"},
49722:{"w":"approve","e":"You can begin making purchases immediately after your application is approved.","t":"你的申请得到**批准**后，马上就可以购买了。"},
49723:{"w":"approval","e":"The students need their parents' approval before they can join the school trip.","t":"学生们需要得到父母的**同意**才能参加学校的旅行。"},
49724:{"w":"forecast","e":"The economic report forecast a sharp drop in unemployment for the next year.","t":"据经济报告**预测**，来年的失业人数将明显减少。"},
49725:{"w":"foresee","e":"What changes do you foresee in the educational field in the next 50 years?","t":"在未来的50年里，你**预见**教育界会发生什么变化？"},
49726:{"w":"examine","e":"He examined the work of other researchers.","t":"他**检查**了其他研究人员的工作。"},
49727:{"w":"examination","e":"I studied hard all week for the history examination, so I felt ready on Monday.","t":"我整整一周都在为历史**考试**用功复习，所以周一觉得很有把握。"},
49728:{"w":"test","e":"We have a spelling test every Friday morning.","t":"我们每个星期五早上都有拼写**测试**。"},
49729:{"w":"finance","e":"Opponents of smoking financed this study.","t":"反对吸烟的人士为这一研究**提供了资金**。"},
49730:{"w":"financial","e":"The government introduced new rules to protect the financial system after several banks collapsed during the crisis.","t":"在危机中几家银行倒闭后，政府出台了新规来保护**金融**体系。"},
49731:{"w":"budget","e":"I'm going to talk about ways of making sure that you eat well while at the same time staying within your budget.","t":"我将会谈到一些方法，让你在不超过**预算**的前提下吃好。"},
49732:{"w":"check","e":"The teacher has checked Kate's answers.","t":"老师**检查**了凯特的答案。"},
49733:{"w":"cheque","e":"He wrote a cheque for fifty pounds and handed it to the shopkeeper.","t":"他开了一张五十英镑的**支票**，递给店主。"},
49734:{"w":"operate","e":"The lift didn't operate.","t":"电梯不**运转**了。"},
49735:{"w":"operation","e":"The rescue operation continued through the night as firefighters searched the collapsed building for survivors.","t":"救援**行动**持续了一整夜，消防员在倒塌的大楼里搜寻幸存者。"},
49736:{"w":"accumulate","e":"Dust will accumulate quickly on the shelves if nobody cleans the room for weeks.","t":"如果几周没人打扫房间，架子上的灰尘很快就会**堆积**起来。"},
49737:{"w":"advance","e":"The soldiers began to advance toward the town.","t":"士兵们开始向小镇**推进**。"},
49738:{"w":"general","e":"The general opinion is that the new rule is a good one.","t":"**普遍的**看法是，这条新规定很好。"},
49739:{"w":"continue","e":"Please continue reading the text while I check your homework.","t":"我检查作业的时候，请大家**继续**读课文。"},
49740:{"w":"immediately","e":"Please call me immediately if you have any trouble with the new computer.","t":"如果你在使用新电脑时遇到任何麻烦，请**立即**给我打电话。"},
49741:{"w":"mental","e":"Health is a complete state of physical, mental and social well-being.","t":"健康是生理、**心理**以及交际情况的一种整体良好状态。"},
49742:{"w":"physical","e":"Doctors say regular physical exercise is good for both your body and your mind.","t":"医生说，经常进行**身体**锻炼对身心都有好处。"},
49743:{"w":"physics","e":"My brother is studying physics at university and wants to become a scientist.","t":"我哥哥在大学里学**物理**，想成为一名科学家。"},
49744:{"w":"sudden","e":"The sudden noise made everyone in the room jump.","t":"**突然**的响声把屋里的人都吓了一跳。"},
49745:{"w":"smooth","e":"The baby's skin is as smooth as silk, and it feels lovely to touch.","t":"宝宝的皮肤像丝绸一样**光滑**，摸起来很舒服。"},
49746:{"w":"certain","e":"I am certain that she will pass the exam because she has worked so hard.","t":"我**确信**她会通过考试，因为她学习太努力了。"},
49747:{"w":"complex","e":"The rules of the game are too complex for young children to understand.","t":"这个游戏的规则太**复杂**，小孩子理解不了。"},
49748:{"w":"accurate","e":"The forecast was soon proved accurate.","t":"不久，预言就被证明是**正确**的。"},
49749:{"w":"accuracy","e":"The technician placed the machine in the correct spot with complete accuracy.","t":"技术员**分毫不差**地将机器安放在正确的位置。"},
49750:{"w":"correct","e":"Please correct the mistakes in your essay before you hand it in.","t":"交作文之前，请**改正**文中的错误。"},
49751:{"w":"fun","e":"The games at the class party last night were full of fun.","t":"昨晚班级聚会上的游戏充满了**乐趣**。"},
49752:{"w":"funny","e":"The clown's funny hat made all the children laugh out loud.","t":"小丑那顶**可笑的**帽子把孩子们逗得哈哈大笑。"},
49753:{"w":"cautious","e":"We should be more cautious not to make any mistakes in our papers.","t":"我们要更加**小心**以避免在试卷上出现任何错误。"},
49754:{"w":"caution","e":"You should exercise extreme caution when driving in fog.","t":"在雾中开车要格外**小心**。"},
49755:{"w":"tolerate","e":"Younger people tend to tolerate noise better than their elders.","t":"年轻人比年长者更能**承受**噪音。"},
49756:{"w":"temporary","e":"Coal mining makes only temporary use of the land and produces no toxic chemical wastes.","t":"煤矿开采只是**暂时**使用这片土地，不会产生任何有毒的化学废弃物。"},
49757:{"w":"contemporary","e":"The museum has a large collection of contemporary art from young Chinese painters.","t":"这家博物馆收藏了大量中国青年画家的**当代**艺术作品。"},
49758:{"w":"brief","e":"The manager gave a brief talk to welcome the new workers on their first day.","t":"经理在新员工上班第一天作了**简短**的欢迎讲话。"},
49759:{"w":"positive","e":"Customer comments, both positive and negative, are recorded by staff.","t":"对于顾客的意见，无论是**肯定的**还是否定的，都由职员予以记录。"},
49760:{"w":"absolute","e":"There is no absolute standard for beauty.","t":"美没有**绝对**的标准。"},
49761:{"w":"brilliant","e":"She is a brilliant young scientist who has won many prizes.","t":"她是一位**有才气的**年轻科学家，获得过许多奖项。"},
49762:{"w":"blame","e":"Don't blame him for the mistake; it was not his fault.","t":"别因为这个错误**责怪**他，那不是他的错。"},
49763:{"w":"scold","e":"My mother scolded me for coming home late without calling her first.","t":"我回家晚了又没先打电话，妈妈**责骂**了我一顿。"},
49764:{"w":"determine","e":"Before enrollment, students must take a test to determine the level of class they enter.","t":"入学前，学生必须参加入学考试来**确定**他们进入何种等级的班级。"},
49765:{"w":"social","e":"Pollution is a serious social problem that affects the lives of millions of people.","t":"污染是一个影响数百万人生活的严重**社会**问题。"},
49766:{"w":"society","e":"Our society needs more people who are willing to help others.","t":"我们的**社会**需要更多乐于助人的人。"},
49767:{"w":"policy","e":"The school has a new policy that students must not bring phones to class.","t":"学校出台了一项新**政策**，学生不得带手机进教室。"},
49768:{"w":"political","e":"The two parties have very different political views.","t":"这两个政党的**政治**观点很不一样。"},
49769:{"w":"politics","e":"My father reads the news every day because he is very interested in politics.","t":"我爸爸每天都看新闻，因为他对**政治**很感兴趣。"},
49770:{"w":"wedding","e":"Their wedding will be held in a small church next month.","t":"他们的**婚礼**下个月将在一座小教堂举行。"},
49771:{"w":"divorce","e":"After ten years of marriage, they decided to get a divorce and live separately.","t":"结婚十年后，他们决定**离婚**，分开生活。"},
49772:{"w":"dawn","e":"We got up at dawn to watch the sun rise.","t":"我们**黎明**时就起床去看日出。"},
49773:{"w":"dusk","e":"The street lights come on at dusk, and the park slowly becomes quiet.","t":"**黄昏**时路灯亮起，公园渐渐安静下来。"},
49774:{"w":"darkness","e":"She was afraid of the darkness and always slept with a small light on.","t":"她怕**黑暗**，总是开着一盏小灯睡觉。"},
49775:{"w":"behalf","e":"I am writing this letter on behalf of all the students in our class.","t":"我**代表**我们班所有同学写这封信。"},
49776:{"w":"fetch","e":"Please go and fetch a chair from the next room.","t":"请去隔壁房间把椅子**取来**。"},
49777:{"w":"vain","e":"He made a vain attempt to catch the last bus, but it had already left.","t":"他**徒劳地**追赶末班车，可车已经开走了。"},
49778:{"w":"shave","e":"My father shaves every morning in the bathroom before he has breakfast and goes to work.","t":"我爸爸每天早上在浴室里**刮胡子**，然后吃早饭去上班。"},
49779:{"w":"jog","e":"I jog in the park for half an hour every morning before school.","t":"我每天早上上学前都在公园里**慢跑**半小时。"},
49780:{"w":"stadium","e":"More than fifty thousand fans filled the stadium to watch the final match.","t":"五万多名球迷挤满了**体育场**，观看决赛。"},
49781:{"w":"per","e":"Tickets cost twenty dollars per person, and children under six can get in free.","t":"门票**每位**二十美元，六岁以下的儿童可以免费入场。"},
49782:{"w":"position","e":"He has been offered a position in a large company in Shanghai.","t":"他得到了上海一家大公司的一个**职位**。"},
49783:{"w":"stage","e":"The next stage of the project is the design phase.","t":"该项目的下一个**阶段**是设计阶段。"},
49784:{"w":"platform","e":"Please stand behind the yellow line while you wait for the train on the platform.","t":"在**站台**上候车时，请站在黄线后面。"},
49785:{"w":"condition","e":"The old house is in good condition, so we can move in at once.","t":"这所旧房子**状况**良好，我们可以马上搬进去。"},
49786:{"w":"situation","e":"The situation was serious, so we called the police at once.","t":"**情况**很严重，所以我们立刻报了警。"},
49787:{"w":"circumstance","e":"Under no circumstances should you leave small children alone in the car.","t":"无论在什么**情况**下，都不要把小孩单独留在车里。"},
49788:{"w":"background","e":"The job requires applicants with a business background.","t":"这份工作要求求职者有商业**背景**。"},
49789:{"w":"status","e":"The chart shows the amount of leisure time enjoyed by men and women of different employment status.","t":"这张图表显示了不同职业**身份**的男性和女性享有多少闲暇时间。"},
49790:{"w":"rank","e":"In the army, a general has a higher rank than a colonel.","t":"在军队里，将军的**军衔**比上校高。"},
49791:{"w":"grade","e":"She got good grades in all her subjects this term.","t":"这学期她所有科目的**成绩**都不错。"},
49792:{"w":"score","e":"She scored ninety-five points in the English test and was the top student in class.","t":"她英语考试**得了**九十五分，是班上第一名。"},
49793:{"w":"income","e":"His monthly income is not high, but he saves some money every month.","t":"他的月**收入**不高，但每个月都会存一些钱。"},
49794:{"w":"salary","e":"She spends a third of her monthly salary on rent for her small flat.","t":"她把每月**薪水**的三分之一都花在了小公寓的房租上。"},
49795:{"w":"wage","e":"In this company, wages are paid at the end of every month.","t":"这家公司每到月末发**工资**。"},
49796:{"w":"bonus","e":"Every worker got a bonus at the end of the year because sales were good.","t":"因为销量好，每个工人年底都拿到了一笔**奖金**。"},
49797:{"w":"credit","e":"The shop gives credit to regular customers, who can pay at the end of the month.","t":"这家店给老顾客**赊账**，他们可以月底再付款。"},
49798:{"w":"hire","e":"She was hired three years ago.","t":"她是三年前被**录用**的。"},
49799:{"w":"employ","e":"The company plans to employ twenty new workers next month.","t":"这家公司计划下个月**雇用**二十名新员工。"},
49800:{"w":"unemployment","e":"The graph shows the unemployment rates in the U.S. and Japan between March 2013 and March 2019.","t":"这张图表显示了从2013年3月至2019年3月六年间美国和日本的**失业**率。"},
49801:{"w":"resign","e":"The minister was forced to resign in 2019.","t":"2019年，该部长被迫**辞职**。"},
49802:{"w":"quit","e":"He quit his job in the bank last year to start his own small business.","t":"他去年**辞去**了银行的工作，自己开了一家小公司。"},
49803:{"w":"withdraw","e":"The army decided to withdraw from the town before the winter came.","t":"军队决定在冬天来临前从小镇**撤回**。"},
49804:{"w":"retire","e":"In this hospital, children under 16 don't need to pay, and the same thing goes for people who have retired.","t":"在这家医院，16岁以下的儿童免费就诊，**退休**人员也可享受同等待遇。"},
49805:{"w":"labour","e":"The workers were tired after eight hours of hard labour in the hot sun.","t":"工人们在烈日下干了八小时的重**体力劳动**，都累了。"},
49806:{"w":"pregnant","e":"The tablets are not given to children under 12 years of age or pregnant or breastfeeding women.","t":"12岁以下的儿童以及处于**妊娠期**或哺乳期的妇女禁用此药。"},
49807:{"w":"atmosphere","e":"The atmosphere at the party was warm and friendly, and everyone enjoyed themselves.","t":"聚会上**气氛**温馨友好，大家都玩得很开心。"},
49808:{"w":"state","e":"The house was in a poor state after years without repair.","t":"这房子多年没有修缮，**状态**很差。"},
49809:{"w":"statement","e":"The statement contradicts the views of the writer.","t":"这些**陈述**与作者的观点相反。"},
49810:{"w":"phenomenon","e":"The greenhouse effect is a natural phenomenon.","t":"温室效应是一种自然**现象**。"},
49811:{"w":"moment","e":"Please wait a moment while I find your file.","t":"请稍等**片刻**，我去找你的文件。"},
49812:{"w":"calm","e":"Stay calm and walk slowly to the exit when the alarm sounds.","t":"警报响起时，要保持**镇静**，慢慢走向出口。"},
49813:{"w":"joy","e":"Her face filled with joy when she heard that she had won the prize.","t":"听说自己得了奖，她脸上充满了**喜悦**。"},
49814:{"w":"delight","e":"The children shouted with delight when they saw the snow.","t":"孩子们一看到雪，就欢呼起来，满心**快乐**。"},
49815:{"w":"inspire","e":"A leader in a group is very important and his confident attitude will inspire his followers greatly.","t":"一个团队里的领导者是非常重要的，他自信的态度会极大地**鼓舞**团队成员。"},
49816:{"w":"relax","e":"Watching TV can help me relax.","t":"看电视可以帮助我**放松**。"},
49817:{"w":"comfortable","e":"This sofa is so comfortable that I fell asleep on it after lunch.","t":"这张沙发太**舒服**了，午饭后我在上面睡着了。"},
49818:{"w":"comfort","e":"A warm hug can comfort a child who is feeling sad.","t":"一个温暖的拥抱可以**安慰**难过的孩子。"},
49819:{"w":"allow","e":"Students are not allowed to use their mobile phones during the final exam.","t":"期末考试期间学生不**允许**使用手机。"},
49820:{"w":"allowance","e":"My parents give me a weekly allowance of fifty yuan for lunch and bus fares.","t":"父母每周给我五十元**零用钱**，用来吃午饭和坐公交。"},
49821:{"w":"forbid","e":"The school rules forbid students to use their mobile phones during the exam.","t":"校规**禁止**学生在考试时使用手机。"},
49822:{"w":"ban","e":"The city decided to ban smoking in all restaurants, offices and other public places.","t":"该市决定在所有餐馆、办公室和其他公共场所**禁止**吸烟。"},
49823:{"w":"follow","e":"Please follow the guide, and don't walk away from the group.","t":"请**跟随**导游，不要离开队伍。"},
49824:{"w":"permit","e":"Visitors are not permitted to take photos inside the museum without asking first.","t":"未经询问，游客不**允许**在博物馆内拍照。"},
49825:{"w":"disagree","e":"My parents often disagree about where to go on holiday.","t":"关于假期去哪儿，我父母常常**意见不一致**。"},
49826:{"w":"shallow","e":"The water at this end of the pool is shallow, so it is safe for small children.","t":"游泳池这一头是**浅水**区，小孩子在这里玩很安全。"},
49827:{"w":"constant","e":"We need to have a constant supply of bikes to tourists.","t":"我们需要**不断地**向游客提供自行车。"},
49828:{"w":"main","e":"The main road was closed because of the accident.","t":"因为发生了事故，**主要**道路被封闭了。"},
49829:{"w":"mainland","e":"The ferry carries tourists between the small island and the mainland every morning.","t":"渡轮每天早上在小岛和**大陆**之间运送游客。"},
49830:{"w":"permanent","e":"After two years of short-term jobs, he finally got a permanent position at a hospital.","t":"打了两年短工之后，他终于在一家医院得到了一份**固定**工作。"},
49831:{"w":"primary","e":"The primary reason for advertising is to sell more goods.","t":"做广告的**首要**目的是要售出更多的货物。"},
49832:{"w":"steady","e":"The van is making steady progress through the dark night.","t":"货车在黑夜中**平稳**行驶。"},
49833:{"w":"instant","e":"For an instant, I thought I saw my old friend in the crowd.","t":"有一**瞬间**，我以为在人群中看到了老朋友。"},
49834:{"w":"former","e":"The world's food production will move from Western Europe to the former communist countries and parts of the developing world.","t":"世界粮食生产将从西欧转移到**前**社会主义国家和一些发展中国家。"},
49835:{"w":"latter","e":"Tom and Jack both offered to help, but I chose the latter.","t":"汤姆和杰克都提出帮忙，但我选了**后者**。"},
49836:{"w":"bite","e":"Don't worry about the dog, because he never bites children or visitors.","t":"别担心那条狗，它从不**咬**小孩或客人。"},
49837:{"w":"bark","e":"Our neighbour's dog barks constantly.","t":"邻居家的狗总是**叫**个不停。"},
49838:{"w":"wag","e":"The dog wagged its tail happily when it saw its owner.","t":"狗看到主人时，高兴地**摇**着尾巴。"},
49839:{"w":"chain","e":"The chain came off my bike on the way to school.","t":"去学校的路上，我自行车的**链条**掉了。"},
49840:{"w":"shake","e":"He shook his head and said he did not agree with the plan.","t":"他**摇**了摇头，说他不同意这个计划。"},
49841:{"w":"casual","e":"You can wear casual clothes to the party; there is no need for a suit.","t":"你可以穿**非正式的**服装去参加聚会，不必穿西装。"},
49842:{"w":"cross","e":"Always look both ways before you cross the road.","t":"**穿过**马路之前，一定要先看看两边。"},
49843:{"w":"across","e":"We walked across the bridge to get to the other side of the river.","t":"我们**穿过**那座桥，走到河的另一边。"},
49844:{"w":"wrinkle","e":"My grandmother has many wrinkles on her face, but her smile is still beautiful.","t":"奶奶脸上有很多**皱纹**，但她的笑容依然很美。"},
49845:{"w":"wave","e":"The little girl waved goodbye to her father at the school gate.","t":"小女孩在校门口向爸爸**挥手**告别。"},
49846:{"w":"receive","e":"I received a letter from my pen friend in Canada this morning.","t":"今天早上我**收到**了加拿大笔友的一封信。"},
49847:{"w":"receipt","e":"Please keep the receipt in case you want to return the shirt later.","t":"请保留好**收据**，以防你以后想退这件衬衫。"},
49848:{"w":"reception","e":"The students' dormitory is to the right of the reception desk.","t":"学生宿舍在**接待处**的右边。"},
49849:{"w":"admit","e":"Bill was forced to admit that he had cheated on the test.","t":"比尔被迫**承认**他在考试中作弊了。"},
49850:{"w":"admission","e":"Admission to the city museum is free for all students on Sunday mornings.","t":"市博物馆星期天上午对所有学生**入场**免费。"},
49851:{"w":"track","e":"The runners were warming up on the track before the race started.","t":"比赛开始前，运动员们正在**跑道**上热身。"},
49852:{"w":"advantage","e":"I suppose your survey has the advantage of more detailed information.","t":"我认为你调查的**优势**在于拥有更加详细的资料。"},
49853:{"w":"disadvantage","e":"What are the advantages and disadvantages of making films of real-life events?","t":"根据真实事件拍摄的电影，其优势和**劣势**分别是什么呢？"},
49854:{"w":"drawback","e":"The only drawback to the plan is the expense.","t":"该计划的唯一**缺点**是费用问题。"},
49855:{"w":"achieve","e":"After two years of hard work, our team achieved great success.","t":"经过两年的努力，我们的团队**取得**了巨大的成功。"},
49856:{"w":"achievement","e":"Winning the national science prize was a remarkable achievement for such a young research team.","t":"对于这样一个年轻的研究团队来说，赢得国家科学奖是一项了不起的**成就**。"},
49857:{"w":"acquire","e":"In the process of evolution, monkeys have not acquired the art of speech.","t":"在进化的过程中，猴子未能**获得**语言能力。"},
49858:{"w":"acquisition","e":"Tom's newest acquisition is a luxurious sports car.","t":"汤姆新**获得**了一辆豪华跑车。"},
49859:{"w":"inquiry","e":"The hotel received many inquiries about room prices after it opened its new swimming pool.","t":"酒店新游泳池开放后，收到了很多关于房价的**询问**。"},
49860:{"w":"judge","e":"You should not judge a person only by his clothes.","t":"你不应该只凭衣着去**判断**一个人。"},
49861:{"w":"judgement","e":"In my judgement, we should wait until the weather gets better before we leave.","t":"依我的**判断**，我们应该等天气好转再出发。"},
49862:{"w":"comment","e":"The teacher wrote a kind comment at the bottom of my essay.","t":"老师在我作文的末尾写了一条友善的**评论**。"},
49863:{"w":"justice","e":"The families of the victims went to court because they wanted justice for their children.","t":"受害者家属上了法庭，因为他们想为孩子讨回**公道**。"},
49864:{"w":"adjust","e":"You can adjust the height of the chair by pulling this handle.","t":"拉这个把手就可以**调节**椅子的高度。"},
49865:{"w":"appreciate","e":"I deeply appreciate your care, but I'm fine now.","t":"我对你的关心深表**感激**，但是现在我很好。"},
49866:{"w":"entertainment","e":"Movies and music are popular forms of entertainment for teenagers.","t":"电影和音乐是青少年常见的**娱乐**方式。"},
49867:{"w":"divide","e":"All the students will be divided into groups of 12 to 15 students.","t":"所有的学生将被**分成**小组，每组12到15人。"},
49868:{"w":"division","e":"Our teacher explained long division with a simple example.","t":"老师用一个简单的例子讲解了长**除法**。"},
49869:{"w":"separate","e":"The solution is not to separate teaching and research, but to recognize that the combination is difficult.","t":"这种解决方案不是要将教学与研究**分离**开，而是承认它们的结合是困难的。"},
49870:{"w":"abandon","e":"She and her tribe had to abandon their lands and retreat to Canada.","t":"她和她的部落被迫**放弃**了土地，退到加拿大。"},
49871:{"w":"remove","e":"Please remove your shoes before you enter the room.","t":"进房间之前请**脱掉**鞋子。"},
49872:{"w":"rid","e":"The new medicine finally rid him of the terrible headaches he had suffered for years.","t":"这种新药终于让他**摆脱**了折磨他多年的剧烈头痛。"},
49873:{"w":"reduce","e":"We should reduce the use of plastic bags to protect the environment.","t":"为了保护环境，我们应该**减少**塑料袋的使用。"},
49874:{"w":"swing","e":"The children took turns on the swing in the park.","t":"孩子们轮流玩公园里的**秋千**。"},
49875:{"w":"bow","e":"When you're introduced to a stranger, you may simply bow to each other.","t":"当你被介绍给一个陌生人的时候，你们可能只是彼此**点一下头**。"},
49876:{"w":"burst","e":"Water pipes often burst in cold weather.","t":"水管在寒冷的天气里经常冻**裂**。"},
49877:{"w":"twist","e":"He twisted his ankle while playing basketball and couldn't walk for a week.","t":"他打篮球时**扭伤**了脚踝，一个星期都走不了路。"},
49878:{"w":"staff","e":"The hospital is staffed by twenty doctors and about sixty nurses.","t":"这家医院**配备**了二十名医生和大约六十名护士。"},
49879:{"w":"collect","e":"I've collected maps and other data to prepare a guidebook.","t":"我已**收集**了地图和其他信息准备写本指南。"},
49880:{"w":"collection","e":"The textile collection of the museum is the largest in the world.","t":"这家博物馆**收藏**的纺织品是全世界最多的。"},
49881:{"w":"monitor","e":"Some worry that governments and industry will be tempted to use the technology to monitor individual behaviour.","t":"有人担心政府和企业会企图利用这项技术来**监控**个人行为。"},
49882:{"w":"contain","e":"This box contains twenty pencils and a small ruler.","t":"这个盒子里**装有**二十支铅笔和一把小尺子。"},
49883:{"w":"load","e":"The workers loaded the boxes onto the truck before noon.","t":"工人们在中午前把箱子**装**上了卡车。"},
49884:{"w":"save","e":"I save ten yuan a week so that I can buy a new football.","t":"我每周**存**十块钱，这样就能买一个新足球。"},
49885:{"w":"waste","e":"Don't waste water, because many places in the world do not have enough.","t":"不要**浪费**水，因为世界上很多地方都缺水。"},
49886:{"w":"lack","e":"Martin can't afford the book due to lack of money.","t":"由于**缺**钱，马丁买不起这本书。"},
49887:{"w":"evaluate","e":"We evaluated the students' skills on the basis of test results.","t":"我们在考试成绩的基础上对学生的技能进行**评估**。"},
49888:{"w":"match","e":"Why do people spend their money on a football match?","t":"为什么人们会花钱看足球**赛**呢？"},
49889:{"w":"term","e":"The new term begins in September, and we will have more homework.","t":"新**学期**九月开始，我们的作业会更多。"},
49890:{"w":"tournament","e":"Our school team won the basketball tournament for the first time this year.","t":"今年我们学校的队伍第一次赢得了篮球**锦标赛**。"},
49891:{"w":"race","e":"Our class won the relay race at the school sports meeting last week.","t":"上周的校运会上，我们班赢得了接力**比赛**。"},
49892:{"w":"calculate","e":"Can you calculate how much we need to pay for the trip?","t":"你能**计算**一下这次旅行我们要付多少钱吗？"},
49893:{"w":"complete","e":"I need an hour to complete my homework.","t":"我需要一个小时来**完成**作业。"},
49894:{"w":"universe","e":"Scientists believe that the universe began with a huge explosion billions of years ago.","t":"科学家相信**宇宙**起源于数十亿年前的一次大爆炸。"},
49895:{"w":"universal","e":"Pollution is a universal problem that affects every country.","t":"污染是影响每个国家的**普遍**问题。"},
49896:{"w":"nation","e":"China is a nation with a long history.","t":"中国是一个历史悠久的**国家**。"},
49897:{"w":"national","e":"The national team trained hard before the big match against Japan.","t":"**国家**队在对阵日本的大赛前刻苦训练。"},
49898:{"w":"nationality","e":"Can you show any proof of your nationality?","t":"你能出示可以证明你**国籍**的证件吗？"},
49899:{"w":"nationwide","e":"The singer will visit ten cities during her nationwide tour this summer.","t":"这位歌手今年夏天的**全国**巡演将走遍十座城市。"},
49900:{"w":"international","e":"The school welcomes international students from more than thirty countries.","t":"这所学校欢迎来自三十多个国家的**国际**学生。"},
49901:{"w":"worldwide","e":"The internet has made it easy to build a worldwide network of friends.","t":"互联网让建立一个**遍及全球的**朋友圈变得很容易。"},
49902:{"w":"spread","e":"The news of their victory spread quickly through the whole school.","t":"他们获胜的消息很快就在全校**传播**开来。"},
49903:{"w":"widespread","e":"Mobile phones are now widespread among students.","t":"手机现在在学生中很**普遍**。"},
49904:{"w":"abstract","e":"Thus, we concluded that the blind interpret abstract shapes as sighted people do.","t":"于是，我们得出结论：盲人与视力正常者对**抽象**形状的理解是一样的。"},
49905:{"w":"throughout","e":"There will be bus services to the university throughout the weekend.","t":"**整个**周末都有公交车去这所大学。"},
49906:{"w":"hunger","e":"Many people in the poor village suffered from hunger after a year without rain.","t":"一年没下雨之后，这个贫困村子里的许多人都在忍受**饥饿**。"},
49907:{"w":"courtyard","e":"The children played games in the courtyard while their parents cooked dinner.","t":"父母做晚饭时，孩子们在**院子**里玩游戏。"},
49908:{"w":"dormitory","e":"Most first-year students live in the dormitory on campus and share a room with three others.","t":"大多数一年级学生住在校园**宿舍**里，和另外三个人合住一间。"},
49909:{"w":"range","e":"The shop sells a wide range of books for young readers.","t":"这家店出售**种类**繁多的青少年读物。"},
49910:{"w":"arrange","e":"The Language Institute activities coordinator can assist students to arrange any sport and leisure activities.","t":"语言学院的活动负责人可以帮助学生**安排**任何体育和休闲活动。"},
49911:{"w":"arrangement","e":"We have made all the arrangements for the school trip, including buses and lunch.","t":"我们已经为学校郊游做好了一切**安排**，包括大巴和午饭。"},
49912:{"w":"distant","e":"Scientists are studying a distant star that is millions of light years away.","t":"科学家们正在研究一颗相距数百万光年的**遥远的**恒星。"},
49913:{"w":"distance","e":"The distance between my home and the school is about two kilometres.","t":"我家和学校之间的**距离**大约有两公里。"},
49914:{"w":"reach","e":"The little boy could not reach the top shelf of the bookcase.","t":"小男孩**够不到**书柜的最上层。"},
49915:{"w":"shoot","e":"The hunter shot at the bird, but he missed.","t":"猎人朝那只鸟**射击**，但没有打中。"},
49916:{"w":"shot","e":"He took a shot at the goal, but the ball went just over the bar.","t":"他朝球门**射门**，但球刚好飞过了横梁。"},
49917:{"w":"touch","e":"Please do not touch the paintings in the museum.","t":"请不要**触摸**博物馆里的画。"},
49918:{"w":"length","e":"The length of the table is about two metres.","t":"这张桌子的**长度**大约是两米。"},
49919:{"w":"space","e":"There is not enough space in this room for a piano.","t":"这个房间里没有足够的**空间**放钢琴。"},
49920:{"w":"bound","e":"If you keep practising, you are bound to get better.","t":"只要坚持练习，你**一定会**进步的。"},
49921:{"w":"border","e":"We passed the border into Mexico.","t":"我们穿越**边境**进入了墨西哥。"},
49922:{"w":"boundary","e":"Mount St. Helens is located along the boundary of two of the moving plates that make up the Earth's crust.","t":"圣海伦斯火山位于组成地壳的两大移动板块的**边界线**上。"},
49923:{"w":"frontier","e":"Soldiers guard the frontier between the two countries day and night.","t":"士兵日夜守卫着两国之间的**边界**。"},
49924:{"w":"edge","e":"Don't put the cup on the edge of the table.","t":"别把杯子放在桌子**边缘**。"},
49925:{"w":"interval","e":"There is a short interval of fifteen minutes between the two parts of the concert.","t":"音乐会上下半场之间有十五分钟的**幕间休息**。"},
49926:{"w":"area","e":"This area of the city is famous for its old streets and small shops.","t":"这座城市的这个**地区**以老街和小店而闻名。"},
49927:{"w":"circle","e":"The children sat in a circle on the grass and listened to the story.","t":"孩子们围成一个**圆圈**坐在草地上听故事。"},
49928:{"w":"circulate","e":"Fresh air circulates through the whole room when we open both windows at night.","t":"晚上我们把两扇窗户都打开时，新鲜空气就在整个房间里**流通**。"},
49929:{"w":"recipe","e":"My mother gave me her recipe for making tomato and egg soup.","t":"妈妈把她做西红柿鸡蛋汤的**食谱**给了我。"},
49930:{"w":"record","e":"She keeps a record of everything she spends each month.","t":"她把每个月花的每一笔钱都做了**记录**。"},
49931:{"w":"alternative","e":"There are two alternative plans, and we can only choose one.","t":"这里有两个**可供选择的**方案，我们只能选一个。"},
49932:{"w":"explore","e":"Architects began to explore ways of creating buildings using the latest technology.","t":"建筑师开始**探索**利用最新技术来建造房屋的方法。"},
49933:{"w":"fluent","e":"She is fluent in English and French because she grew up in Canada.","t":"她在加拿大长大，所以英语和法语都很**流利**。"},
49934:{"w":"native","e":"Our teacher asked us to learn about the native culture of the island.","t":"我们的老师让我们了解这座岛上的**本土**文化。"},
49935:{"w":"aggressive","e":"Our neighbor's dog is quite aggressive and often barks at people passing by.","t":"邻居家的狗很**好斗**，经常冲着路人叫。"},
49936:{"w":"ambiguous","e":"His answer was ambiguous, so we still did not know what he really wanted.","t":"他的回答**模棱两可**，所以我们还是不知道他到底想要什么。"},
49937:{"w":"apparent","e":"This tendency was apparent in the late 1980s.","t":"这种趋势在20世纪80年代末很**明显**。"},
49938:{"w":"artificial","e":"We use no artificial additives of any kind in our products.","t":"我们的产品绝不含任何**人工**添加剂。"},
49939:{"w":"hero","e":"The firefighter became a local hero after he saved three children from the fire.","t":"这位消防员从大火中救出了三个孩子，成了当地的**英雄**。"},
49940:{"w":"sceptical","e":"Many scientists were sceptical about the new theory at first.","t":"起初，许多科学家对这一新理论持**怀疑**态度。"},
49941:{"w":"brave","e":"The brave young man jumped into the river to save a child who was drowning.","t":"那个**勇敢的**年轻人跳进河里，救起了一个溺水的孩子。"},
49942:{"w":"explicit","e":"The directions Jane gave me to get to her home were very explicit.","t":"简十分**清楚**地给我指路去她家。"},
49943:{"w":"origin","e":"Many people want to learn about the origin of the Spring Festival.","t":"很多人想了解春节的**起源**。"},
49944:{"w":"arbitrary","e":"The rule seemed arbitrary, because nobody could explain the reason for it.","t":"这条规则似乎很**武断**，因为没人能解释它的理由。"},
49945:{"w":"data","e":"You have to spend a bit of time making the data a lot clearer.","t":"你要花一点时间把这些**数据**整理得更清楚些。"},
49946:{"w":"database","e":"The library keeps the names of all its books in a large database.","t":"图书馆把所有藏书的书名存在一个大型**数据库**里。"},
49947:{"w":"conscious","e":"She was conscious that everyone in the room was looking at her new dress.","t":"她**意识到**屋里的每个人都在看她的新裙子。"},
49948:{"w":"appropriate","e":"Personality questionnaires are used by many companies to put people in appropriate areas of work.","t":"很多公司通过性格测试的方式把员工安排到**合适的**工作岗位上。"},
49949:{"w":"comprehension","e":"The teacher's task of improving comprehension is made harder by influences outside the classroom.","t":"老师提高学生**理解力**的工作因为课堂外的影响而变得更加困难。"},
49950:{"w":"major","e":"In Mexico city, vehicle pollution is a major health hazard.","t":"在墨西哥城，交通污染是人们健康的一个**主要**威胁。"},
49951:{"w":"majority","e":"This treatment is not available in the vast majority of hospitals.","t":"绝**大部分**医院都不提供这种治疗。"},
49952:{"w":"minority","e":"Only a minority of the students in our class walk to school; most take the bus.","t":"我们班只有**少数**学生步行上学，大多数人坐公交。"},
49953:{"w":"annual","e":"All students at the college are entitled to become members of the Sports Centre for an annual fee of $200.","t":"在校大学生只需交200美元的**年**费，就可以成为运动中心的会员。"},
49954:{"w":"narrow","e":"The path up the mountain is so narrow that only one person can pass.","t":"上山的小路非常**狭窄**，一次只能过一个人。"},
49955:{"w":"slight","e":"She felt a slight pain in her arm after the long swim.","t":"长时间游泳之后，她的手臂感到**轻微**的疼痛。"},
49956:{"w":"light","e":"Please turn off the light when you leave the classroom.","t":"离开教室时请关**灯**。"},
49957:{"w":"lightning","e":"We saw a flash of lightning and then heard loud thunder over the hills.","t":"我们看到一道**闪电**，接着听到山那边传来响亮的雷声。"},
49958:{"w":"sunlight","e":"Plants need plenty of sunlight and water to grow well in the garden.","t":"植物需要充足的**阳光**和水才能在花园里长得好。"},
49959:{"w":"flashlight","e":"He took a flashlight with him because the path was dark.","t":"因为小路很黑，他带了一支**手电筒**。"},
49960:{"w":"modest","e":"Although she won first prize, she remained modest and thanked her teachers for their help.","t":"她虽然得了一等奖，却依然很**谦虚**，还感谢了老师们的帮助。"},
49961:{"w":"extra","e":"Please bring some extra paper to the exam in case you need more.","t":"请带些**额外**的纸去考场，以防不够用。"},
49962:{"w":"gentle","e":"The nurse spoke in a gentle voice to calm the crying child.","t":"护士用**温柔**的声音安抚哭泣的孩子。"},
49963:{"w":"gentleman","e":"A true gentleman always holds the door open for others.","t":"真正的**绅士**总会为别人扶着门。"},
49964:{"w":"prohibit","e":"Smoking is prohibited on most occasions.","t":"大多数场合都**禁止**吸烟。"},
49965:{"w":"bond","e":"The bond between the two brothers grew stronger after their father died.","t":"父亲去世后，兄弟俩之间的**联系**更紧密了。"},
49966:{"w":"direct","e":"There is a direct train from Shanghai to Nanjing every hour.","t":"每小时都有一趟从上海到南京的**直达**火车。"},
49967:{"w":"director","e":"The director of the film spent two years looking for the right actors.","t":"这部电影的**导演**花了两年时间寻找合适的演员。"},
49968:{"w":"directory","e":"For our addresses, just check in your local telephone directory.","t":"你可以在当地的电话**簿**中找到我们的地址。"},
49969:{"w":"direction","e":"Which direction is the station, north or south?","t":"车站在哪个**方向**，北边还是南边？"},
49970:{"w":"limit","e":"There is a speed limit of thirty miles an hour on this road.","t":"这条路的速度**限制**是每小时三十英里。"},
49971:{"w":"restriction","e":"There's an open ticket which doesn't have any restrictions on time.","t":"有一种不定期客票，对时间没有任何**限制**。"},
49972:{"w":"clarify","e":"Talking to students about the requirements of a course helps to clarify what needs to be done.","t":"告诉学生课程要求有助于他们**弄清**自己所需要完成的工作。"},
49973:{"w":"outline","e":"Our teacher asked us to write an outline before we started the essay.","t":"老师要求我们在开始写作文之前先写一份**提纲**。"},
49974:{"w":"cheer","e":"The crowd began to cheer as the runners entered the stadium.","t":"运动员们进入体育场时，观众们开始**欢呼**。"},
49975:{"w":"cheerful","e":"Despite the bad weather, she stayed cheerful and kept smiling all day.","t":"尽管天气不好，她依然很**愉快**，一整天都面带微笑。"},
49976:{"w":"guilty","e":"I felt guilty about forgetting my best friend's birthday party last Saturday.","t":"上周六我忘了最好朋友的生日聚会，心里很**内疚**。"},
49977:{"w":"stick","e":"He used glue to stick the pieces together.","t":"他用胶水把碎片**黏**在一起。"},
49978:{"w":"refer","e":"In his speech, Martin referred to education reform several times.","t":"马丁在他的演讲中几次**提到**教育改革的问题。"},
49979:{"w":"reference","e":"In his speech, he made a brief reference to his childhood in the village.","t":"他在演讲中简短地**提到**了自己在乡村的童年。"},
49980:{"w":"conference","e":"I'm going to a conference in London.","t":"我要去伦敦参加一个**会议**。"},
49981:{"w":"punish","e":"The teacher did not punish him because he told the truth.","t":"老师没有**惩罚**他，因为他说了实话。"},
49982:{"w":"punishment","e":"The teacher gave him no punishment because he told the truth.","t":"老师没有给他任何**惩罚**，因为他说了实话。"},
49983:{"w":"focus","e":"The teacher asked us to focus on the first question and ignore the rest.","t":"老师让我们把注意力**集中**在第一道题上，先不管其他的。"},
49984:{"w":"appeal","e":"The mayor made an appeal for help after the flood.","t":"洪水过后，市长发出了求助的**呼吁**。"},
49985:{"w":"belong","e":"This pen does not belong to me, so I will give it back.","t":"这支笔不**属于**我，所以我要把它还回去。"},
49986:{"w":"occur","e":"The accident occurred on a rainy night when the road was wet and dark.","t":"事故**发生**在一个雨夜，当时路面又湿又暗。"},
49987:{"w":"humour","e":"Our English teacher has a good sense of humour and often makes the whole class laugh.","t":"我们的英语老师很有**幽默**感，常常逗得全班哈哈大笑。"},
49988:{"w":"humorous","e":"Our English teacher is so humorous that everyone laughs in her classes.","t":"我们的英语老师非常**幽默**，大家在她的课上都会笑。"},
49989:{"w":"secure","e":"Put your money in a secure place, such as a bank.","t":"把你的钱放在**安全的**地方，比如银行。"},
49990:{"w":"security","e":"Security at the airport is very tight, so please arrive early.","t":"机场的**安全**检查很严格，请早点到。"},
49991:{"w":"memory","e":"I have happy memories of my childhood in the countryside.","t":"我对在乡下度过的童年有着快乐的**回忆**。"},
49992:{"w":"memorial","e":"A memorial was built in the park to remember the soldiers who died in the war.","t":"公园里建了一座**纪念碑**，纪念在战争中牺牲的士兵。"},
49993:{"w":"role","e":"He plays the role of a doctor in the school play.","t":"他在学校的戏剧里饰演一个医生的**角色**。"},
49994:{"w":"success","e":"Hard work is the key to success.","t":"努力是**成功**的关键。"},
49995:{"w":"successful","e":"My uncle is a successful businessman who started his company ten years ago.","t":"我叔叔是一位**成功的**商人，十年前创办了自己的公司。"},
49996:{"w":"succeed","e":"One Winter Olympics has succeeded another every four years since 1924, with a break only for the Second World War.","t":"从1924年开始冬奥会一届**接着**一届，每四年举办一次，只在二战期间中断过一次。"},
49997:{"w":"mention","e":"He mentioned in his letter that he might be moving abroad.","t":"他在信中**提到**他可能要移居国外。"},
49998:{"w":"block","e":"Our school is just two blocks away from the station.","t":"我们学校离车站只有两个**街区**。"},
49999:{"w":"subscribe","e":"Which magazines did your father subscribe to?","t":"你父亲**订阅**了哪些杂志？"},
50000:{"w":"tend","e":"Young children tend to get tired quickly when they walk a long way.","t":"小孩子走长路时**往往**很快就会累。"},
50001:{"w":"tendency","e":"There is a tendency for prices to rise at the end of the year.","t":"年底物价有上涨的**趋势**。"},
50002:{"w":"straight","e":"Draw a straight line from this point to the edge of the paper.","t":"从这一点到纸的边缘画一条**直**线。"},
50003:{"w":"straightforward","e":"The instructions for the new phone are straightforward, so you can set it up in minutes.","t":"新手机的说明书**简单易懂**，几分钟就能设置好。"},
50004:{"w":"cater","e":"A local company will cater for our school party this Friday evening.","t":"一家本地公司将为我们本周五晚上的学校聚会**备办食物**。"},
50005:{"w":"hunt","e":"In the past, people in this area had to hunt wild animals for food.","t":"过去，这一带的人们得靠**捕猎**野生动物来获取食物。"},
50006:{"w":"adapt","e":"It took me a few weeks to adapt to life at the new school.","t":"我花了几周才**适应**新学校的生活。"},
50007:{"w":"adaptation","e":"His quick adaptation to the cold weather surprised everyone.","t":"他对寒冷天气的迅速**适应**让大家很吃惊。"},
50008:{"w":"adopt","e":"The school decided to adopt a new method of teaching English.","t":"学校决定**采用**一种新的英语教学方法。"},
50009:{"w":"adore","e":"Many teenagers adore pop stars and put their posters on the wall.","t":"许多青少年**崇拜**流行歌星，把他们的海报贴在墙上。"},
50010:{"w":"servant","e":"The rich family had three servants who cooked, cleaned and drove the car.","t":"这个富裕的家庭有三个**仆人**，负责做饭、打扫和开车。"},
50011:{"w":"master","e":"It takes years of practice to master a musical instrument.","t":"想**掌握**一门乐器，需要多年的练习。"},
50012:{"w":"manage","e":"She managed to finish the report before the meeting started.","t":"她**设法**在会议开始前完成了报告。"},
50013:{"w":"construct","e":"The city plans to construct a new bridge across the river next year.","t":"这座城市计划明年在河上**建造**一座新桥。"},
50014:{"w":"construction","e":"They spent years completing the construction of the new airport.","t":"他们花了数年的时间才**建**成新机场。"},
50015:{"w":"exist","e":"Do you really believe that life exists on other planets in the universe?","t":"你真的相信宇宙中其他星球上**存在**生命吗？"},
50016:{"w":"existence","e":"Scientists still argue about the existence of life on other planets far away from Earth.","t":"科学家们仍在争论遥远的其他星球上是否**存在**生命。"},
50017:{"w":"splendid","e":"The splendid sunrise lit up the whole sky.","t":"**灿烂的**朝阳照亮了整个天空。"},
50018:{"w":"hardly","e":"I could hardly hear the teacher because the students behind me were so noisy.","t":"我**几乎**听不见老师讲话，因为身后的学生太吵了。"},
50019:{"w":"exact","e":"What is the exact amount left in your savings account?","t":"你储蓄账户上的**准确**余额是多少？"},
50020:{"w":"fortune","e":"His grandfather left him a large fortune, but he gave most of it to charity.","t":"他祖父留给他一大笔**财产**，但他把大部分都捐给了慈善事业。"},
50021:{"w":"fortunate","e":"We were fortunate to find a seat on the crowded train.","t":"我们很**幸运**，在拥挤的火车上找到了座位。"},
50022:{"w":"unfortunate","e":"It was unfortunate that it rained on the day of our picnic.","t":"野餐那天偏偏下雨，真是**倒霉**。"},
50023:{"w":"luck","e":"I wish you the best of luck in tomorrow's final English exam.","t":"祝你在明天的英语期末考试中**好运**。"},
50024:{"w":"lucky","e":"We were lucky to find a taxi so quickly in the heavy rain.","t":"下着大雨，我们很快就打到了出租车，真是**幸运**。"},
50025:{"w":"surprise","e":"Her sudden visit was a big surprise to all of us.","t":"她的突然来访对我们大家来说是个大**惊喜**。"},
50026:{"w":"behave","e":"Managers often behave very differently outside the office.","t":"经理在办公室内外的**举止**经常判若两人。"},
50027:{"w":"behaviour","e":"The teacher praised the boy for his good behaviour in class and gave him a small prize.","t":"老师表扬了这个男孩在课堂上的良好**表现**，还给了他一个小奖品。"},
50028:{"w":"truth","e":"She told her parents the truth about the broken window.","t":"她把窗户被打破的**事实**告诉了父母。"},
50029:{"w":"conduct","e":"Our music teacher will conduct the school choir at tonight's concert in the hall.","t":"我们的音乐老师将在今晚大厅里的音乐会上**指挥**学校合唱团。"},
50030:{"w":"conductor","e":"When the conductor raised his hands, the whole orchestra began to play the music.","t":"**指挥**一举起双手，整个乐团就开始演奏。"},
50031:{"w":"bear","e":"I cannot bear the noise from the street any longer.","t":"我再也无法**忍受**街上的噪音了。"},
50032:{"w":"foster","e":"The old couple have fostered over 60 children during the past ten years.","t":"这对老夫妇在过去的十年间**收养**了60多名儿童。"},
50033:{"w":"experience","e":"She has a lot of experience in teaching young children.","t":"她有很多教小孩子的**经验**。"},
50034:{"w":"substitute","e":"It is better for a company to employ more workers because people are available to substitute for absent staff.","t":"对公司来说，多雇用一些员工大有好处，因为有足够的人手去**替代**缺勤人员。"},
50035:{"w":"preserve","e":"As a doctor, my profession is to preserve life, and to prevent disease from developing.","t":"身为一名医生，我的职责是**保护**生命以及阻止疾病恶化。"},
50036:{"w":"conservation","e":"We just set up a new wildlife conservation programme here.","t":"我们刚刚在这里启动了一个新的野生动物**保护**项目。"},
50037:{"w":"conservative","e":"The obstacle to our development has been conservative local authorities.","t":"**保守**的地方当局一直是我们发展的障碍。"},
50038:{"w":"amaze","e":"We were amazed at how quickly the little boy learned to play the piano.","t":"我们很**惊讶**这个小男孩学钢琴学得这么快。"},
50039:{"w":"amazing","e":"The view from the top of the mountain was absolutely amazing.","t":"山顶上的景色美得**令人惊异**。"},
50040:{"w":"amuse","e":"The clown amused the children with funny tricks at the birthday party.","t":"生日聚会上，小丑用滑稽的把戏**逗乐**了孩子们。"},
50041:{"w":"amusement","e":"Reading is her favourite amusement after a long day at work.","t":"读书是她在漫长工作日之后最喜欢的**消遣**。"},
50042:{"w":"confuse","e":"I'm afraid I'm a bit confused by what you said just now.","t":"恐怕我被你刚才说的话弄得有点**糊涂**。"},
50043:{"w":"annoy","e":"The bathroom light which flickered quite badly annoyed me very much.","t":"浴室里的灯闪来闪去，真让我**心烦**。"},
50044:{"w":"awkward","e":"There was an awkward silence after he asked her how old she was.","t":"他问她多大年纪之后，场面陷入了一阵**尴尬的**沉默。"},
50045:{"w":"aspect","e":"Money is important, but it is only one aspect of a happy life.","t":"钱很重要，但它只是幸福生活的一个**方面**。"},
50046:{"w":"angle","e":"When you are stuck by a problem, you should change the angle to find some valid solutions.","t":"当你被一个难题卡住时，应该换一种**角度**去寻找有效的解决方法。"},
50047:{"w":"trip","e":"We took a short trip to the seaside last weekend and had a great time.","t":"我们上个周末去海边进行了一次**短途旅行**，玩得很开心。"},
50048:{"w":"travel","e":"I would love to travel around the world after I finish university.","t":"大学毕业后，我很想去世界各地**旅行**。"},
50049:{"w":"tour","e":"We took a two-hour tour of the old city and learned a lot about its history.","t":"我们在老城**游览**了两个小时，了解了很多它的历史。"},
50050:{"w":"tourism","e":"Tourism is the main source of income for this small island.","t":"**旅游业**是这个小岛的主要收入来源。"},
50051:{"w":"decorate","e":"We moved into our new apartment before it was decorated.","t":"新公寓还没有**装修**，我们就搬进去了。"},
50052:{"w":"decoration","e":"We spent the whole afternoon putting up decorations for the party.","t":"我们花了整个下午为聚会挂**装饰品**。"},
50053:{"w":"classify","e":"The librarian classifies the books by subject.","t":"图书管理员按主题给书**分类**。"},
50054:{"w":"classic","e":"The film is a classic love story that people still enjoy today.","t":"这部电影是一个**经典**的爱情故事，人们至今仍然喜爱。"},
50055:{"w":"occupy","e":"A large sofa occupies most of the space in our small living room.","t":"一张大沙发**占据**了我们小客厅的大部分空间。"},
50056:{"w":"occupation","e":"Please state your name, age and occupation on the form.","t":"请在表格里填写姓名、年龄和**职业**。"},
50057:{"w":"paint","e":"We need to buy some white paint to cover the old wall.","t":"我们需要买些白色**油漆**来盖住旧墙面。"},
50058:{"w":"accommodation","e":"The hotel offers cheap accommodation to students who visit the city in summer.","t":"这家酒店为夏天来这座城市的学生提供廉价的**住宿**。"},
50059:{"w":"equip","e":"Underground offices in Japan are equipped with \"virtual\" windows and mirrors.","t":"日本的地下办公室**装有**虚拟的窗户和镜子。"},
50060:{"w":"equipment","e":"Last week we talked about buying camping equipment.","t":"上周我们讨论了有关购买露营**装备**的事情。"},
50061:{"w":"lay","e":"She laid the baby gently on the bed.","t":"她轻轻地把婴儿**放**在床上。"},
50062:{"w":"settle","e":"They are offspring of the first Europeans who settled in China.","t":"他们是最早在中国**定居**的欧洲人的后裔。"},
50063:{"w":"settlement","e":"After weeks of talks, both sides finally reached a settlement.","t":"经过数周的谈判，双方终于达成了**协议**。"},
50064:{"w":"solid","e":"Water becomes solid when it freezes.","t":"水结冰时会变成**固体**。"},
50065:{"w":"fierce","e":"There is fierce competition in the examination.","t":"考试竞争非常**激烈**。"},
50066:{"w":"severe","e":"The research completed last year found that in the United States soil erosion was almost as severe as in India.","t":"去年完成的调查显示，美国土壤侵蚀的状况和印度的一样**严重**。"},
50067:{"w":"potential","e":"After the final interview, potential recruits were divided into three categories.","t":"经过最后一轮面试，**有可能**被录用的人被分成三类。"},
50068:{"w":"notice","e":"Did you notice the new poster on the classroom wall?","t":"你**注意到**教室墙上的新海报了吗？"},
50069:{"w":"evident","e":"It was evident from her smile that she had passed the driving test.","t":"从她的笑容可以**明显**看出，她通过了驾照考试。"},
50070:{"w":"evidence","e":"The police found no evidence that he had stolen the money.","t":"警方没有找到他偷了钱的**证据**。"},
50071:{"w":"choose","e":"You must choose between the red bag and the blue one.","t":"你必须在红色的包和蓝色的包之间**选择**。"},
50072:{"w":"choice","e":"You have a choice between tea and coffee.","t":"你可以在茶和咖啡之间做出**选择**。"},
50073:{"w":"select","e":"More and more employers are making use of what are called \"personality questionnaires\" to help them select new staff.","t":"越来越多的雇主正在利用所谓的“性格调查问卷”来帮助自己**挑选**新员工。"},
50074:{"w":"glance","e":"She glanced at her watch and realized she was late for the bus.","t":"她**看了一眼**手表，发现自己赶不上公交车了。"},
50075:{"w":"stare","e":"He stared at the word trying to remember what it meant.","t":"他**盯着**这个单词，努力想记住它的意思。"},
50076:{"w":"glare","e":"The angry driver glared at the boy who ran across the road.","t":"愤怒的司机对着跑过马路的男孩**怒目而视**。"},
50077:{"w":"overlook","e":"It is easy to overlook small mistakes when you are writing an essay in a hurry.","t":"匆忙写作文时，很容易**忽视**一些小错误。"},
50078:{"w":"boil","e":"Boil the water for ten minutes before you drink it.","t":"喝水前先把水**煮**十分钟。"},
50079:{"w":"mess","e":"After the party, the living room was in a terrible mess, with cups and plates everywhere.","t":"聚会结束后，客厅里**一片狼藉**，到处都是杯子和盘子。"},
50080:{"w":"various","e":"The shop sells various kinds of fruit from different countries.","t":"这家店出售来自不同国家的**各种**水果。"},
50081:{"w":"diverse","e":"Millions of years ago, changes in the Earth's climate gave rise to diverse species in the tropical rain forest.","t":"数百万年前，地球气候的变化导致了这片热带雨林物种的**多样**性。"},
50082:{"w":"affair","e":"It is a family affair, so we do not want to discuss it with outsiders.","t":"这是**家事**，我们不想和外人讨论。"},
50083:{"w":"task","e":"Our teacher gave us the task of writing a short story about our school.","t":"老师给我们布置了写一篇关于学校的短篇故事的**任务**。"},
50084:{"w":"dislike","e":"Many children dislike vegetables, but they are good for health.","t":"许多孩子**不喜欢**蔬菜，但蔬菜对健康有益。"},
50085:{"w":"shortly","e":"The plane will land shortly, so please return to your seats and fasten your seat belts.","t":"飞机**不久**就要降落了，请回到座位上系好安全带。"},
50086:{"w":"blow","e":"The wind blew so hard that my hat flew off.","t":"风**刮**得很大，我的帽子都被吹跑了。"},
50087:{"w":"topic","e":"The weather is always a safe topic when you talk with people you have just met.","t":"和刚认识的人聊天时，天气总是个安全的**话题**。"},
50088:{"w":"subject","e":"I'm giving some thoughts to a new book on a different subject.","t":"我在构思一本不同**题材**的新书。"},
50089:{"w":"subjective","e":"Taste and smell were subjective senses.","t":"味觉和嗅觉都是**主观**感觉。"},
50090:{"w":"knock","e":"Please knock on the door before you come into my room.","t":"进我房间之前，请先**敲**门。"},
50091:{"w":"share","e":"I share a room with my younger brother.","t":"我和弟弟**共用**一个房间。"},
50092:{"w":"realise","e":"He soon realised that he had made a big mistake.","t":"他很快就**认识到**自己犯了一个大错。"},
50093:{"w":"reality","e":"Many young people find that the reality of working life is very different from their dreams.","t":"许多年轻人发现，工作生活的**现实**和他们的梦想大不相同。"},
50094:{"w":"ignore","e":"He ignored my advice and went out in the rain without a coat.","t":"他**无视**我的建议，没穿外套就冒雨出去了。"},
50095:{"w":"suffer","e":"They all suffer from chronic back pain.","t":"他们都**患有**慢性背部疼痛。"},
50096:{"w":"suffering","e":"The film shows the suffering of ordinary people during the war.","t":"这部电影展现了战争期间普通人的**苦难**。"},
50097:{"w":"copy","e":"Please keep a copy of the contract in a safe place.","t":"请把合同的**副本**放在安全的地方。"},
50098:{"w":"misunderstand","e":"Please don't misunderstand me, because I was only trying to help you with your work.","t":"请别**误会**我，我只是想帮你干活。"},
50099:{"w":"flow","e":"The river flows slowly through the valley before it reaches the sea.","t":"这条河缓缓**流**过山谷，然后汇入大海。"},
50100:{"w":"imagine","e":"Can you imagine living on the moon, far away from everyone you know?","t":"你能**想象**住在月球上，远离所有你认识的人吗？"},
50101:{"w":"section","e":"Here is the non-smoking section.","t":"这里是禁烟**区**。"},
50102:{"w":"district","e":"Our school is in the business district of the city.","t":"我们学校在城市的商业**区**。"},
50103:{"w":"zone","e":"There are many different climatic zones in Australia.","t":"澳大利亚有很多不同的气候**带**。"},
50104:{"w":"department","e":"If you have any questions about your visa, please contact the international students department of the university.","t":"如果你对签证有任何疑问，请联系大学的留学生**部门**。"},
50105:{"w":"depart","e":"Tom departs at sundown to fish.","t":"汤姆黄昏时分**出发**去捕鱼。"},
50106:{"w":"departure","e":"The local people had received no news of him since his departure from hometown.","t":"自从他**离开**家乡之后，乡亲们就没有听到过他的消息。"},
50107:{"w":"material","e":"Glass is the great building material of the future.","t":"玻璃是未来重要的建筑**材料**。"},
50108:{"w":"raw","e":"Always wash your hands after touching raw meat, before you cook anything else.","t":"接触**生的**肉以后一定要先洗手，再做别的菜。"},
50109:{"w":"fact","e":"It is a fact that the earth goes around the sun.","t":"地球围绕太阳转是一个**事实**。"},
50110:{"w":"deed","e":"The villagers still talk about the brave deeds of their hero.","t":"村民们至今还在谈论英雄的英勇**事迹**。"},
50111:{"w":"indeed","e":"It was a difficult question indeed, and nobody knew the answer.","t":"那**确实**是个难题，没有人知道答案。"},
50112:{"w":"enthusiastic","e":"The enthusiastic crowd cheered loudly when the singer walked onto the stage.","t":"**热情**的观众在歌手走上舞台时大声欢呼。"},
50113:{"w":"dynamic","e":"The market is so dynamic that the figures change almost every two weeks.","t":"这个市场很**活跃**，数据几乎每两周就会发生改变。"},
50114:{"w":"eager","e":"The students were eager to start their trip to the science museum.","t":"学生们**渴望**开始去科学博物馆的旅行。"},
50115:{"w":"honest","e":"Please be honest with me. Did you break the window?","t":"请对我**诚实**点儿。是你打破了窗户吗？"},
50116:{"w":"plain","e":"She wore a plain white dress and no jewellery.","t":"她穿着一条**普通的**白色连衣裙，没戴任何首饰。"},
50117:{"w":"sincerely","e":"He sincerely thanked everyone who had helped him during the difficult year.","t":"他**真诚地**感谢了在艰难的一年里帮助过他的每一个人。"},
50118:{"w":"devote","e":"He decided to devote his life to helping poor children.","t":"他决定终生**致力于**帮助贫困儿童。"},
50119:{"w":"commit","e":"The police believe the man committed the crime late last night near the station.","t":"警方认为，这名男子是昨天深夜在车站附近**犯下**这起罪行的。"},
50120:{"w":"commitment","e":"He made a commitment to visit his grandmother every Sunday.","t":"他做出了**承诺**，每个星期天都去看望奶奶。"},
50121:{"w":"ambition","e":"Bob's ambition was to study medicine.","t":"鲍勃**有志于**学医。"},
50122:{"w":"aim","e":"The main aim of this project is to protect local wildlife.","t":"这个项目的主要**目的**是保护当地的野生动物。"},
50123:{"w":"goal","e":"Once you have achieved the first goals, you will move up to a higher level of study.","t":"一旦你达到了最初的**目标**，就可以进行更深层次的研究了。"},
50124:{"w":"target","e":"Everyone should have a target in mind for the first year of college life.","t":"每个人在大学生活的第一年都应该有个**目标**。"},
50125:{"w":"admire","e":"I really admire my mother for raising three children while working full time.","t":"我真心**钦佩**妈妈，她一边全职工作一边养大了三个孩子。"},
50126:{"w":"administration","e":"The administration office is opposite the car park on the left.","t":"**管理**办公室在停车场对面的左边。"},
50127:{"w":"corporation","e":"My father has worked for the same large corporation for nearly twenty years.","t":"我爸爸在同一家大**公司**工作了将近二十年。"},
50128:{"w":"add","e":"Add a little salt to the soup, and it will taste better.","t":"往汤里**加**一点盐，味道会更好。"},
50129:{"w":"addition","e":"Children learn addition before they learn multiplication.","t":"孩子们先学**加法**，再学乘法。"},
50130:{"w":"plus","e":"Ten plus five equals fifteen, as every child in the first grade knows.","t":"十**加上**五等于十五，这是每个一年级小孩都知道的。"},
50131:{"w":"introduce","e":"We've introduced a simpler price structure.","t":"我们**引进**了一套更简易的价格体系。"},
50132:{"w":"introduction","e":"By way of introduction, I shall give you the background of the subject.","t":"通过**介绍**，我将向你讲述该学科的相关背景。"},
50133:{"w":"deliver","e":"The President delivered a televised speech to the whole nation on October 1st.","t":"总统在10月1日向全国**发表**了电视讲话。"},
50134:{"w":"convey","e":"His poem conveyed a sense of sorrow.","t":"他的诗**表达**了一种悲伤的情感。"},
50135:{"w":"transport","e":"Trucks transport fresh vegetables from the farms to the city every morning.","t":"每天早上，卡车把新鲜蔬菜从农场**运**到城里。"},
50136:{"w":"grasp","e":"Mary finally grasped the material after reading the textbook very carefully.","t":"在非常仔细地阅读了课本后，玛丽最终**领会**了这段材料的意思。"},
50137:{"w":"consume","e":"Big cars consume much more fuel than small ones, so they cost more to run.","t":"大车比小车**消耗**的油多得多，所以使用成本更高。"},
50138:{"w":"consumer","e":"Many consumers feel that government and business have taken on the environmental agenda.","t":"许多**消费者**认为政府和商家已经将环保提上了日程。"},
50139:{"w":"custom","e":"It is a custom in China to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.","t":"在中国，除夕吃饺子是一种**习俗**。"},
50140:{"w":"accustomed","e":"I'm not accustomed to using a gas stove.","t":"我不**习惯**使用煤气炉。"},
50141:{"w":"export","e":"China exports many kinds of goods to countries all over the world.","t":"中国向世界各国**出口**许多种商品。"},
50142:{"w":"import","e":"China imports a lot of oil from other countries every year to meet its energy needs.","t":"中国每年从其他国家**进口**大量石油，以满足能源需求。"},
50143:{"w":"advertise","e":"The shop advertises its new products on the radio every morning.","t":"这家商店每天早上在广播里为新产品**做广告**。"},
50144:{"w":"advertisement","e":"The advertisement on the bus showed a smiling family eating breakfast together.","t":"公交车上的**广告**画着一家人微笑着一起吃早餐。"},
50145:{"w":"brand","e":"What brand of cola do you like?","t":"你喜欢喝什么**牌子**的可乐？"},
50146:{"w":"cycle","e":"My father cycles to work every day, even when it is raining hard.","t":"我父亲每天**骑车**上班，下大雨也不例外。"},
50147:{"w":"recycle","e":"The man collects the waste bins and deposits the waste into a shredder for recycling.","t":"这个人把垃圾箱收集起来，把垃圾倒进搅碎机进行**回收利用**。"},
50148:{"w":"schedule","e":"The lectures are scheduled for Tuesday and Thursday.","t":"讲座**安排**在星期二和星期四。"},
50149:{"w":"daily","e":"She goes for a short walk by the river as part of her daily routine.","t":"她沿着河边短暂散步，这是她**日常**作息的一部分。"},
50150:{"w":"punctual","e":"Being punctual shows your clients that you respect their schedule and that you can be counted on.","t":"**守时**会让你的客户觉得，你尊重他们的安排，并且值得信赖。"},
50151:{"w":"delay","e":"After a delay of two days, the whole team continued the journey.","t":"**耽搁**了两天后，整个小组继续行进。"},
50152:{"w":"postpone","e":"The sports meet was finally postponed because of the bad weather.","t":"由于天气恶劣，运动会最终被**推迟**了。"},
50153:{"w":"cancel","e":"Could you please call the dentist at 816-25285 and cancel the appointment for me?","t":"你能拨打816-25285帮我**取消**和牙医的预约吗？"},
50154:{"w":"pause","e":"He paused for a moment and then opened the door.","t":"他**停顿**了片刻，然后打开了门。"},
50155:{"w":"hesitate","e":"Mary hesitated before she answered this question because she didn't know what to say.","t":"玛丽在回答这个问题前**犹豫**了一下，因为她不知道要说什么。"},
50156:{"w":"wise","e":"It was wise of you to take an umbrella today.","t":"你今天带伞真**明智**。"},
50157:{"w":"wisdom","e":"My grandmother has the wisdom that comes from a long life full of ups and downs.","t":"我奶奶拥有历经一生起伏得来的**智慧**。"},
50158:{"w":"legal","e":"The Union has its own officers who can give advice on legal problems.","t":"该协会拥有自己的人员，负责给**法律**事务提供建议。"},
50159:{"w":"illegal","e":"The police arrested the old lady for illegal possession of drugs.","t":"警方以**非法**持有毒品为由逮捕了这位老妇人。"},
50160:{"w":"law","e":"Everyone in the country must obey the law, no matter how rich or famous they are.","t":"这个国家里的每个人，无论多么富有或出名，都必须遵守**法律**。"},
50161:{"w":"valid","e":"You don't want to get to your destination only to find you have the wrong visa, or worse, that your passport isn't valid any more.","t":"你不会想要等到了目的地却发现你带的是错误的签证，或者更糟糕的是，你的护照不再**有效**。"},
50162:{"w":"innocent","e":"Seeing these innocent children, I can't help recalling my own childhood.","t":"看到这些**天真无邪**的孩子，我不禁想起了自己的童年。"},
50163:{"w":"mature","e":"Jane is very mature for her age.","t":"简年龄不大，却很**成熟**。"},
50164:{"w":"fresh","e":"We bought fresh fish and vegetables at the market this morning.","t":"今天早上我们在市场买了**新鲜**的鱼和蔬菜。"},
50165:{"w":"refresh","e":"My job is to make sure that you all feel relaxed and refreshed.","t":"我的工作就是保证你们都感觉放松且**精力充沛**。"},
50166:{"w":"apart","e":"The two villages are about ten kilometres apart, so we usually go there by bike.","t":"这两个村子**相距**大约十公里，所以我们通常骑自行车去。"},
50167:{"w":"apartment","e":"They live in a small apartment on the tenth floor of an old building.","t":"他们住在一栋旧楼十层的一套小**公寓**里。"},
50168:{"w":"flat","e":"Flat shoes may cure your back pain.","t":"穿**平底**鞋能治疗背部疼痛。"},
50169:{"w":"weight","e":"The weight of the box is about five kilograms, so I can carry it easily.","t":"这个箱子的**重量**大约是五公斤，所以我拿得动。"},
50170:{"w":"weigh","e":"The shop assistant weighed the apples and put them into a paper bag.","t":"店员**称了**苹果的重量，然后把它们装进纸袋里。"},
50171:{"w":"loose","e":"These trousers are too loose, so I need a belt.","t":"这条裤子太**宽松**了，我需要一条腰带。"},
50172:{"w":"tight","e":"These shoes are too tight for me.","t":"这双鞋我穿太**紧**了。"},
50173:{"w":"rigid","e":"The school has rigid rules about uniforms, and students cannot wear their own clothes.","t":"这所学校对校服有**严格**的规定，学生不能穿自己的衣服。"},
50174:{"w":"strict","e":"Our teacher is strict about homework, but she is also very kind.","t":"我们的老师对作业要求很**严格**，但她也很和蔼。"},
50175:{"w":"precise","e":"Can you give me the precise time when the train will arrive at the station?","t":"你能告诉我火车到站的**准确**时间吗？"},
50176:{"w":"approximately","e":"The next bus will come in approximately five minutes.","t":"下一班公交车**大约**会在五分钟后到达。"},
50177:{"w":"assess","e":"Core samples are always extracted to assess the quality and quantity of coal at a site before mining.","t":"在开采前，通常会收集选地的矿样来**评估**矿质和储量。"},
50178:{"w":"beg","e":"The little boy begged his mother to buy him the toy.","t":"小男孩**请求**妈妈给他买那个玩具。"},
50179:{"w":"seek","e":"They sought in vain for somewhere to shelter.","t":"他们怎么也**找**不到藏身之处。"},
50180:{"w":"remain","e":"Please remain seated until the plane has come to a complete stop.","t":"飞机完全停稳之前，请大家**保持**坐姿。"},
50181:{"w":"desert","e":"Camels can cross the desert without drinking for many days.","t":"骆驼可以很多天不喝水，穿越**沙漠**。"},
50182:{"w":"proud","e":"My parents are proud of me because I won the speech contest.","t":"我赢得了演讲比赛，父母为我感到**自豪**。"},
50183:{"w":"pride","e":"Her parents looked at her with pride when she received the prize.","t":"她领奖时，父母满怀**自豪**地看着她。"},
50184:{"w":"prejudice","e":"Some people still have a prejudice against women who work as engineers or pilots.","t":"有些人对当工程师或飞行员的女性仍然抱有**偏见**。"},
50185:{"w":"stubborn","e":"Henry was too stubborn to admit what he did was wrong.","t":"亨利太**顽固**，不承认自己做错了。"},
50186:{"w":"wonderful","e":"We had a wonderful time at the beach with our friends last summer.","t":"去年夏天我们和朋友们在海滩度过了一段**美妙**的时光。"},
50187:{"w":"wonder","e":"Excuse me, I'm wondering if you'd mind answering a few questions?","t":"打扰了，我**想知道**你是否介意回答几个问题？"},
50188:{"w":"privilege","e":"Education is not a privilege of some people but a right of all citizens.","t":"受教育不是某些人的**特权**，而是所有公民的权利。"},
50189:{"w":"glory","e":"The team returned home in glory after winning the national football championship.","t":"球队赢得全国足球冠军后**光荣**归来。"},
50190:{"w":"award","e":"She won an award for her excellent work in helping poor children.","t":"她因帮助贫困儿童的出色工作而获得了一个**奖项**。"},
50191:{"w":"reward","e":"Those employees who never take sick leave think that they should be rewarded.","t":"那些从来不请病假的员工认为他们应该因此得到**奖励**。"},
50192:{"w":"prize","e":"She won first prize in the national writing competition.","t":"她在全国写作比赛中获得了一等**奖**。"},
50193:{"w":"single","e":"There is not a single cloud in the sky today.","t":"今天天空中连**一朵**云也没有。"},
50194:{"w":"individual","e":"The food is served in individual portions.","t":"食物是按**一人**一份供给的。"},
50195:{"w":"self","e":"After the accident, he did not feel like his old self for several months.","t":"事故发生后的几个月里，他觉得自己不像**原来的自己**了。"},
50196:{"w":"bachelor","e":"Tom is working towards a Bachelor of Social Science degree in the University of Cambridge.","t":"汤姆正在剑桥大学攻读社会学的**学士**学位。"},
50197:{"w":"marry","e":"My cousin is going to marry her boyfriend next spring in their hometown.","t":"我表姐明年春天要在老家**嫁给**她男朋友。"},
50198:{"w":"spot","e":"You'll spot the cinema right next to the underground station.","t":"你会**发现**这家电影院就在地铁站旁边。"},
50199:{"w":"blank","e":"Would you mind my asking about your salary? Or we can leave it blank.","t":"你介意我问一下你的薪水吗？或者我们也可以把这一项**空着**。"},
50200:{"w":"stain","e":"There was a coffee stain on his white shirt.","t":"他的白衬衫上有一块咖啡**污渍**。"},
50201:{"w":"shelter","e":"During the heavy storm, we found shelter under a large tree near the road.","t":"暴风雨中，我们在路边一棵大树下找到了一个**躲避处**。"},
50202:{"w":"relief","e":"She felt great relief when she heard that her son was safe.","t":"听说儿子平安无事，她感到非常**宽慰**。"},
50203:{"w":"defend","e":"A mother bird will defend her nest against any danger.","t":"母鸟会**保护**自己的巢，不让它遭受任何危险。"},
50204:{"w":"defence","e":"The castle's strong walls were its main defence against enemy attacks.","t":"城堡坚固的城墙是它抵御敌人进攻的主要**防御**。"},
50205:{"w":"guard","e":"Soldiers guard the gate day and night.","t":"士兵们日夜**看守**着大门。"},
50206:{"w":"duty","e":"It is the duty of every citizen to obey the law.","t":"遵守法律是每个公民的**责任**。"},
50207:{"w":"dismiss","e":"As sales declined, the manager had to dismiss several workers.","t":"由于销售额下跌，经理不得不**解雇**一些员工。"},
50208:{"w":"mistake","e":"I made a mistake in the last question of the test.","t":"我在测验的最后一道题上犯了一个**错误**。"},
50209:{"w":"fault","e":"It was my fault that we missed the bus, because I got up late.","t":"我们错过公共汽车是我的**过错**，因为我起晚了。"},
50210:{"w":"error","e":"Please check your answers carefully, because even a small error can cost you points.","t":"请仔细检查答案，因为哪怕一个小**错误**也会让你丢分。"},
50211:{"w":"shortcoming","e":"Everyone has shortcomings, so we should be patient with the people around us.","t":"每个人都有**缺点**，所以我们应该对身边的人多些耐心。"},
50212:{"w":"otherwise","e":"Leave now, otherwise you will miss the last bus.","t":"现在就走，**否则**你会错过末班车。"},
50213:{"w":"bare","e":"Certain plants can cause irritation if you touch them with bare skin.","t":"某些植物直接接触**裸露的**皮肤时，会引起皮肤过敏。"},
50214:{"w":"grand","e":"The grand old hotel by the lake has been welcoming guests for over a hundred years.","t":"湖边那座**宏伟**的老酒店已经接待客人一百多年了。"},
50215:{"w":"distinguish","e":"It is hard to distinguish the twin sisters because they look exactly alike.","t":"这对双胞胎姐妹长得一模一样，很难**区分**。"},
50216:{"w":"distinction","e":"Can you see the distinction between these two words in meaning?","t":"你能看出这两个词在意义上的**区别**吗？"},
50217:{"w":"discuss","e":"We will discuss the plan for the school trip at tomorrow's class meeting.","t":"我们将在明天的班会上**讨论**学校旅行的计划。"},
50218:{"w":"discussion","e":"After a long discussion, the class decided to hold the party on Friday.","t":"经过长时间的**讨论**，全班决定星期五举行聚会。"},
50219:{"w":"announce","e":"The school announced that classes would start an hour later on Monday.","t":"学校**宣布**星期一的课程将推迟一小时开始。"},
50220:{"w":"broadcast","e":"The radio station will broadcast the match live to millions of listeners.","t":"该电台将向数百万听众现场**广播**这场比赛。"},
50221:{"w":"industry","e":"The tourist industry gives jobs to thousands of people in this small town.","t":"旅游**产业**为这个小镇上数千人提供了工作。"},
50222:{"w":"agriculture","e":"Agriculture still employs nearly half of the population in many developing countries, though the share is falling steadily.","t":"在许多发展中国家，**农业**仍然雇用着近一半的人口，尽管这一比例正在稳步下降。"},
50223:{"w":"harvest","e":"Farmers in this region begin to harvest rice in late September.","t":"这个地区的农民九月下旬开始**收割**稻谷。"},
50224:{"w":"exchange","e":"Are you one of the exchange students?","t":"你是**交换**生之一吗？"},
50225:{"w":"bargain","e":"I bought this jacket for half price, so it was a real bargain.","t":"这件夹克我是半价买的，真是**便宜货**。"},
50226:{"w":"trade","e":"Trade between the two countries has grown quickly in recent years.","t":"近年来，两国之间的**贸易**增长很快。"},
50227:{"w":"business","e":"Her family runs a small business that sells tea.","t":"她家经营着一家卖茶叶的小**企业**。"},
50228:{"w":"enterprise","e":"The land can be considered part of the enterprise's assets.","t":"这块土地可以归入该**公司**的资产。"},
50229:{"w":"company","e":"My uncle works for a small computer company in the north of the city.","t":"我叔叔在城北一家小型电脑**公司**工作。"},
50230:{"w":"accompany","e":"My father always accompanies my grandmother when she goes to see the doctor.","t":"奶奶去看病时，爸爸总是**陪着**她。"},
50231:{"w":"companion","e":"Tom was my only Chinese companion during my stay in Switzerland.","t":"汤姆是我在瑞士期间唯一的中国**伙伴**。"},
50232:{"w":"couple","e":"The young couple bought a small house near the school last year.","t":"这对年轻**夫妇**去年在学校附近买了一栋小房子。"},
50233:{"w":"colleague","e":"I often have lunch with my colleagues in the small restaurant near our office.","t":"我常和**同事**在办公室附近的小餐馆吃午饭。"},
50234:{"w":"fellow","e":"She chatted with a fellow traveller on the long train ride.","t":"在漫长的火车旅途中，她和一位**同路**旅客聊了天。"},
50235:{"w":"folk","e":"She loves folk songs, especially the old ones from the countryside.","t":"她喜欢**民间**歌曲，尤其是乡村里流传的老歌。"},
50236:{"w":"undertake","e":"Mary undertook the organization of the whole scheme.","t":"玛丽**负责**整个计划的组织工作。"},
50237:{"w":"campaign","e":"The mayor spent months on his election campaign before the vote.","t":"在投票前，市长花了几个月时间进行**竞选活动**。"},
50238:{"w":"movement","e":"The movement of the clouds told us that a storm was coming.","t":"云的**移动**告诉我们暴风雨要来了。"},
50239:{"w":"sacrifice","e":"Linda's parents made sacrifices so that she could have a good education abroad.","t":"为了让琳达能在国外接受良好的教育，琳达的父母做出了**牺牲**。"},
50240:{"w":"survive","e":"For most animal species, individuals are less likely to survive and reproduce.","t":"对于大多数动物物种来说，个体似乎不太可能**存活**以及繁衍后代。"},
50241:{"w":"victim","e":"The majority of the victims in this earthquake were children.","t":"这次地震中的主要**受害者**是儿童。"},
50242:{"w":"blind","e":"The old man has been blind since he was a child, but he plays the piano well.","t":"这位老人从小就**失明**，但钢琴弹得很好。"},
50243:{"w":"sponsor","e":"A local company agreed to sponsor our school sports day.","t":"一家本地公司同意**赞助**我们学校的运动会。"},
50244:{"w":"donate","e":"I should also like to say if you do have a bike to donate, it doesn't matter what condition it is in.","t":"我还想说如果你有自行车可以**捐赠**，不管它是什么状况都没关系。"},
50245:{"w":"organise","e":"Our class organised a trip to the mountains to celebrate the end of the exams.","t":"为庆祝考试结束，我们班**组织**了一次山区旅行。"},
50246:{"w":"organisation","e":"The organisation raises money to help children in poor villages go to school.","t":"这个**机构**筹款帮助贫困乡村的孩子上学。"},
50247:{"w":"academic","e":"The school is well known for its high academic standards.","t":"这所学校以很高的**学术**水平闻名。"},
50248:{"w":"academy","e":"She studied painting at the academy of fine arts for four years before becoming an artist.","t":"她在美术**学院**学了四年绘画，后来成了一名艺术家。"},
50249:{"w":"institute","e":"The Language Institute provides student support, welfare and activities services.","t":"语言**学院**为学生提供资助、福利和活动服务。"},
50250:{"w":"institution","e":"The Royal Society is a scientific institution that was set up in London in 1660.","t":"英国皇家学会是1660年在伦敦成立的一个科学**协会**。"},
50251:{"w":"branch","e":"You may pay your account at branches of the Federal Bank.","t":"你可以在联邦银行的**分行**支付款项。"},
50252:{"w":"committee","e":"The committee's decisions are often determined by the members' vote.","t":"**委员会**的决议常常由委员投票决定。"},
50253:{"w":"faith","e":"People have to have faith in their ability to carry out the task their boss has set them.","t":"大家必须**相信**自己有能力完成老板布置的任务。"},
50254:{"w":"religion","e":"The speaker explained the relevance of the religion to the local people.","t":"演讲者说明了**宗教**对于当地人的重要意义。"},
50255:{"w":"pray","e":"After months of dry weather, the farmers prayed for rain to save their crops.","t":"经过几个月的干旱，农民们**祈求**下雨来挽救庄稼。"},
50256:{"w":"parallel","e":"The expressway is parallel to the railway.","t":"这条高速公路与铁路**平行**。"},
50257:{"w":"suitable","e":"This medicine is not suitable for children under age 5.","t":"这种药不**适合**五岁以下儿童服用。"},
50258:{"w":"suit","e":"That blue dress really suits you, and it matches your eyes.","t":"那条蓝裙子真**适合**你，和你的眼睛也很相配。"},
50259:{"w":"willing","e":"Would you be willing to attend any of our promotions?","t":"你**愿意**参加我们的任何一个宣传活动吗？"},
50260:{"w":"swift","e":"Beijing has cheap, swift and effective public transport.","t":"北京的公共交通便宜、**快捷**且高效。"},
50261:{"w":"hurry","e":"We must hurry, or we will miss the last bus home.","t":"我们得**赶快**，否则就赶不上回家的末班车了。"},
50262:{"w":"rapid","e":"The town has seen rapid growth since the new railway station opened.","t":"自从新火车站启用以来，这座城镇经历了**快速**增长。"},
50263:{"w":"random","e":"The robots follow their own random paths around the plant busily getting on with their jobs.","t":"机器人在工厂里沿着各自的**随机**路线忙碌地工作着。"},
50264:{"w":"probably","e":"It will probably rain this afternoon, so take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**很可能**会下雨，所以带把伞吧。"},
50265:{"w":"likely","e":"It is likely to rain this afternoon, so you should take an umbrella with you.","t":"今天下午**可能**会下雨，所以你应该带把伞。"},
50266:{"w":"unlike","e":"Unlike his brother, Tom loves quiet evenings at home with a good book.","t":"**不像**他哥哥，汤姆喜欢在家度过安静的夜晚，读一本好书。"},
50267:{"w":"alike","e":"My twin sisters look so alike, but they have very different hobbies and friends.","t":"我的双胞胎妹妹长得非常**相像**，但她们的爱好和朋友很不一样。"},
50268:{"w":"lately","e":"I have not seen Anna in class lately, so I hope she is not ill.","t":"**最近**我在课上没见到安娜，希望她没有生病。"},
50269:{"w":"screen","e":"Everything on the screen interests those children.","t":"那些孩子觉得**屏幕**上的一切都很有趣。"},
50270:{"w":"repair","e":"My father spent the whole afternoon trying to repair our broken washing machine.","t":"我父亲花了整个下午试图**修理**我们坏掉的洗衣机。"},
50271:{"w":"beyond","e":"The small village lies beyond the mountains, about two hours from the city by car.","t":"那个小村庄在山的**那边**，离城市大约两小时车程。"},
50272:{"w":"adequate","e":"Make sure the children get adequate sleep and healthy food during the exam weeks.","t":"考试那几周要确保孩子们有**足够的**睡眠和健康的饮食。"},
50273:{"w":"distribute","e":"The teacher distributed the test papers to the students at exactly nine o'clock.","t":"老师九点整把试卷**分发**给了学生。"},
50274:{"w":"seal","e":"Please seal the envelope and stick an eight-cent stamp on it.","t":"请**封好**信封并贴上一张8分邮票。"},
50275:{"w":"seed","e":"We planted tomato seeds in small pots by the window in early spring.","t":"早春时，我们把番茄**种子**种在窗边的小花盆里。"},
50276:{"w":"sob","e":"The little girl began to sob when she could not find her mother.","t":"小女孩找不到妈妈，开始**抽噎**起来。"},
50277:{"w":"yell","e":"The coach yelled at the players to run faster in the last few minutes of the game.","t":"比赛最后几分钟，教练对着球员们**大喊**，让他们跑快点。"},
50278:{"w":"sigh","e":"She gave a deep sigh when she heard that the trip had been cancelled.","t":"听说旅行被取消了，她深深地**叹了口气**。"},
50279:{"w":"howl","e":"We could hear wolves howl in the distance as night came.","t":"夜幕降临，我们听见远处有狼在**嚎叫**。"},
50280:{"w":"clumsy","e":"He is so clumsy that he often drops his cup on the floor.","t":"他太**笨拙**了，常常把杯子掉在地上。"},
50281:{"w":"deliberately","e":"The boy deliberately hid his sister's shoes to make her laugh.","t":"男孩**故意**把妹妹的鞋藏起来逗她笑。"},
50282:{"w":"accident","e":"Three people were hurt in a traffic accident on the highway last night.","t":"昨晚高速公路上发生了一起交通**事故**，三人受伤。"},
50283:{"w":"incident","e":"The police are asking anyone who saw the incident outside the bank to call them.","t":"警方请所有目睹银行门外那起**事件**的人给他们打电话。"},
50284:{"w":"coincidence","e":"It was pure coincidence that we met on the same train.","t":"我们在同一列火车上遇见纯属**巧合**。"},
50285:{"w":"entire","e":"I was so hungry that I ate the entire pizza.","t":"我饿坏了，把**整个**比萨都吃了。"},
50286:{"w":"thorough","e":"The doctor gave me a thorough check and said there was nothing wrong with my heart.","t":"医生给我做了一次**彻底**的检查，说我的心脏没有任何问题。"},
50287:{"w":"extreme","e":"The extreme cold in the north makes it hard for farmers to grow crops.","t":"北方的**极端**寒冷让农民很难种庄稼。"},
50288:{"w":"extension","e":"The extension of the railway to the north will make the journey an hour shorter.","t":"铁路向北**延伸**，将使行程缩短一小时。"},
50289:{"w":"broad","e":"The river is so broad that it takes the small boat ten minutes to cross.","t":"这条河非常**宽**，小船要花十分钟才能过去。"},
50290:{"w":"enlarge","e":"We decided to enlarge the photo and hang it on the wall.","t":"我们决定把这张照片**放大**，挂在墙上。"},
50291:{"w":"rob","e":"Two men robbed a bank in the city center and escaped in a black car.","t":"两名男子**抢劫**了市中心的一家银行，然后开着一辆黑色汽车逃走了。"},
50292:{"w":"horrible","e":"We watched a horrible film last night, and I could not sleep afterwards.","t":"昨晚我们看了一部**恐怖的**电影，后来我睡不着了。"},
50293:{"w":"scare","e":"The loud thunder scared the little girl, and she ran to her mother.","t":"响亮的雷声把小女孩**吓坏**了，她跑向了妈妈。"},
50294:{"w":"shock","e":"The bad news shocked everyone in the room.","t":"这个坏消息让屋里的每个人都很**震惊**。"},
50295:{"w":"terrible","e":"We had a terrible storm last night, and the power went out.","t":"昨晚我们遇上了一场**可怕的**暴风雨，停电了。"},
50296:{"w":"terrify","e":"Uniforms for the military were originally intended to impress and even terrify the enemy.","t":"穿着军装的最初目的是为了给敌人留下深刻印象甚至是将他们**吓退**。"},
50297:{"w":"terror","e":"The little girl screamed in terror when she saw a big snake in the garden.","t":"小女孩看到花园里有条大蛇，**惊恐**地尖叫起来。"},
50298:{"w":"sort","e":"We need to sort the books by subject before putting them on the shelves.","t":"我们需要先把书按主题**分类**，再把它们放上书架。"},
50299:{"w":"category","e":"The library puts its books into different categories, such as history and science.","t":"图书馆把书分成不同的**种类**，比如历史和科学。"},
50300:{"w":"type","e":"She can type more than sixty words a minute without looking at the keys.","t":"她能不看键盘，一分钟**打字**六十多个。"},
50301:{"w":"typical","e":"A typical day at our school starts with morning exercise at seven o'clock.","t":"我们学校**典型**的一天从七点的早操开始。"},
50302:{"w":"standard","e":"The school sets a high standard for every student's homework.","t":"学校对每个学生的作业都有很高的**标准**。"},
50303:{"w":"criterion","e":"Success in studying at school is not an appropriate criterion of achievement in life.","t":"在学校里学习好并不是衡量人生成就的一个恰当的**标准**。"},
50304:{"w":"ordinary","e":"It was an ordinary day at school until the fire alarm rang.","t":"那天在学校本是**普通**的一天，直到火警铃响了起来。"},
50305:{"w":"extraordinary","e":"She has an extraordinary talent for music and can play five instruments.","t":"她有**非凡的**音乐天赋，会演奏五种乐器。"},
50306:{"w":"outstanding","e":"She was given a prize for her outstanding work in helping poor children.","t":"她因在帮助贫困儿童方面的**杰出**工作而获奖。"},
50307:{"w":"magic","e":"There's no real magic in the world.","t":"这世界上没有真正的**魔法**。"},
50308:{"w":"ridiculous","e":"The fat old man looked ridiculous in his tight pink trousers.","t":"那个胖老头穿着粉色的紧身裤，显得**滑稽可笑**。"},
50309:{"w":"principle","e":"My father taught me an important principle: always tell the truth, even when it is difficult.","t":"父亲教给我一条重要的**原则**：永远说真话，即使这很难。"},
50310:{"w":"alcohol","e":"Doctors say that drinking too much alcohol is bad for both your body and your mind.","t":"医生说，摄入过多**酒精**对身体和精神都有害。"},
50311:{"w":"mood","e":"She was in a good mood all day because her best friend was coming to visit.","t":"她一整天**心情**都很好，因为她最好的朋友要来看她。"},
50312:{"w":"journalist","e":"The young journalist traveled to the small village to report on the flood.","t":"这位年轻的**记者**前往那个小村庄报道洪灾。"},
50313:{"w":"photographer","e":"The photographer asked us to stand closer together.","t":"**摄影师**让我们站得再靠近一些。"},
50314:{"w":"media","e":"Social media has changed the way young people get news about the world.","t":"社交**媒体**改变了年轻人获取世界新闻的方式。"},
50315:{"w":"press","e":"Press the green button to start the machine.","t":"**按**下绿色按钮，启动机器。"},
50316:{"w":"pressure","e":"Students often feel great pressure before important exams.","t":"重要考试前，学生们常常感到巨大的**压力**。"},
50317:{"w":"burden","e":"Looking after three young children alone is a heavy burden for the young mother.","t":"独自照顾三个孩子，对这位年轻妈妈来说是个**重担**。"},
50318:{"w":"rough","e":"I only have a rough idea where the park is, so I need a map.","t":"我只**粗略**知道公园在哪里，所以需要一张地图。"},
50319:{"w":"tough","e":"It was a tough match, but our team never gave up.","t":"那是一场**艰苦**的比赛，但我们队从不放弃。"},
50320:{"w":"insist","e":"My mother insisted that I wear a coat because it was very cold outside.","t":"外面很冷，妈妈**坚持**要我穿上外套。"},
50321:{"w":"swear","e":"Before giving evidence, you must swear what you're going to say is true.","t":"作证前，你必须**宣誓**保证所说一切皆属实。"},
50322:{"w":"suppose","e":"I suppose you're going to tell me the whole history of banana growing now, aren't you?","t":"我**猜**你是打算现在给我讲解香蕉种植的整个历史，对吗？"},
50323:{"w":"guess","e":"Can you guess how old my grandmother is?","t":"你能**猜**出我奶奶多大年纪吗？"},
50324:{"w":"assume","e":"I assumed you knew about the party, so I didn't send you an invitation.","t":"我**假定**你知道这个聚会，所以没有给你发请帖。"},
50325:{"w":"assumption","e":"The assumption has been shown to be incorrect by recent research.","t":"最近的研究证明这一**假设**不正确。"},
50326:{"w":"theory","e":"Tom once put forward an attractive though unlikely theory.","t":"汤姆曾经提出一个具有吸引力但不太可能的**理论**。"},
50327:{"w":"theoretical","e":"In the first year students take theoretical courses.","t":"第一年，学生学习**理论**课。"},
50328:{"w":"describe","e":"The lecturer describes four processes which may contribute to the extinction of a species.","t":"演讲者**描述**了可能导致一个物种灭绝的四个过程。"},
50329:{"w":"description","e":"Please write a short description of your best friend in about fifty words.","t":"请用大约五十个词写一段对你最好朋友的**描述**。"},
50330:{"w":"urge","e":"The doctor urged him to stop smoking and to take more exercise.","t":"医生**催促**他戒烟，多做运动。"},
50331:{"w":"urgent","e":"His car is in urgent need of repair.","t":"他的汽车**急需**修理。"},
50332:{"w":"tense","e":"The players looked tense before the final game began.","t":"决赛开始前，队员们看上去很**紧张**。"},
50333:{"w":"tension","e":"There was a lot of tension in the room before the results came out.","t":"成绩公布前，房间里充满了**紧张**的气氛。"},
50334:{"w":"emergency","e":"If it's an emergency, you can phone at any time.","t":"如果发生**紧急情况**，你可以随时来电。"},
50335:{"w":"immigration","e":"There will be stricter controls on immigration into the country.","t":"以后要**移民**到这个国家会面临更严格的管制。"},
50336:{"w":"journey","e":"The train journey from Beijing to Shanghai now takes only about five hours.","t":"从北京到上海的火车**旅程**现在只需要大约五个小时。"},
50337:{"w":"luggage","e":"Please put your luggage on the shelf above your seat before the train leaves.","t":"火车开动前，请把**行李**放在座位上方的架子上。"},
50338:{"w":"destination","e":"The tourists rest there and then go to various destinations.","t":"游客们在那里稍事休息，然后去往不同的**目的地**。"},
50339:{"w":"adventure","e":"Traveling alone across the desert was the greatest adventure of my uncle's life.","t":"独自穿越沙漠是我叔叔一生中最大的**冒险**。"},
50340:{"w":"necessary","e":"It is necessary to wear a helmet when you ride a bike.","t":"骑自行车时戴头盔是**必要的**。"},
50341:{"w":"content","e":"The content of this book is easy to understand, so it suits beginners.","t":"这本书的**内容**很容易懂，所以适合初学者。"},
50342:{"w":"concept","e":"The concept of health holds different meanings for different people and groups.","t":"健康**观念**因人和群体的不同而不同。"},
50343:{"w":"correspond","e":"This person's characteristics correspond with the witness' description.","t":"这个人的特征与证人的描述**相符**。"},
50344:{"w":"conflict","e":"Conflicts between neighbours are often caused by noise.","t":"邻居之间的**冲突**常常是由噪音引起的。"},
50345:{"w":"battle","e":"The battle lasted three days, and both sides lost many men.","t":"这场**战斗**持续了三天，双方都损失惨重。"},
50346:{"w":"war","e":"The war lasted for six years and changed the lives of millions of people.","t":"这场**战争**持续了六年，改变了数百万人的生活。"},
50347:{"w":"collision","e":"Nobody was hurt in the collision between the bus and the truck this morning.","t":"今天早上公交车和卡车发生了**碰撞**，但没有人受伤。"},
50348:{"w":"crash","e":"The two cars crashed into each other.","t":"两辆汽车猛烈**相撞**。"},
50349:{"w":"oppose","e":"Some environmentalists have opposed economic development of any kind.","t":"一些环保主义者**反对**任何形式的经济发展。"},
50350:{"w":"opposite","e":"The shop is on the opposite side of the street.","t":"那家商店在街道的**对面**。"},
50351:{"w":"offence","e":"Driving after drinking is a serious offence that can lead to prison in many countries.","t":"在许多国家，酒后驾车是严重的**犯罪**行为，可能会让人坐牢。"},
50352:{"w":"disturb","e":"Please do not disturb me while I am doing my homework.","t":"我做作业的时候，请不要**打扰**我。"},
50353:{"w":"bother","e":"I'm sorry to bother you so early, Mrs Smith.","t":"史密斯女士，很抱歉这么早就来**打扰**您。"},
50354:{"w":"boom","e":"Online shopping has enjoyed a boom in China over the past ten years.","t":"过去十年，中国的网购迎来了一轮**繁荣**。"},
50355:{"w":"explode","e":"The firework exploded in the sky with a loud bang.","t":"烟花在空中**爆炸**，发出一声巨响。"},
50356:{"w":"expand","e":"The company plans to expand its business to other countries next year.","t":"这家公司计划明年向其他国家**扩张**业务。"},
50357:{"w":"expose","e":"Doctors warn that you should not expose your skin to strong sunlight for too long.","t":"医生提醒，皮肤不要在强烈的阳光下**暴露**太久。"},
50358:{"w":"multiply","e":"If you multiply four by five, you get twenty.","t":"如果你把四**乘**以五，就得到二十。"},
50359:{"w":"erupt","e":"The volcano erupted without warning, and people ran away.","t":"火山毫无预兆地**喷发**了，人们四散奔逃。"},
50360:{"w":"struggle","e":"Millions of people are struggling for survival.","t":"数百万人为了生存而**奋斗**。"},
50361:{"w":"rescue","e":"Several school children were rescued from the burning building.","t":"几名小学生被从燃烧的大楼里成功**救出**。"},
50362:{"w":"dilemma","e":"She faced a dilemma: take the well-paid job in another city or stay near her family.","t":"她陷入了**两难境地**：是去外地接受那份高薪工作，还是留在家人身边。"},
50363:{"w":"breakthrough","e":"Scientists have made a major breakthrough in the fight against the disease.","t":"科学家在抗击这种疾病方面取得了重大**突破**。"},
50364:{"w":"evolution","e":"Darwin's theory of evolution changed the way people think about animals.","t":"达尔文的**进化**论改变了人们对动物的看法。"},
50365:{"w":"revolution","e":"Acid rain in fact started around the time of the industrial revolution of the 19th century.","t":"酸雨实际上是在19世纪工业**革命**时期开始出现的。"},
50366:{"w":"march","e":"The soldiers began to march across the bridge at dawn.","t":"黎明时分，士兵们开始**行军**过桥。"},
50367:{"w":"wander","e":"They enjoyed wandering in this old town.","t":"他们喜欢在这个古镇上**闲逛**。"},
50368:{"w":"pace","e":"Life in big cities moves at a fast pace, and people are always busy.","t":"大城市的生活**节奏**很快，人们总是很忙。"},
50369:{"w":"trend","e":"In your opinion, will this trend continue into the future?","t":"依你看，这种**趋势**在未来还会继续吗？"},
50370:{"w":"speed","e":"The train travels at a speed of 300 kilometres an hour.","t":"这列火车以每小时300公里的**速度**行驶。"},
50371:{"w":"rate","e":"Prices in this city are rising at a rate that worries many young families.","t":"这座城市的物价正以令许多年轻家庭担忧的**速度**上涨。"},
50372:{"w":"pity","e":"She felt great pity for the lost dog and took it home.","t":"她对那只走失的狗十分**同情**，就把它带回了家。"},
50373:{"w":"mercy","e":"The soldiers showed no mercy to their enemies and burned the whole village.","t":"士兵们对敌人毫不**仁慈**，烧毁了整个村庄。"},
50374:{"w":"skip","e":"She skips the difficult words when she reads English novels.","t":"看英文小说时她经常**跳过**难词。"},
50375:{"w":"scan","e":"Customers at some banks will have to present their faces for scanning before they can enter the building.","t":"某些银行需要客户经过面部**扫描**才可以进入。"},
50376:{"w":"sweep","e":"Please sweep the floor before the guests arrive.","t":"客人到达之前，请把地板**打扫**干净。"},
50377:{"w":"publish","e":"Her first novel was published when she was only nineteen years old.","t":"她的第一部小说**出版**时她才十九岁。"},
50378:{"w":"edition","e":"The new edition of this dictionary includes thousands of words connected with the internet.","t":"这本词典的新**版本**收录了数千个和互联网有关的词。"},
50379:{"w":"editor","e":"My sister works as an editor for a popular newspaper in Shanghai.","t":"我姐姐在上海一家很受欢迎的报社当**编辑**。"},
50380:{"w":"print","e":"Please print this report and bring it to the meeting.","t":"请把这份报告**打印**出来，带到会上。"},
50381:{"w":"draft","e":"You must think a great deal before you start writing your draft.","t":"你在开始打**草稿**之前一定要考虑周全。"},
50382:{"w":"exhibition","e":"We visited an art exhibition at the city museum last weekend.","t":"上周末我们参观了市博物馆的一个艺术**展览**。"},
50383:{"w":"tutor","e":"Jane tutored this little girl in English.","t":"简给这个小女孩当英文**家教**。"},
50384:{"w":"seize","e":"You should seize the chance to study abroad if you get one.","t":"如果有出国留学的机会，你就应该**抓住**它。"},
50385:{"w":"hug","e":"She gave her mother an affectionate hug after winning the prize.","t":"获奖后，她紧紧地**拥抱**了母亲。"},
50386:{"w":"fold","e":"He decided to fold up Phoebe's massage table.","t":"他决定把菲比的按摩桌**折叠**起来。"},
50387:{"w":"tear","e":"He tore the letter in half and threw it away.","t":"他把信**撕**成两半，扔掉了。"},
50388:{"w":"bend","e":"Bend your knees when you pick up heavy boxes.","t":"搬重箱子时，要**弯曲**膝盖。"},
50389:{"w":"roll","e":"The ball rolled down the hill and into the river.","t":"球**滚**下山坡，掉进了河里。"},
50390:{"w":"shrink","e":"Employees found their time on the job shrinking to 8 hours daily.","t":"雇员们发现他们的工作时间已经**减少**到每天八小时。"},
50391:{"w":"split","e":"Let's split the cake into six equal pieces.","t":"我们把蛋糕**切**成六块一样大的吧。"},
50392:{"w":"dip","e":"He dipped a piece of bread into the hot soup before putting it in his mouth.","t":"他把一块面包在热汤里**蘸了蘸**，然后放进嘴里。"},
50393:{"w":"leak","e":"The roof began to leak during the storm, and water dripped onto the floor.","t":"暴风雨中屋顶开始**漏水**，水滴到了地板上。"},
50394:{"w":"float","e":"A piece of wood will float on water, but a stone sinks to the bottom.","t":"木头会**漂浮**在水面上，而石头会沉到水底。"},
50395:{"w":"liquid","e":"Water, milk and oil are all liquids, but they do not mix in the same way.","t":"水、牛奶和油都是**液体**，但它们混合的情况不一样。"},
50396:{"w":"flood","e":"The heavy rain caused a flood that cut off several villages for days.","t":"大雨引发了**洪水**，几个村子好几天与外界隔绝。"},
50397:{"w":"stream","e":"The leaves were washed by rain into streams and rivers.","t":"树叶被雨水冲进了**小溪**与河流中。"},
50398:{"w":"steam","e":"The old train is powered by a steam engine.","t":"老式火车由**蒸汽**机驱动。"},
50399:{"w":"steel","e":"This bridge is made of steel, so it is strong enough for heavy trucks.","t":"这座桥是**钢**做的，所以足够结实，能通过重型卡车。"},
50400:{"w":"freeze","e":"The lake freezes every winter, so we can skate on it.","t":"这个湖每年冬天都会**结冰**，所以我们可以在上面滑冰。"},
50401:{"w":"pure","e":"The ring is made of pure gold, so it is quite expensive.","t":"这枚戒指是**纯**金做的，所以相当贵。"},
50402:{"w":"polish","e":"He polished his shoes carefully before going to the job interview.","t":"去面试之前，他仔细地把皮鞋**擦亮**了。"},
50403:{"w":"fancy","e":"Maureen tiptoed around the room in her fancy shoes.","t":"莫林穿上她那双**精致**的鞋，踮着脚尖在房间里走来走去。"},
50404:{"w":"fantasy","e":"As a child, she lived in a world of fantasy full of dragons and magic.","t":"小时候，她生活在一个充满龙和魔法的**幻想**世界里。"},
50405:{"w":"fantastic","e":"Kids like spending a great deal of pocket money on fantastic toys instead of useful books.","t":"孩子们喜欢花大量的零花钱购买**奇特**的玩具，而不是有用的书籍。"},
50406:{"w":"audience","e":"The audience clapped loudly when the young pianist finished playing the last piece.","t":"年轻的钢琴家弹完最后一首曲子时，**听众**热烈鼓掌。"},
50407:{"w":"witness","e":"Tom witnessed the accident.","t":"汤姆**目睹**了那起意外事故。"},
50408:{"w":"visual","e":"The exhibition of London Museum is largely visual, with a huge number of items on show.","t":"伦敦博物馆的展览以**视觉**展示为主，展出了大量物品。"},
50409:{"w":"mild","e":"The thief just got a mild punishment.","t":"小偷只受到了**轻微**的惩罚。"},
50410:{"w":"dull","e":"We all think his tutorial topic is dull.","t":"我们都认为他的辅导主题令人**乏味**。"},
50411:{"w":"ceremony","e":"The graduation ceremony in many universities is an important occasion.","t":"在很多大学，毕业**典礼**都是重要的场合。"},
50412:{"w":"anniversary","e":"My parents went out for a special dinner to celebrate their twentieth wedding anniversary.","t":"我父母出去吃了一顿特别的晚餐，庆祝他们结婚二十**周年**。"},
50413:{"w":"monument","e":"A monument was built in the town square to remember the soldiers who died in the war.","t":"镇广场上建了一座**纪念碑**，纪念在战争中牺牲的士兵。"},
50414:{"w":"dynasty","e":"The Great Wall was rebuilt during the Ming Dynasty to protect the country.","t":"长城在明**王朝**时期得到重建，用来保卫国家。"},
50415:{"w":"generation","e":"Three generations of my family live together in this old house.","t":"我家有三**代**人一起住在这所老房子里。"},
50416:{"w":"chew","e":"Rats like to chew on something hard.","t":"老鼠喜欢**咀嚼**硬物。"},
50417:{"w":"choke","e":"The thick smoke from the fire almost choked the people trapped in the building.","t":"大火冒出的浓烟差点让困在楼里的人**窒息**。"},
50418:{"w":"nutrition","e":"Females are more conscious of food nutrition.","t":"女性更关注食品**营养**。"},
50419:{"w":"appetite","e":"My supper by this time was cold, and my appetite was gone.","t":"我的晚餐这时候已经凉了，我也没**胃口**了。"},
50420:{"w":"digest","e":"Chemists were searching for a fat that could be digested more easily by infants.","t":"药剂师们正在寻找一种婴儿能更容易**消化**的脂肪。"},
50421:{"w":"disgust","e":"Many people looked at the dirty kitchen with disgust and refused to eat there.","t":"许多人**厌恶**地看着脏兮兮的厨房，拒绝在那里吃饭。"},
50422:{"w":"tasty","e":"This soup is really tasty, so I'd like another bowl.","t":"这汤**味道很好**，我想再来一碗。"},
50423:{"w":"tasteless","e":"The soup was almost tasteless, so I added some salt.","t":"这汤几乎**没有味道**，所以我加了点盐。"},
50424:{"w":"bitter","e":"The coffee was so bitter that I had to add some sugar.","t":"咖啡太**苦**了，我只好加点糖。"},
50425:{"w":"salty","e":"The soup is too salty, so please do not add any more salt.","t":"这汤太**咸**了，请不要再加盐了。"},
50426:{"w":"sour","e":"The milk has turned sour because I forgot to put it in the fridge.","t":"牛奶**变酸**了，因为我忘了把它放进冰箱。"},
50427:{"w":"starve","e":"Thousands of people starved during the war.","t":"战争中，成千上万的人**饿死**。"},
50428:{"w":"interpret","e":"Could you interpret this poem for me? I cannot see what the writer means.","t":"你能给我**解释**一下这首诗吗？我看不懂作者想表达什么。"},
50429:{"w":"translate","e":"The name of the weapon was directly translated from Chinese.","t":"这种武器的名字是从汉语直接**翻译**过来的。"},
50430:{"w":"diploma","e":"Tim got a diploma at a private college.","t":"蒂姆拿到了一所私立学院的**毕业证书**。"},
50431:{"w":"certificate","e":"After the course, every student will receive a certificate to prove their skills.","t":"课程结束后，每位学生都会收到一张证明其技能的**证书**。"},
50432:{"w":"degree","e":"The temperature dropped by ten degrees overnight, so we wore thick coats.","t":"夜里气温下降了十**度**，所以我们穿上了厚外套。"},
50433:{"w":"maximum","e":"Students on a visitor visa or work permit may study for a maximum of 3 months.","t":"持旅行签证或工作许可证的学生**最多**可有三个月的学习时间。"},
50434:{"w":"minimum","e":"The minimum speed on the freeway is 45 km/h.","t":"这条高速公路上的**最低**时速为45公里。"},
50435:{"w":"minus","e":"Every child in the class knows that ten minus four equals six.","t":"班上每个孩子都知道十**减去**四等于六。"},
50436:{"w":"medium","e":"Mary uses the medium of poetry to make her ideas known.","t":"玛丽使用诗歌这一**媒介**来表达思想。"},
50437:{"w":"furnish","e":"You can get free advice on furnishing your home from the interior designer.","t":"你可以从室内设计师那儿免费获得关于家居**装潢**的建议。"},
50438:{"w":"debt","e":"It took him five years to pay off all his debts after he lost his job.","t":"他失业后花了五年时间才还清所有**债务**。"},
50439:{"w":"owe","e":"I owed the bank rather a lot of money a few years ago.","t":"几年前，我**欠**了银行一大笔钱。"},
50440:{"w":"deposit","e":"I went to the bank to deposit the money I got on my birthday.","t":"我去银行把生日时收到的钱**存入**了账户。"},
50441:{"w":"insure","e":"Before driving the new car, you must insure it against accidents and theft.","t":"开新车之前，你必须给它**投保**，以防事故和盗窃。"},
50442:{"w":"compensate","e":"Nothing can compensate for the loss of one's health.","t":"失去的健康是无法**弥补**的。"},
50443:{"w":"currency","e":"Before the trip, I changed some money into the local currency at the bank.","t":"出发前，我在银行把一些钱换成了当地**货币**。"},
50444:{"w":"fare","e":"According to Susan, air fares are the lowest.","t":"据苏珊说，机票**价格**是最便宜的。"},
50445:{"w":"fee","e":"The school has raised its fee for next year by ten percent, which worries many parents.","t":"学校把明年的**费用**提高了百分之十，这让很多家长很担心。"},
50446:{"w":"wealth","e":"He gained great wealth by running a small online shop for ten years.","t":"他经营一家小网店十年，积累了大量**财富**。"},
50447:{"w":"wealthy","e":"Some people hold the view that wealthy nations should share their wealth with poorer nations by providing such things as food and education.","t":"有些人认为**富**国应该与穷国分享它们的财富，比如提供食物和教育等。"},
50448:{"w":"bless","e":"Before the wedding, the old priest blessed the young couple and wished them a happy life.","t":"婚礼前，老牧师为这对年轻夫妇**祝福**，祝愿他们生活幸福。"},
50449:{"w":"pale","e":"She looked pale and tired after staying up all night to study.","t":"熬夜学习了一整晚后，她看起来脸色**苍白**，很疲惫。"},
50450:{"w":"mourn","e":"The whole country mourned the death of the great scientist.","t":"全国人民都在**哀悼**这位伟大科学家的逝世。"},
50451:{"w":"sorrow","e":"Carolyn's eyes filled with sorrow at thinking of how she had treated Kevin and lost him forever.","t":"想到自己那样对待凯文并永远地失去了他，卡罗琳的眼中充满了**悲伤**。"},
50452:{"w":"bury","e":"Some birds bury their eggs under the ground.","t":"有些鸟将自己的蛋**埋**在地下。"},
50453:{"w":"funeral","e":"Many friends and neighbors came to the old man's funeral to say goodbye.","t":"许多朋友和邻居来参加老人的**葬礼**，向他告别。"},
50454:{"w":"tomb","e":"Visitors from all over the world come to see the ancient tomb every year.","t":"每年都有世界各地的游客来参观这座古老的**坟墓**。"},
50455:{"w":"weep","e":"The old woman began to weep when she heard that her son was safe after the earthquake.","t":"听说儿子在地震后平安无事，老太太激动得**流泪**了。"},
50456:{"w":"scream","e":"The students screamed in excitement.","t":"学生们激动得**尖叫**起来。"},
50457:{"w":"whistle","e":"This is where you whistle so the key holder will open the door for you.","t":"你在这里**吹口哨**，这样看门人就会给你开门。"},
50458:{"w":"cast","e":"The whole cast of the play came onto the stage to thank the audience.","t":"这部剧的**全体演员**都走上舞台向观众致谢。"},
50459:{"w":"wipe","e":"Please wipe the table with a wet cloth before we have dinner.","t":"吃饭前请用湿布**擦**一下桌子。"},
50460:{"w":"fasten","e":"The driver must fasten his seat belt before driving.","t":"司机在开车前必须**系好**安全带。"},
50461:{"w":"shade","e":"We sat in the shade of a big tree to escape the afternoon sun.","t":"我们坐在一棵大树的**树荫**下，躲避午后的阳光。"},
50462:{"w":"shabby","e":"He wore a shabby old coat, but he always looked tidy and clean.","t":"他穿着一件**破旧的**外套，但看起来总是整洁干净。"},
50463:{"w":"worn","e":"The carpet is so worn that we need to buy a new one.","t":"这块地毯太**破旧**了，我们得买块新的。"},
50464:{"w":"tiresome","e":"After a tiresome journey of ten hours, we were all glad to reach the hotel.","t":"经过十个小时**令人疲劳**的旅程，我们到达旅馆时都很高兴。"},
50465:{"w":"perfume","e":"She bought a bottle of perfume for her mother's birthday.","t":"她给妈妈买了一瓶**香水**当生日礼物。"},
50466:{"w":"addicted","e":"He is addicted to computer games and plays them every night.","t":"他对电脑游戏**上瘾**，每天晚上都玩。"},
50467:{"w":"abrupt","e":"The car came to an abrupt stop at the red light.","t":"汽车在红灯前**突然**停了下来。"},
50468:{"w":"absurd","e":"Wearing a swimming suit during a snowstorm is absurd.","t":"在暴风雪中穿泳装可真**荒唐**。"},
50469:{"w":"astonish","e":"The news astonished everyone.","t":"这个消息使所有人**大吃一惊**。"}
});
